lābhārtheyaditatkuryādviṣṇumaṃtraṃvinaivahi praṇavādyaṃnadātavyaṃmaṃtraṃśūdrāyasarvathā ātmamaṃ
traṃgurormaṃtraṃmaṃtraṃcājapasaṃjñakam ātmakaulikamaṃtraṃcanaivadadyātmakācana gopālasyama
nurdeyomaheśasyāpipādaje tatpatnyāṃcāpisūryasyagaṇeśasyamanustathā eṣādīkṣādikā

pṛ0 6a) rīsyādanyathāpāpabhāgbhavet taduktaṃtaṃtrarāje pustakelikhitāvidyāyenasuṃdarijapyate na-
jāyatetasyasiddhirhānirevaprajāyate itiśrīāgamakalpalatāyāṃdvitīyaḥpaṭalaḥ 2 oṃnamaḥ
śivāya guruścātmaviśuddhyarthaṃśiṣyāṃstupariśodhayet avdhakenabhavedyogyovrāhmaṇovṛddhayānnṛ
paḥ vaiśyovarṣaistribhiḥśūdraḥcaturbhirvatsaraiḥsadā śiṣyeṇāpitathākāryaṃsvakāyābhīṣṭasiddha 
ye ādaumṛgya**ścasevyaścajñeyaścābhīṣṭamicchatā gururitiśeṣaḥ tathācagautamīye śubhehnisnā
namācaryanamaskuryādgaṇeśvaram sūryaṃśivaṃhariṃdurgāṃvāṇīṃcakamalālayāṃ mātaṃrapitaraṃna
tvāvrāhmaṇānparitoṣyaca phalaṃpuṣpaṃsumaṃgalyaṃgṛhītvābhaktisaṃyutaḥ puruṣārthasamāvāptyaisa
cchiṣyogurumāśrayet ātmavijñāpanaṃkṛtvāpitṛmātṛkulānvitam gurutvenaivasaṃvodhyapra
ṇameddaṃḍavadbhuvi guroragresamutthāyapuṭāṃjalikarasthitaḥ vicārayamahābāhomaddhitaṃmaṃtra
varyakam gururvicārayetpaścāddeyamaṃtrāṃścayatnataḥ evaṃca svatārarāśikoṣṭānāmanukūlaṃ
bhajenmanum evaṃṛṇamaṃtraṃnagṛhṇīyādakulaṃcatathaivacetyādivacanātcakravicārasyāvaśya
katvātprathamaṃtannirūpyate athavakṣyevicāraṃcacakrāṇāṃsiddhihetave ādaukulākulaṃcakramaka
thākhyaṃdvitīyakam tṛtīyamṛṇadhanākhyaṃcaturthaṃvargasaṃjñakam paṃcamaṃrāśicakraṃsyātṣaṣṭaṃ
nakṣattracakrakam saptamaṃgaṇacakraṃsyādaṣṭamamagadakaṃsmṛtaṃ navamamuditaṃcakraṃdaśamaṃnāḍi

pṛ0 6ba) kāhvayam krameṇāha śāradātilake kāraṇātpaṃcabhūtānāmudbhūtāmātṛkāyataḥ atobhū
tātmakāvarṇāḥpaṃcaviṃśativibhāgataḥ vāyvagnibhūjalākāśāḥpaṃcāśallipayaḥkramāt paṃca
hrasvāḥpaṃcadīrghāḥviṃdvantāḥsaṃdhisaṃbhavāḥ paṃcaśaḥkādayāṣakṣalasahāṃtāḥsamīritāḥsvanamā
dya kṣarāṇāṃtumitraṃvāsvakulaṃvaraṃ paṃcapaṃcetyādidaśavarṇāityarthaḥ vāyvagnītyādi āeka
caṭatapayathāḥmārutāḥ iīaikhachaṭhathapharakṣāḥ āgneyaḥ uūogajaḍadabalalāḥ pārthi
vāḥ ṝovajhaḍhadhabhavamā vāruṇāḥ ḷḹaṃṅajaṇanamaśaha nābhasāḥ paṃcahrasvā
itiiuṛḷ paṃcadīrghāḥāīūṛḹ viṃdvaṃtā itibiṃduraṃteyasyatenaaṃityarthaḥ etena
visargasyānnupayogolavdhāḥ tathācapiṃgalāmṛte maṃtrasādhakayorāyovarṇaḥsyātpārthivo
yadi tatkulaṃtasyatatproktamevamanyeṣulakṣayet saṃdhisaṃbhaveti eaioau svanāmādyeti
ekatrobhayāvasthāne..kulaṃ taduktaṃvārāhītatre sādhakasyākṣaraṃpūrvaṃmaṃtraṃsyāpitathākṣaraṃ
yadyekabhūtadaivatyaṃjānīyātsvakulaṃhitat mitramiti parasparamaitraṃ taduktaṃnārāyaṇīye pā
rthivevāruṇemaitramāgneyasyāpimārutaṃ pārthivānāmakṣaraṇāṃśakratvemārutaṃsthitaṃ āgneyā
syāmbhasāṃśakraraṃbhasaḥtaijasaṃsmṛtam eteṣāmevasarveṣāmavirodhenabhāsvaram paraspara
viruddhānāṃnakuryānmelanaṃkvacit uktaṃkulokulaṃcakraṃsamastapuruṣārthadam vakṣyeakatha

pṛ0 7a) hacakraṃprāṅlikheccaturaśrakaṃ madhyerekhādvayaṃdadyātprāgagrāmudagagragām caturaśraṃbhavetta
tracatuṣkoṣṭasamanvitam pūrvāparāyatāṃdadyānmadhyarekhādvayaṃtataḥ tadādakṣiṇadīrghāṃcada
dyādrokhādvayaṃvudhaḥ tataḥṣoḍaśakoṣṭāḍhāṃjāyatecakravaryakam ādikṣāṃtaṃlikhedvarṇānkra
meṇānenamaṃtravit piṃgalāmṛte indvagnirudranavanetrayugārkadikṣaṃṛtvaṣṭaṣoḍaśacatu
rdaśabhotikeṣu pātālapaṃcadaśavahnihimāṃśukoṣṭevarṇāṃllikhellikhellipibhavānkrama
śastudhīmān nāmādyakṣaramārabhyayāvanmaṃtrādyamakṣaraṃ caturbhiḥkoṣṭairekaikamitikoṣṭaca
tuṣṭayam punaḥkoṣṭakakoṣṭeṣusavyatitidakṣiṇataḥ tathācaviśvasāre dakṣiṇāvartayo
genakoṣṭavarṇāllikhetkramāt yenaivalikhanaṃkuryāttenaivagaṇanaṃsmṛtaṃ savyatonāmnā
ditaḥ siddhaḥsādhyāsusiddhoriḥ kramājñjñeyāvicakṣaṇaiḥ siddhaḥsidhyatikālenamādyastujapa
homataḥsusiddhogrataṇādevaripurmūlaṃnikṛṃtatisiddhārṇāvāṃdhavājñeyāsādhyāsteseva
kāḥsmṛtāḥsusiddhaḥpoṣakāproktāḥrātravodyātakāḥsmṛtāḥjapenabaṃdhuḥsiddhaḥsyātme
vakodhikasevayā puṣṇātipoṣakobhīṣṭaṃcātakonāśayeddhruvam siddhasiddhoyathoktena
dviguṇātsiddhasādhyakaḥsiddhaḥsusiddhordhajayātsiddhārirhantivāṃdhavān sādhyasusi
ddhodviguṇakaḥsādhyasādhyonirarthakaḥsādhyasusiddhordhajapātsādhyārirhaṃtigotrajān

pṛ0 7ba) siddhasusiddhordhajapāttatsādhyodviguṇādhikāḥ grahaṇāttatsusiddhastususiddhoriḥsvagotrahā
arisiddhaḥsutaṃhanyādarisādhyastukanyakāṃ patnīmarisusiddhastuaryarinmūlacātakaḥ iti
akathahacakram athoṛṇadhanaṃvakṣyecakraṃvarṇāṅkasaṃyutaṃ taduktaṃtaṃtrarāje kathamṛṇītvaṃ
maṃtrāṇāṃsādhakānāṃcamevada pūrvajanmakṛtābhyāsājjapādasyāphalāptikṛt pāpenaṣṭā
phalavāptiḥkāledehakṣayādṛṇī maṃtraḥsaṃprāptimātreṇaprākpūtaḥsiddhayebhavet siddhamaṃtrā
ngurorlavdhāmaṃtrīyaḥsiddhibhāṅnaraḥlakṣmīmatāsarvapūjyomaṃtrabhogamavāptavān samaṃtrasyṛ
ṇījñeyobhajanaṃtasyapūrvagam tasmādṛṇaviśuddhistukāryāsarvaistusarvadā tathācāgamaka
lpakrame pūrvāparaṃdvādaśasaṃkhyasūtraṃyāmyottarasthaṃcatathācatuṣkam dvaudvausvaropaṃcasukoṣṭa
keṣuśeṣānsvarānṣaṭsuṣaḍekamekaṃ kādīnhaśeṣānvilikhettatorṇānaikaikamekāda
śasusthaleṣu iṃdrakṣātetraravipaṃcadaśartuvedavahnyāyudhāṣṭanavabhirguṇitāṃsādhyān di
gbhūgiriśrutigajāgnimunīṣuvedaṣaḍvahnibhiścaguṇitānathasādhakāṅkān iṃdrādibhi
rgajahṛtairgaṇitaiḥsvakoṣṭaisādhyaṃcasādhakalipiṃcadigādibhiśca nāmājhu**lādakaṭhavā
dgajabhuktaśeṣaṃjñātvobhayoradhikaśeṣamṛṇaṃdhanaṃsyāt asyārthaḥyasminkoṣṭesādhyasādha
kayoraṅkaṃdṛśyatetatkoṣṭasthitāṅkaṃgṛhasaṃkhyākaiḥpūrayitvāṣṭubhiḥbhāgamāharet sarvatra

pṛ0 8a) haraṇamaṣṭabhirevahārakābhāvātsaptaparyaṃtāvasthānaṃṣaṭkālakālitivacanadvaṃ**yaṃsi
ddhāṅkapradarśakamitiniṣkarṣaḥ prakārāṃtaramāha tathācasuṃdarīrahasyavṛttau pūrvāparā
yataṃlekhyaṃrekhādvādaśakaṃkramāt krameṇaivātrajāyaṃtekoṣṭānyekādaśakramāt teṣuva
rṇāllikhenmaṃtrīsvarādikramayogataḥ dvaudvausvaraupaṃcasukoṣṭakeṣuśeṣānsvarāṣaṭsuṣa-
ḍekamekaṃ kādīnahaśeṣānvilikhettatorṇānekaikamekādaśamātrakeṣu sādhyāṅkā**nvi
likhedūrdhvesādhakāṅkānadholikhet iṃdrakṣanetretyādi maṃtrīyayadhikāṅkaḥsyāttadāmaṃtraṃ
japetsudhīḥ samepicajapenmaṃtrīnājapetuṛṇādhike guṇitetukṛtāṅkānāṃyaccheṣaṃjā
jayatesphuṭam tadaṃkaṃkathayāmyatradvādaśāgārasaṃsthitaṃ ṣaṭkālakālaviyadagnisamudra
vedanāyākāśaśūnyadahanāḥkhalusādhyavarṇāḥ yugmadvipaṃcaviyadaṃbarayuktaśāṅkavyomā
vdhivedaśaśinaḥkhalusārakāṇāḥ anyatprakāramāha koṣṭānyekādaśānyevavedenapūri
tānica akārādihakārāṃtaṃlikhetkoṣṭeṣutatvavit prathamaṃpaṃcakoṣṭeṣuhrasvadīrghakra
meṇatu dvayaṃdvayaṃlikhettatravicārerākhalusādhakaḥ śeṣeṣvekaikaśovarṇāvarṇānkramaśa
stulikhetsudhīḥ ṣaṭkālakāletyādi asyārthaḥ sādhyavarṇānsvaravyaṃjanarūpeṇapṛthak
kṛtānṣaṭkaṃkādyaṅkairguṇitānkṛtvātathāsādhakanāmākṣarānpuramādyairaṃkairguṇayitvāṣṭasaṃ

pṛ0 8ba) khyābhirhṛtvāubhayoścasādhyasādhakayoḥśeṣasyādhikarūpasyṛṇaṃdhanaṃjñātvāmaṃtraṃdadyāt maṃ
traścedṛṇībhavatitadāśubhadāyakobhavati dhanīcenna iṃdrakṣanetretyādi nāmājdhu**lādivaca
naṃtuviṣṇuviṣaṣaṃ rāmārcanacaṃdrikādṛtatvāt prakārāṃtaramāha taṃtrarāje nāmādyakṣaṭamāra
bhyayāvanmaṃtrādisaṃbhavet tridhākṛtvāsvaraiḥhutvātadanyadviparītakaṃ asyārthaḥsādhakanāmā
dyakṣaratogaṇanayāyāvanmaṃtrādimākṣaraṃtatsaṃkhyātridhākṛtvāsaptabhiḥhṛtvā'dhikaṃṛṇaṃśe
ṣaṃdhanaṃsyāt tadanyaditi maṃtrāyakṣaramārabhyayāvatsādhakanāmāyakṣaraṃtatsaṃkhyasaptaguṇaṃ
kṛvātribhirharat sādhyanāmadviguṇitaṃsādhakenasamanvitaṃ aṣṭabhiścahaṃreccheṣaṃtadanya
dviparītakam asyārthaḥsādhyanāmasvaravyaṃjanabhedenasaṃyojyadviguṇaṃkṛtvāsādhakākṣareṇa
samanvitaṃkṛtvāṣṭabhirhatvāṛṇadhanaṃjñetadanyaditi sādhakanāmākṣarānsvaravyaṃjanabhedena
dviguṇīkṛtyasādhyākrūreṇasaṃyojyāṣṭabhirhṛtvāṛṇaṃdhanaṃjñeyamiti ṛṇadhanacakram va
rgacakraṃpravakṣyāmijyotirāgamasammatam maṃtrāṇāmariśodhārthaṃnāmādyakṣarapūrvakam a
ṣṭaukauṣṭānsamāpadyavanña**naṣṭaulikhettataḥ pakṣamārjārapaṃcāsyaśunasarpākhudaṃtinaḥ meṣa-
kramādakārādivasuvargāśritāime sādhyasādhakayoḥprītijñātavyātitaḥsadā pakṣi
mārjārayorvairaṃvairaṃkukkuṭapakṣiṇoḥ vairaṃpakṣabhujaṃgānāṃpāttravaṃgajasiṃhayoḥmeṣakukkuṭaye

pṛ0 9a) thairaṃprītiyuktyāvicārayet evaṃcakravaraṃjñātvāgṛhṇīyānmaṃtramuttamaṃ prakārāṃtaramāha
vārāhītaṃtre mārjārakukkuṭavyālaiḥpakṣiṇāṃvairitābhavetmārjārasyagunākhubhyāṃsiṃhasya
daṃtinaḥsadā kukkuṭasyakharautubhyāṃkhaṇāvudhyāṃcabhoginaḥ udaramyoṃtasarpābhyāṃhariṇāsa
hadaṃtinaḥ bhujaṃgasiṃhayoḥmaitrīmeṣamūṣakayostathā lokādanyatravijñeyaṃvyavahāraprayo
gataḥ itivargacakram idānīṃtupravakṣyāmirāśicakraṃviśeṣataḥ sūtradvayaṃpūrvaparāyataṃ
tanmadhyedvayaṃyāmyakuverabhedāt ekaikamīśānaniśācaretuhutāśavādhvovilikhettato
rṇām vedāgnivahniyugalaśravaṇakṣisaṃkhyānpaṃceṣuvāṇaśarapaṃcacatuṣṭayāṃtān meṣāditaḥ
pravilikhetsakalāṃstu varṇānkanyāgatānpravilikhedathaśādyavarṇān tathācavṛhanmatsya
taṃtre vedāgnivahniyugaladvibāṇaveṇeṣuvāṇeṣupayodhisaṃkhyāt meṣādikoṣṭeṣvabhili
khyavarṇānṣaḍevaśādinyuvataulikhitvā tathācasārasaṃgrahe caturbhiryādibhiḥsārdhaṃsyātkṣa
kārastumīnagiti śāradāyāṃ bālaṃgauraṃkhuraṃdīṇaṃśamīṣobhītirāśiṣu krameṇabheditā
varṇāḥkanyāyāṃśādayasthitāḥ tathācavarāhasaṃhitāyāṃ japtaḥsvarāśitovarjyoḥṣaṣṭāṣṭa
riḥphaṇaḥśubhāḥekadvitricatuḥpaṃcasaptākhyadaśarudragāḥlagnauvarnabhrātṛvaṃdhuputraśatruka
lattrakāḥvaiṣṇavamatetuśattrasthānebaṃdhuritipāṭha maraṇaṃdharmakarmāyāvyayadvādaśarāśayaḥ

pṛ0 9ba) nāmānurūpameteṣāṃśudhāśubhaphalaṃdiśet svarāśemaṃtrarāśyaṃtaṃgaṇanīyāvicakṣaṇaiḥrāśi
nāṃśuddhatājñeyātyajecchatrumṛtivyayaṃ tatrāyamupadeśaḥ pūrvapaścimāyataṃrekhādvayaṃdakṣiṇato
ttarāyataṃrekhādvayaṃīśānādikoṇeṣurekhācatuṣṭayam tatkroṣṭeṣupaṃcāśanvarṇānmeṣādi
tovakṣyamāṇakrameṇalikhet āiīmeṣe uūṛ vṛṣe ṛḷḹmithune eaikarkaṭeoau
siṃhe aṃaḥśaṣasahakṣaḥkanyāyāṃkakhagaghaṅa tulāyāṃ cachajajhañavṛścike ṭaṭhaḍaḍhaṇa
manuṣi tathadadhanamakare paphababhamakuṃbhe yarelavamīne lagnodhanamityādikrameṇagaṇa
nīyaṃ mīnekṣakāramitikecit catubhiryādibhiḥsārdhaṃsyātkṣakārastumīnaka itivacanāt
vārāhītaṃtre ekovāpyathapaṃcamothanavamorāśeḥsvakānvāṃdhavorāśosyāddaśamodvitī ya
sahitaḥṣaṣṭobhavaitsevakāḥrudrāgnisvarasaṃkhyāyānigaditomaṃtraḥsvayaṃpoṣakaḥsyāccedaṣṭa
mavatsaraśrutimitomaṃtraḥsvayaṃghātakāḥlagnodhanaṃbhrātṛśatruputramittrakalatrakā maraṇaṃdha
rmakarmāyavyayādvādaśarāśayaḥ atrarāśicakrecaturthasthānaṃśatruḥ natuvaṃdhuḥevaṃṣaṣṭasthā
naṃbaṃdhuḥ naśatruritikaścit tacciṃtanīyam itirāśicakraṃ athanakṣatracakram tathācayogi
nītaṃtre ṛkṣaśuddhiṃpravakṣyāmiśiṣyāṇāṃhitakāmyayā pūrvāparāyatārekhādaśadeyaḥpraya
tnataḥudagdakṣiṇadīrghāścarekhādeyāścatuṣṭayam navatritayasaṃyuktāḥkoṣṭānāṃsaptaviṃśa

pṛ0 10a) tiḥ jāyatecatuthākuryāllikhedvarṇāstuteṣuca pakṣaikatryavdhirūpāvanibhujaśaśiyugyugma
bhūyugmapakṣāyugmaikadvitrirūpatryavaniśaśiśaśidyekapakṣāgnivedāḥaśvinyādikrameṇā
kṣaramihagaditaṃśeṣabheviṃdusargaujapturnakṣatrabhedādathaparigaṇayejjanmasampatkrameṇa janma
saṃpadvipetkṣamaṃpratyarisādhakovudhaḥ maitraṃparamamaitraṃcajanmādīnipunaḥpunaḥgaṇayettatkramā
devaphalaṃnāmānurūpataḥ janmakṣetubhaveddhāniḥsampattiḥsyāccasampadi vipattārairvipattisyā
tkṣememaṃgalamādiśet pratyarauśatruvṛddhiḥsyātsādhakesiddhisādhanam vadhakṣecavadhojñeyo
mittrakṣemitravardhanam atimittrebhavetsaukhyaṃtārācakramitismṛtiṃ vipadvadhapratyariścapari
tyājyomanīṣibhiḥ nijanāmādikaṃvarṇamādāyapurataḥpriye nāmādyakṣaraparyaṃtaṃgaṇanīya
ścasūribhiḥ ityājjhā**tarāśiviṣayam jñātetutadeva siddhārthamāha pūrvāparāyatāṃdaśarekhāṃ
datvādakṣiṇottarāyaṃtāṃcarekhācatuṣṭayaṃdatvāsaptaviṃśatikoṣṭeṣuvakṣyamāṇakrameṇapaṃcā
śadvarṇāṃlikhet tadyathā āśvinīdevagaṇaḥ ibharaṇīmānuṣaḥ īukṛttikārākṣasaḥ
ṝḷḹrohiṇīmānuṣaḥ emṛgaśiraḥdevaḥaiādrāmānuṣaḥ oaupunarvasudevaḥkaḥpu
ṣyaḥdevaḥkhagaaśleṣārākṣasaḥ ghaṅapūrvaphālgunīmānuṣaḥ chajuphālgunīmānuṣaḥjhaña
hastaḥdevaḥṭaṭhacittrārākṣasaḥ ḍasvātidevaḥ ḍhaṇaviśākhārākṣasaḥ tathadaanūrādhādevaḥdha

pṛ0 10ba) jyeṣṭārākṣasaḥ napaphamūlaṃrākṣasaḥbapūrvaṣāḍhāmānuṣaḥ bhuttarāṣāḍhāmānuṣaḥmaśravaṇaḥ
devaḥ yaradhaniṣṭārākṣasaḥ laṣatabhiṣāmānuṣaḥ vaśapūrvabhadrapadāmānuṣaḥ ṣasahuttarabha
drapadāmānuṣaḥ aṃaḥlakṣaḥrevatīdevā tṛtīyapaṃcamasaptamavarjanīyānilakṣattrāṇisva
nakṣattrādevagaṇanīyam svanakṣattrājñānesvanāmādyakṣarasaṃvaṃdhinakṣattrādevagaṇanīyam
prādakṣiṇyenagaṇayetsādhakākṣarataḥsudhīriti tathācajyotiṣe hastasvātimṛgāśvi
nīharigurupauṣṇānūrādhāditiścāṃdrārohiṇīcottarāṇibharaṇīpūṣāṇibhānitrayam 
jyeṣṭāśleṣaviśākhamūlavaruṇāvasvagnicittrāmaghāḥkathyaṃtemunibhiḥ yathākramasimede-
