pṛ0 11a) tinakṣatracakram tathācagaṃdharvataṃtre cakraṃvakṣyekusāṃkhyaṃprasiddhaṃsarvasiddhidaṃ maṃtrāṇāṃ
grahaṇemaṃtrīsarvathātuvicārayet rāśicakrelikhenmaṃtrīvarṇāklīvavarjitān akārā
