likhyagaṇayejjapturnāmādyakṣarapūrvakaṃ siddhasādhyasusiddhārikrameṇaivapunaḥpunaḥ yadi
maṃtranaśobhaṃtevicāreṇakathaṃcana tadāniṣedamāśrityagṛhṇīyānmaṃtramuttamaṃ anyaśca
