ṣakcaivadīkṣādiṣuprakīrtitaḥ tathācayāmale aśvinyāṃsukhamāpnotibharaṇyāṃmaraṇaṃdhru
vam punarvasaudhanāḍhyaḥsyātpuṣyeśatruvināśanaṃ aśleṣāyāṃbhavenmṛtyurmaghāyāṃduḥkhamo
