m      vṛṣesiṃhaṃcakanyāyāṃdhanumī   (caṃdratārānukulecadadyāddīkṣāṃsadāguruḥ)

pṛ0 14ba) nākhyalagnake caṃdratārānukūlecadadyāddīkṣāṃsadāguruḥ sthiralagnaṃviṣṇumaṃtreśivamaṃtrecaraṃśu
bham dviḥsvabhāvagataṃlagnaṃśaktimatreṣuśasyate niṣiddhamāseṣutattadviśeṣomunibhedataḥṣa
ṣṭyāṃbhādrapadaṃiṣetathākṛṣṇacaturdaśī kārttikenavamīśuklāmārgaṃśuklātṛtīyakā pauṣe
canavamīśuklāmāgheśuklācaturthikā phālguṇenavamīśuklācaitreśukracaturdaśītrayoda
śītīvāpāṭaḥrveśākhaikādaśīsitā jyaiṣṭecaturdaśīkṛṣṇāhyāṣāḍhenāgapaṃcamī śrāva
ṇaikādaśībhādrerohiṇīsahitāṣṭamīāśvinecamahāpuṇyāmahāṣṭamyāpyamā bhīṣṭadākā
tikenavamitruklāmārgaśirṣetayāsitācaṣṭicaturdaśīpauṣemāghekādaśīsitāphālguṇe
casitāṣaṣṭīcetikālavinirṇayaḥ yoginītaṃtre ayanegrahaṇecaivaviṣuvecaṃdrasūryayoḥ
ravisaṃkrāṃtidivaseyugādyāyāṃsvareśvari manvārāsucasarvāsumahāpūjādinetathā catu
rthīpaṃcamīcaivacaturdaśyaṣṭamītathā tithayaḥśubhadāḥproktāityādivacanāccaturdaśyāṣṭamī
tiśaktiviṣayam caturthītithiḥgaṇeśaviṣayaṃ tataḥkalpoktatvāt ninditeṣvapikāle
ṣudīkṣoktāgrahaṇeśubhā sūryagrahaṇakālasyasamānonāstibhūtale tatrayadyatkṛtaṃsarvamanaṃ
taphaladaṃbhavet ravisaṃkramaṇecaivasūryasyagrahaṇetathā tatralagnādikaṃkiṃcinnavicāryaṃka
thaṃcana evaṃcaṃdragrahaṇepitathā amāvasyāsomavārebhomavārecaturdaśī saptamīravivāreca

pṛ0 15a) sūryaparvaśataiḥsamā vārāhītaṃtre śukrostoyadivāvṛddhogurvādibhyobhavedyadiḥ meṣavṛści
kasiṃheṣutadādoṣonavidyate dīkṣāsthānaṃpravakṣyāminānātaṃtrānusārataḥ gośālā
yāṃgurorgehedevāgārecakānane puṇyakṣettretathodyānenadītirecasvāśrame yātrībilva
samīpecaparvatāgreguhāsuca gaṃgāyāṃtatkṛtaṃsarvaṃkoṭikoṭiguṇaṃbhavet athabhakṣyaṃ
pravakṣyāmimiṃtriṇāṃsarvasiddhidam tathācoktaṃśāradātilakaṃ bhakṣyaṃhaviṣyaṃśākādi
vihitaṃcaphalaṃpayaḥ mūlaṃsatu ryavotpannobhakṣyājyetānimaṃtriṇām tathācoktaṃsā
rasaṃgrahe dīkṣāṃkṛtvāyadāmaṃtrīhyupavāsaṃsamācaret tasyadevāḥsadāruṣṭāḥśā
paṃpatatimūrddhani dātāgṛhītānopoṣyedupavāsaḥśriyaṃharet tasmādannaṃsamaśrī
yāddhaviṣyānnenaśāṅkari itiśrīāgamakalpalatāyāṃvaiyāṃsikyāmanāmatṛtīyaḥpa
ṭalaḥ oṃnamaḥśivāya tasmādguruṃsamāśrityahyāgamoktenavartmanā dīkṣāṃkuryuḥ
prayatnenasādhakāḥsiddhikāṃkṣiṇaḥ prasaṃgādāgamapraśaṃsālikhyate nityapūjāṃ
vinirvartyadaṃḍavatpraṇamedgurum tataścapraṇamedbhānuṃmātaraṃtathā tatobhilaṣi
tāṃvidyāmabhyasedgurusannidhau yadāsarvaśāstrārthajñānepicajagurvudhāḥ tadālokadva
yārthaṃcajñānaśāstraṃsamabhyasetnajñāne ||  oṃnamaḥsarasatyai oṃnamośrīgaṇeśāyanamaḥ

pṛ0 15ba) navināmuktirjñānaṃbhaktiṃvinānahi bhaktistubhagavadbhaktasaṃgenaparijāyate bahūnijñānaśā
strāṇisaṃtyevakṣitimaṃḍale yasyayānimanojñānitānitānisamabhyaset ekenamunināpro
ktāḥprakārābahavastathā kiṃtasyakimatathyaṃvānāsatyavikalānarāḥ tenāgamaṃjñānaśāstra
mabhyasetprayataḥsudhīḥ āgamesarvaśāstrāṇihyāgamesarvadevatāḥāgamesakalaṃpuṇyamāgame
mesarvadevatāḥ āgamesakalaṃpuṇyamāgamekiṃnalabhyate agamesakalaṃjñānaṃvidyāḥsarvāpra
tiṣṭitāḥ āgameyatnalabhyetavrahmāṃḍetannalabhyate āgateśivavaktrātugataṃtugirijāmukhaṃ
malatrayavināśāyatasmādāgamucyate śarīrotpattijīvaṃcamāyīśārīrakarmaṇam jñānaṃ
tenāvṛtaṃviddhibhavavaṃdhapravartakaṃ śarīrotpādakoviṣṇustadbhaktyātannikṛṃtati jñānārthaṃbhakti
yogasyatasmādāgamamabhyaset tasmāddīkṣāṃprakurvītahyāgamoktenavartmanā athadīkṣāvi
dhiṃvakṣyemaṃtriṇāṃhitakāmyayā vinātayānalabhyetasarvamaṃtraphalaṃyataḥ catu-
rvidhāsasaṃdhiṣṭākrinyānatyādinnedataḥkriyāvatidharmamapikalātmāvedamaiyupi tatrakri
yāvatīdīkṣābahutvānnanigadyate punarvedamayīyogegamyāśiṣyapravodhinī athakalāva
tīdīkṣāvidhānaṃcābhidhīyatetathācaśāradātilake daiśikovidhivatsnātvākṛtvāpūrvā-
hnikakriyāḥ yāyādalaṃkṛtaumaunīyāgārtheyāgamaṃḍapaṃ tatobhūmitaleśuddhetuṣāṅkāravi

pṛ0 16a) varjite puṇyāhaṃvācayitvātumaṃḍamaṃracayecchubham paṃcabhisaptabhiḥhastaiḥnavabhirvāsitāṃ
taraṃ ṣoḍaśastaṃbhasaṃyuktaṃcatvārasteṣumadhyagāḥ aṣṭahastasamucchrayāḥsaṃsthāpyādvādaśābhi
taḥ paṃcahastapramāṇāstevicchidrāṛjavaḥśubhāḥ tatpaṃcamāṃśaṃnikhanenmedinyāṃtaṃtravitta
ttamaḥ tatpaṃcamāṃśaṃteṣāṃstaṃbhānāṃpaṃcamāṃśamityarthaḥ nārikeladalairvaṃśaiḥsādhayettatsamaṃ
tataḥ dvāreṣutoraṇānisyuḥkramātkṣīramahīruhām staṃbhocchrāyaḥsmṛtasteṣāṃsaptahastaiḥpṛ
thakpṛthak teṣāṃtoraṇānāmdaśāṅgulapramāṇenatatpariṇāharaṃritaḥ tiryakphalakamā
naṃsyātstaṃbhānāmardhamānataḥ tiryakphalakamānaṃsyāditistaṃbhadvayoparikāṣṭasyetiśeṣaḥ
staṃbhānāmardhamānitisārddhahastatrayamitiśeṣaḥ śūlānvikalpayenmadhyetoraṇehastamāna
taḥdikṣudvijānnibaṃdhīyāllokapālasamaprabhām tathācoktaṃśāradāyām iṃdramagniṃyamaṃrakṣo
varuṇaṃpavanaṃvidhuṃ īśānaṃpannagādhīśamatūrdhvaṃpitāmaham pītoraktositodūmaḥśuklodhū
mraḥsitāvubhau gauroruṇaḥkramādetevarṇataḥparikīrtitāḥkapiśakapilanīlaśyāmala
detadhūmrāmalaśucisitavaktrāvarṇatovāsavādyāḥkramadīpikāyām vitānadarbhamā
lādyairalaṃkurvītamaṃḍalam tattribhāgamiti kṣettrerattrimātrasamucchritam caturaśrāṃ
tatovediṃmaṃḍalāyaprakalpayet oṃnamośrīgaṇeśāyanamaḥ oṃnamaḥsarasvatyaiḥ oṃ

pṛ0 16a) taduktaṃgautamīye vediṃsaṃracayenmaṃtrīcaturaśrāṃyathāvidhiḥ śuklamṛtsnācayābhūmirvrāhmī
sāparikīrtitā kṣattriyāraktamṛtsnācaharidvaiśyāprakīrtitā kṛṣṇābhūmiḥbhavecchūdrācatu
rāparikīrtitā vrāhmīsarvārthasiddhiḥsyātkṣattriyārājyadāmatā dhanadhānyakarīvaiśyāśūdrā
tuniṃditāmune prāgevadīkṣādivasānmaṃḍapaṃkārayetsudhīḥ caturviṃśatyaṅgulāḍhaṃhastaṃtaṃtravi
doviduḥ karturdakṣiṇahastasyamadhyamāṅguliparvaṇaḥ madhyamyadīrghamānenamānāṃgulamudī
ritaṃ yavānāṃtaṃḍulairekamaṃgulaṃcāṣṭabhirbhavet adīrghayojitairhastaścaturviśāṃgulairbhave
t aṣṭabhistairyavaijyaiṣṭaṃmadhyamaṃsaptabhiryavaiḥ kaniṣṭaṃṣaḍbhiruddiṣṭaṃhastaṃcamunisattama sa
rvatobhadravacanaprakāramāhacaturaśrecatuṣkoṣṭekarṇasūtrasamanvite caturṣvapicakoṣṭe
ṣukoṇasūtracatuṣṭayam madhyemadhyeyathāmatsyābhaveyuḥpātayettathā pūrvāparāyatedvedve
maṃtrīyāmyautarāyate pātayetteṣumatsyeṣusamaṃsūtracatuṣṭayam pūrvavatkoṇakoṣṭeṣuvarṇa
sūtrāṇipātayet tadvadbhūteṣumatsyeṣudadyātsūtracatuṣṭayam tataḥkoṣṭeṣumatsyeṣute
ṣusūtrāṇipātayet ṣaṭtriṃśatāpadairmadhyelikhetpadmamalakṣaṇaṃ bahiḥpaṃktyābhavetpīṭhaṃ
paṃktiyugmenavīthikāḥ dvāraśobhopaśobhānnāṃśiṣṭābhyāṃparikalpayet śāstrekavidhinā
maṃtrītataḥpadmaṃsamālikhet padmakṣettrasyasaṃtyajyadvādaśāṃśaṃbahiḥsudhīḥ tanmathyaṃvibhajjedvṛttaistri

pṛ0 17a) bhismamavibhāgataḥ ādyaṃsyātkarṇikāsthānaṃkesarāṇāṃdvitīyakaṃ tṛtīyaṃtatrapattrāṇāṃ
muktāśenadalāgrakam bāhyaṃvṛtāṃtarālasyamānaṃpadvidhināsudhīḥ nidhāyakeśarāgre 
ṣupatitordhvaniśākarān likhitvasaṃdhisaṃsthānetatrasūtrāṇipātayet dalāgrāṇāṃca
yanmānaṃtanmānaṃdhṛttamākhikhet tadaṃtarālaṃtanmadhyesūttrasyobhayataḥsudhīḥ ālikhe-
dvāhyahastenadalāgrāṇisamaṃtataḥ dalamūleṣuyugaśaḥkesarāṇiprakalpayet etatsā
dhāraṇaṃproktaṃpaṃkajaṃtaṃtravedibhiḥ padānitrīṇipādārthaṃpīṭhikoṇeṣumārjayet ava
śiṣṭaiḥpadairvidvāngātrāṇiparikalpayet padānivīṣisaṃsthānemārjayetpaṃktyabhedataḥ di
kṣudvārāṇiracayeddvicatuṣkoṣṭakaistataḥ padaistribhirathaikenaśobhāḥsyuḥdvārapārśvayoḥ 
upaśobhāḥsyurekenatribhiḥkoṣṭairanaṃtaraṃ avaśiṣṭaiḥpadaiḥṣaḍbhiḥkoṇānāṃsyāccatuṣṭayam 
raṃjayetpaṃcabhirvārṇairmaṃḍalaṃtanmanoharam pītaṃharidrāpūrṇaṃsyātsitaṃtaṃḍulasaṃbhavam kusuṃ
bhacūrṇamaruṇaṃkṛṣṇaṃdagdhapulākajam vilavādipatrakaṃrayāmamityuktaṃvarṇapaṃcakaṃaṃgu
locchedavistārāḥsamāreravāsitāḥśubhāḥ karṇikāṃpītavarṇenakesarāṇyaruṇenacaśu
bhravarṇenapattrāṇitatsaṃdhīṃśyāmalenaca rajasāraṃjayenmaṃtrījaṃbāpītairakarṇikā ke
sagaḥpītaraktāḥsyuḥraruṇānidalānyapisaṃdhayakṛcchavarṇasyuḥpīṭhenāpyasitenavā

pṛ0 17ba) raṃjayetpīṭhagātrāṇipādāḥsyuraruṇaprabhāḥ gātrāṇitasyaśubhrāṇivīthiṣucatasṛṣvapi
ālikhetkalpalatikādalapuṣpasamanvitāḥ varṇairnānāvidhaiścittrāḥsarvadṛṣṭimanoharāḥ
tārāṇiśvetavarṇāniśobhāraktāḥsamīritāḥ upaśobhāḥpītavarṇāḥkoṇānyasitabhāni
ca tisrarekhāḥbahiḥkāryāḥsitaraktāsitāḥkramāt maṃḍapaṃsarvatobhadrametatsādhāraṇaṃsmṛtaṃ
śiṣyopitatracāgatyaśuciḥpūrvamupoṣitaḥ saṃkalpaṃcatataḥkuryātsvastivācanapūrvakaṃ paścā
cchiṣyoguruṃtatravṛṇuyādbhaktisaṃyutaṃḥ śaktyāguruṃbhūṣayedvaivastrālaṃkārabhūṣaṇaiḥ godhū
hiraṇyavastrādyaiḥkuṃḍalādibhirujjvalaiḥ anyairābharaṇaiścaivatathāvittamavaṃcayan guruṃsaṃ-
pūjayedbhaktyāśiṣyosauśubhacetasā daṃbhāhaṃkāramānaṃcaguroragrevivarjayet kṛtāṃjali
puṭobhūtvāprīṇayedgurumagrataḥ athātobhagavatparamātmasvarūpin paramakāruṇikagu
rosakalapuruṣārthasādhanamaṃtradīkṣābhiṣekapūrvakaṃmāṃprasādaya ityuktvācaciraṃtiṣṭedvi
nayīdakṣiṇeguroḥ sahasraṃpraṇamettatragāyatrīmājñayāguroḥ vakṣyamāṇakrameṇātrasaṃsku-
ryānmaṃtramuttamaṃ gururitiśeṣaḥ saṃskṛtyaṃdaśadhāmaṃtraṃtataḥpūjāṃsamārabhet pādauprakṣāla
yedgatvātatāṃmaṃḍapasannidhim ācamyavidhināsamyaksāmānyārghaṃvidhāyaca astreṇapā
pātraṃsaṃprokṣyahṛnmaṃtreṇapūjayet tīrthamāvāhyagaṃdhādīnnikṣipetpraṇavenatu rdhanumudrāṃdarśa

pṛ0 18a) yeccasāmānyārghaṃudāhṛtaḥ dvāramastrāṃvubhiḥprokṣyadvārapūjāṃsamācaret urdhveḍaṃbarakevighnaṃ
mahālakṣmīṃsarasvatīm tatodakṣiṇaśākhāyāṃvighnaṃkṣettreśamanyataḥtayoḥpārśvayugegaṃgā
yayunāpuṣpavāribhiḥ dehalyāmarcapedastraṃpratidvāramitikramāt kiṃcitspṛśanvāmaśā
khāṃdehalīṃlaṃghayedguruḥ aṃgaṃsaṃkocayedaṃtaḥ praviśeddakṣiṇāṃghriṇā anaṃtaraṃdaiśakeṃdro
divyadṛṣṭyavalokanāt divyānutsārayedvighnānastrādbhiścāṃtarikṣagān pārṣṇighātaistribhi
rbhaumānitivighnānnivārayet siddhārthākṣatasaṃyuktaṃnārācāstradhiyāvudhaḥapasarpaṃtutebhū
tāyebhūtābhuvisaṃsthitāḥ yebhūtāvighnakartārastenaśyaṃtuśivājñayā ityaṃtestraṃsayuścā
ryamaṃḍapāṃtaḥparikṣipet naiṛtyāṃdiśivāstrīśaṃvrāhmaṇaṃcasamarcayet paṃcagavyārgha
toyābhyāṃprokṣayedyāgamaṃḍapam vīkṣaṇaṃmūlamaṃtreṇacareṇaprokṣaṇaṃmatam tenaivatāḍanaṃ
darbhairvarmaṇābhyukṣaṇaṃmatam caṃdanāgurukarpūrairdhūpayedaṃtaraṃsudhīḥ vikirānviki-
rettatrasaptajaptvāśarāvunā jāṃlāṃcaṃdanasiddhārthabhasmapūrvākuśākṣatāḥ vikirāi
tisaṃdiṣṭāsarvavighnaughanāśakaḥ vikīryavikirānpaścānmārjanaṃkārayetsudhīḥ 
astrajaptenadarbhāṇāṃmuṣṭināmārjayaścatān īśasyadiśivardhanyāāsanāyapra-
kalpayet vardhanīvikirādhiṣṭātradevatā tasyāsanāya(prakalpayet) 

pṛ0 18ba) vardhanīmiśānakoṇeviṣṭaropari..............vadanāitiyasyāsyāḥprasiddhiḥpu
ṇyāhaṃvāśayitvātuvrāhmaṇānparitoṣyaca ukteṣumaṃḍaleṣvekaṃvedikāyāṃsamālikhet me
rupṛṣṭṛṣichaṃdaḥpṛthivyāḥsutalaṃmataṃ devatākūrmākhyātāḥsaṃsmaredṛṣṭipūrvakam vi
niyogahimaṃtrasyāsaneparikīrtitaḥ pṛthitvayādhṛtālokātvaṃdeviviṣṇunādhṛtā tvaṃca
dhārayamāṃdevipavitraṃkurucāsanaṃ itimaṃtrajapanpīṭheprāṅmukhovāpyudaṅmukhaḥ svastika-
dikrameṇaivṛjukāyoviśedvudhaḥ sthāpayeddakṣiṇebhāgepūjādravyāṇidaiśikaḥ suvāsi
tāṃvrasaṃpūrṇaṃsavyekuṃbhaṃsuśobhitaṃ prakṣālanāyakarayoḥpṛṣṭepātraṃvidhāpayet ghṛtaprajvali
tāndīpānsthāpayetparitaḥśubhān darpaṇaṃcāmaraṃchattraṃtālavṛttaṃmanoharam kṛtāṃjali
puṭobhūtvāvāmadakṣiṇapārśvayoḥ natvāguruṃgaṇeśānaṃbhūtaśuddhiṃsamācaret yāmale tathā
puṭaṃjalībhūtvāvāmegurutrayaṃyajet dakṣiṇecagaṇeśānaṃmurdhnidevaṃvibhāvayet karaśu
ddhiṃsamāpādyakuryāttālatrayaṃtataḥ urdhvāṃrdhamastramaṃtreṇadigvaṃdhimapidaiśikaḥ tenasaṃja-
nitaṃtejorakṣāṃkuryātsamaṃtataḥ bhūtaśuddhiṃtataḥkraryāddaiśikaḥsthiramānasaḥ tathācoktaṃ
śāradātilakaṃ śarīrākārabhūtānāṃbhūtānāṃyadviśodhanam advayavrahmasaṃyogādbhūta-
śuddhiriyaṃmatā supuṣṇāvartmanātmānaṃparamātmaniyojagetyogayuktenavināvinmaṃtre

pṛ0 19a) ṇasamāhitaḥ cinmaṃtreṇahaṃsitimaṃtreṇakāraṇesarvabhūtānāṃtatvānyapiviciṃtayet bī
jabhāvenalīnānivyutkramātparemātmani tataḥsaṃśoṣayeddehaṃvāyuvījenavāyunā va
hnivījenatenaivasaṃdahetsakalāṃtanum viśleṣayaṃstadādoṣānamṛtenāmṛtāṃbhasā ā
pādyamlāvayeddehaṃmāpādatalamastakaṃ vāyuvījenayamitivījenavahnivījaṃamṛtaṃ
amṛtabījaṃvamityarthaḥātmalīnānitatvānisvasthānaṃmlāvayettataḥ ātmānaṃhṛdayāṃ
bhojamānayetparamātmanaḥ manunāhaṃsadevasyakuryānnyāsādikaṃtataḥ haṃsadevaḥhaṃsiti
svarūpaṃ ṛṣicchaṃdodaivatāninyasenmaṃtrasyamaṃtravit ātmanomūrdhnivadanehṛdayecatathā
kramāt tathāvṛhanmatsyasūkte ṛṣinyāsomūrdhnideśechaṃdastumukhapaṃkaje devatāhṛda
yecaivavījaṃtuguhyadeśake śaktiṃcapādayoścaivasarvāṅgekīlakaṃnyaset ṛṣistu mahe
śvaramukhājñjñātvāyaḥsākṣāttapasāmanum saṃsādhayatiśuddhātmāsatasyṛṣirīritā
gurutvānmastakecāsyanyāsastuparikīrtitaḥ sarveṣāṃmaṃtratattvānāṃkādanācchaṃducyatea
kṣaratvātmadatvāccamukhaccheṃdaḥsamīritam ṛṣicchaṃdoparijñānānnṛmaṃtraḥphalabhāgbhavet 
daurbalyaṃyātimaṃtrāṇāṃviniyogamajānatāṃ itiṛṣyādinyāsāvaśakatvaṃsiddhimitibhā
vaḥṛṣyādīnāha maṃtracūḍāmaṇau upāsakānmahādeviśṛṇucaikamanāḥsvayaṃ manuścaṃdraḥku

pṛ0 19ba) vairaścamanmathastadaṃtaram lopāmudrāmanuḥnaṃdiḥcakraḥskaṃdaḥśivaḥtathā krodhabhaṭṭāra
kaścaivapaṃcamīparikīrtitā durvāsāvyāsapūjyaucavasiṣṭaścaparāśaraḥ orvovahniyama
ścaivanaiṛtovaruṇastathāvāyurviṣṇusvayaṃbhuścabhairavogaṇapastathā aniruddhobharadvā
jodakṣiṇāmūrtirevaca vaṭukogaṇapatiścaivalakṣmīgaṃgāsarasvatī dhātrīśeṣaḥprama
rtaścunmattaḥkulabhairavaḥ dhātrīdharitrīkṣattrapālohanūmāṃścadakṣogaruḍevaca śuka
devaḥprahlādaścarāmorāvaṇevaca kaśyapaḥkautsakuṃbhaucajamadagniḥbhṛguḥtathā vṛ
haspatiryaduśreṣṭodattātreyoyudhiṣṭiraḥ arjunobhīmasenaścadroṇācāryojayadrathaḥ duryo
dhanastathākuṃtīsītācarukmiṇītathā satyabhāmādropadīcurvaśīcatilottamā 
puṣpadaṃtomahāvuddhobāṇaḥkālaścamaṃdaraḥ kailāsikṣusiṃdhuścatadadhiḥhimavāṃstathā 
yādavaścamahāvīraḥkalpavṛkṣaḥsusādhakāḥ mahāvidyāprasādenasvasvakāmasamanvitāḥ
mahāvidyāmāha tathācamuṃḍamālātaṃtre kālītārāmahāvidyāṣoḍaśībhuvanīśvarī bhai
ravīcchinnamastācavidyādhūmāvatītathā vagalāsiddhavidyācamātaṃgīkamalātmikā
etādaśamahāvidyāmahādeviprakīrtitāḥ vidhāyamūlamaṃtreṇaprāṇāyāmaṃyathāvidhi
prāṇāyāmasyalakṣaṇamāhatripurāsārasamuccaye prāṇovāyuḥśarīrasthāyāmastasyani

pṛ0 20a) grahaḥ prāṇāyāmitiproktodvividhaḥkathyatehisaḥ sagarbhonigarbhaścasagarbhomaṃtrajā
panenigarvomātrayābhavet agastyasaṃhitāyāṃtatkathitaṃkuṃbhajenaca mātrāca nali
nīpattrasaṃhityāṃsūkṣmasūcyagrabhedanedalecayaḥkālaḥsakālolavācakaḥlavaistruṭi
ścatriṃśadbhiḥkalāṃtāvatruṭiṃviduḥ kāṣṭāṃstāvatkalājñaṃyāstāvatkāṣṭānimeṣakaḥ
svaṃgulisphoṭatulyaścamātrāṣṭādaśabhiḥsmṛtāḥ kālenayāvatāsvīyohastaḥsvaṃjānu
maṃḍalam paryetimātrāsātasyāḥsvakīyaścāsatulyayā athavāvāmajānutīti
mātrāca vāmajānunihastasyannamaṇaṃyāvatābhavet kālenamātrāsājñeyāmunibhi
rvedapāragaiḥ yāmale prāṇāyāmaṃtataḥkuryādvāgbhavenasamāhitaḥ dakṣāṃguṣṭenadakṣaṃ
caghāṇaṃsapīṃḍyamaṃtravit aṃguṣṭānāmikābhyāṃcadhṛtvānāsādvayaṃtataḥ tatastukuṃbhayedvā
yuṃpūrakāṇāṃcaturguṇaiḥ anāmayātathāvāmanāmasāṃdhṛtvātudakṣiṇe dvātriṃśadbhistu
mātrābhiḥvāyoścarecanaṃcaret svacittaṃmūlacakretunidhāyasūnsamabhyaset tatore
canamārgeṇaprāṇavāyuṃprapūrayet punaḥṣoḍaśamātrābhiḥkuṃbhakaṃcasamābhyaset 
catuḥṣaṣṭitamairmaṃtrīnāsāpuṭauvidhṛtyaca punaścarecayedvāyuṃdvātriṃśanmātrayāvudhaḥ
vāmenaivapivedvāyuṃmātrābhiḥṣāṃḍaśaiḥkramāt nāsāpuṭauvipīḍyāthapūrakasyacatu

pṛ0 20ba) rguṇaiḥ reśayeddakṣiṇevāyuṃdvātriṃśanmātrayāvudhaḥ vāmenadhānaṃdakṣiṇerecanamiti tatpra
thamaprāṇāyāmābhiprāyeṇāvṛttyāttatadasaṃbhavati prāṇāyāmavidhiṃsamyakkathitaṃya
tnatomayā adhamomadhyamaścaivaprāṇāyāmastathottamaḥ adhamojanayeddharmaṃkaṃpobhavati
madhyame uttamekhecarīṃsiddhiṃprāpnuyānnātrasaṃśayaḥ prāṇāyāmaiḥkṛtaiḥśaśvannityaṃṣoḍaśabhiḥ
sudhīḥ dainandinaṃcayatpāpaṃtatsarvaṃnaśyatidhruvaṃ kaniṣṭānāmikāṃguṣṭairyannāsāpuṭadhāra
