ketakīdvekahlārecaṃṇapakotpale kuṃdamaṃdārapunnāgapāṭalānāgacapakam āragvadhaṃka
rṇikāraṃpāvaṃtīvanamālikā saugaṃdhikaṃsakoraṇṭhaṃpalāśālokamallikāḥ datūraṃsarja
kaṃvillamarjanaṃmanipuṣpakaṃ anyānicasugaṃdhīnipuṣpamātrāṇidaiśikaiḥ upadiṣṭānipū
jāyāmādadīnnavicakṣaṇaḥ malinaṃbhūmisaṃspṛṣṭaṃkrimikeśādidūṣitam aṃgaspṛṣṭaṃsamā
ghrātaṃtyajetparyuṣitaṃguruḥ aṃgaspṛṣṭaṃhastātiriktamitiśeṣaḥ mukulaiḥpatitaiścaivakhaṃḍitaiḥ
śoṣitairapi anarhairapipuṣpaiścadalaiḥpattraiścanārcayet yenakekanāpipuṣpenapattreṇāpi
dalenavāyataḥ kutaścidānīyayatratatrodbhavenaca bhāvārthījīvitārthācanārcayedgarhitestha
the parāropitavṛkṣebhyaḥpuṣpāṇyānīyacārcayet avijñāpyaivateryastuniṣphalaṃtasyapūji
tam tathācajñānamalāyām puṣpaṃvāyadivāpattraṃphalaṃneṣṭamadhomukham puṣpāṃjalividhiṃ
hitvāyathotpannaṃtathārpaṇam tathācakālikāpurāṇe naivedyaṃdakṣiṇevāmepuratovānapṛ
ṣṭataḥ dīpaṃdakṣiṇatodadyātpuratovānavāmataḥ vāmatastutathādhūpamagrevānatudakṣiṇe

pṛ0 26a) nivedayetpurobhāgegaṃdhaṃpuṣpacabhūṣaṇam vāmedhūpaṃdadyāditiviṣṇuṣayaṃ śaktiviṣayetuda
kṣiṇedadyāt pratimādiṣuyadyogegāttredattaṃcatattanaudadyādyatnenamānavaḥ sarvaṃmahāvasuma
tīsahatenatvidaṃdvayam akāryapādaghātaṃcadīpagapaṃtathaivaca itikālikāpurāṇe a
guruggulaśarkarāmadhucaṃdanaiḥ dhūpayedājyasaṃmiśrairnīcaiḥdevasyadaiśikaḥ uśīraṃvīra
ṇamūlam vatyokarpūragarbhiṇyāsarpiṇyāsarpiṣātilajenavā āropyadarśayedvīpānu
ccaiḥsaurabhaśālinaḥ svārūpadaṃśavimalaṃpāyasaṃsahaśarkaram kadalīphalasaṃyuktaṃsā
jyaṃmaṃtrīnyavedayet upadaṃśaścarvaṇīyadravyaṃ modakaḥnālikelādi| tatratatrajalaṃdadyādu
pacārāṃtare aṃgānilokapālāṃtaṃyajedāvaraṇānyapi kesareṣvagnikoṇādihṛdayādī
nipūjayet netramagrediśāsvastraṃdhātavyāṃgadevatāḥ hṛdiyaṃvahnikoṇecanaiṛte
śivīritam vāyukoṇeśikhāproktākavacaṃśivadikṣupi puratonetramabhyarcyaprā
gādyāśāsvaśāstrakam śaktiviṣayepūjāprakāramāha uktaṃśrīvanadurgātaṃtre dakṣāṃguṣṭata
rjanībhyāṃpuṣpanikṣepaṇaṃcaret vārcayedekahastenayadīcchetsiddhimātmanaḥ kevalaṃdakṣa-
hastenaabhicārāyakalpate vāmenakevalaṃbhogaḥsaṃyogādbhogamokṣadam aṃguṣṭā
nāmikāyogāchivaśaktyātmakaṃparam aṃguṣṭhaṭāḥśivityuktonāmikāśaktirucyate

pṛ0 26ba) tayoḥsaṃyogamātreṇadravyaṃsyādamṛtopamam śivaśaktyātma(ttamaḥ gurūpadeśavidhināyo)
kaṃvindvadvayaṃsyādaṅgulīyam tenatannismṛtaṃdravyaṃparamāmṛtamiṣyate chinnādidoṣaśu
ddhyarthaṃmaṃtrāṇāṃsādhakottamaḥ gurūpadeśavidhināyonimudrāṃsamabhyaset yathāādhāreca
gudasthānepaṃkajaṃsyāccaturdalam tatrasāyaṃbhuvaṃliṃgaṃraktagauraṃviciṃtayet tatrasārdhatri
valayāṃ prasuptabhujagākāraṃkuṃḍalinīṃviciṃtyatāṃ hūṃkāreṇamanodaṃḍāhatāṃkṛtvoktā
pyamūlādhārāliṃgamūlasthaṃsvādhiṣṭānicakramānīyasvādhiṣṭānātrābhisthaṃmaṇipūrakaṃ
cakramānīyamaṇipūrakāhṛdayasthamanāhataṃcakramānīyānāhatātkaṃṭhasthaṃviśucakramā
nīyaviśuddhādbhruvoraṃtarālamājñācakramānīyājñātaḥ sahasradalakamalaṃnītvāsahasrada
lakamalāvasthitasadāśivajyotiṣāsahatasyāḥmāmarasyaṃviciṃtyatāṃmūlamaṃtrasvarū
pāṃkuṃḍalinīsadāśivapadādājñācakramānīya tasmādviśuddhānāhatamaṇipūrakasvādhiṣṭā
nakrameṇamūlādhāraṃnayet tatastāṃmaṃtradevatāṃhṛdiviciṃtyamānasopacārairārādhyanamasku
ryāt itigonimudrā abhyāsakaraṇāśvaktaḥsaṃskārānācaretsudhīḥmaṃtrasyadaśakathyaṃtesaṃskā
rāssiddhidāyanaḥ jananaṃjīvanaṃpaścāttāḍanaṃvodhanaṃtathā athābhiṣekovimalīkaraṇā
pyāyatetataḥtarpaṇaṃdīpanaṃguptirdaśaitāmaṃtrasaṃskriyāḥ maṃtrāṇāṃmātṛkāmadhyāduddhārojana

pṛ0 27a) naṃsmṛtaṃ mātṛketiṃ mātṛkāḥ paṃcāśattanmātṛkāmadhyāddeyomaṃtroddhāritimaṃtrasyajanam
praṇavāṃtaritakṛtvāmaṃtravarṇāṃjapetsudhīḥetajjīvanamityāhurmaṃtraṃtaṃtraviśāradāḥ praṇaṃ
vāṃtaritaṃti deyamaṃtrasyaikaikavarṇatranaṃtaraṃpraṇavaṃdattvājapedityarthaḥ etanmaṃtrasyajīvanaṃ maṃ
travarṇānsamālikhyatāḍayecchaṃdanāṃbhasā pratyekaṃvāyunāmaṃtrītāḍanaṃtadudāhṛtam pratye
kaṃdeyamaṃtrasyaikaikākṣaraṃvāyunāvāyabījenayaṃitivījenapratyakṣaroparicaṃdanāṃbhomi
śritajalaṃdadyāt itimaṃtrasyatāḍanaṃ gopālapakṣeśuklacaṃdanajalena devīviṣayerakta-
caṃdanajalenetyarthaḥ vilīkhyamaṃtraṃtanmaṃtrīprasūnaiḥkaravīrajaiḥ tanmaṃtrākṣarasaṃkhyātairha
nyādyāṃtenabodhanam vilikhyetitāmrapaṭṭadāvityarthaḥ yāṃtenetiyakārasyāṃtorephaḥta
thācaramitivahnivījamityarthaḥ itimaṃtrasyabodhanam svataṃtroktavidhānenamaṃtrīmaṃ
trasyasaṃkhyayā aśvatthapallavairmaṃtramabhiṣiṃcedviśuddhaye svataṃtrokteti viṣṇupakṣeśukla
caṃdanajalena devīpakṣeraktacaṃdanenetyarthaḥ saṃciṃtyamanasāmaṃtraṃjyotirmaṃtreṇanirdahe
t maṃtremalatrayaṃmaṃtrīṃvimalīkaraṇaṃtvidam jyotirmaṃtroyathātāraṃvyomāgnimanu
yugṛṃḍījyotirmanunmataḥ tāraṃoṃkāraḥ vyomahakāraḥagniḥrephaḥmanuḥokāraḥdaṃḍoa
nusvāraḥ tena oṃhrauṃitijyotirmaṃtreṇamalatrayaṃ māyīyakārmaṇaśarorasaṃjñakamiti

pṛ0 27ba) kuśodakenajaptenapratyūrṇaṃprokṣaṇaṃmanoḥ tenamaṃtreṇavidhivadetadāpyāyanaṃmatam tena
maṃtreṇadeyamaṃtreṇacatanmaṃtrasyāpyāyanam maṃtreṇavāriṇāmaṃtretarpaṇaṃmaham maṃtreṇa
mūlamaṃtreṇa tathācadeyamaṃtramuccāryāmukamaṃtraṃtarpayāmītyarthaḥ caturmaṃtrasyatarpaṇam
tāraṃmāyāramāyogomanordīpanamucyate tārā oṃmāyāhrīṃ ramāśrīṃyogaḥsaṃbaddhaḥtena
deyamaṃtrasyādau oṃhrīṃśrīṃitivījatrayaṃdattvājapedityarthaḥ etanmaṃtrasyadīpanaṃ japyamā
nasyamaṃtrasyagopanaṃtvaprakāśitam saṃskārādaśasaṃproktāḥsarvataṃtreṣugopitāḥ yātkṛ
tvāsaṃpradāyenamaṃtrīvāṃcitamāpnuyāt homaṃkṛtvāthaśāstroktakuryācchiṣyasyasaṃskriyām
tataḥsudhautadaṃtāḍhāṃkhātaṃśiṣyaṃsamāhitaṃ māyayitvāpaṃcagavyaṃkuṃḍasyāśukamānayet vi-
lokyadivyadṛṣṭyātaṃtaccaitanyaṃhṛdaṃvu jegururātmanisaṃyojyakuryādarghaviśodhanam u
ktaṃkalādhvātatvādhvābhuvanādhvetitaṃtrayaṃ varṇādhvācapadādhvācamaṃtrādhaṃtyaparaṃtapam nivṛ
tyādyāḥkalāpaṃcakalādhvetiprakīrtinaḥ tattvādhvābahudhābhinnāḥśaivādyāgamabhedaṣaḥ ṣa
ṭtriṃśacchivatatvānidvātriṃśadvaiṣṇavānica caturviṃśatitatvānimaittrāṇiprakṛteḥpunaḥ u
ktānidaśatattvānisaptacatripadātmanaḥ tattvāniśaivātyucyaṃte śivaḥśaktiḥsadāśivaḥ
reśvarovidyayāsārdhaṃpaṃcatattvānyamūnihi māyākāladhvaniyatiḥkalāvidyāpunaḥsmṛtā

pṛ0 28a) rāgaḥpuruṣetāniśuddhāśuddhānisaptaca prakṛtiḥvuddhyahaṃkāromanojñāneṃdriyāṇyatha
karmeṃdriyāṇitanmātrāḥpaṃcabhūtānidaiśikāḥetānyāhuraśuddhānicaturviṃśatirāgame
kramādetānadhvanaḥṣaṭkrodhayedgurusattamaḥ pādāndhunābhihṛdbhālamūrdhvasvapiśiśoḥsmaret
netreśiṣyasyabadhnīyānnetramaṃtreṇavāsasā netramaṃtreṇavoṣaḍitimaṃtreṇakaregṛhītvātaṃśi
ṣyaṃkuṃḍatomaṃḍalaṃnayet tasyāṃjaliṃpunaḥpuṣpaipūrayitvāyathāvidhi kalaśedevatāprī-
tyaikṣepanyenmūlamuccaran vyapohanaṃtetrabaṃdhamāsīnaṃdarbhasaṃstare ātmayāgakramādbhūyaḥ
saṃhṛtotyādyadaiśikaḥ tattanmaṃtroditonyāsāḥkuryāddeheśiśostadā paṃcopacāraiḥkuṃbha
sthāṃpūjayitveṣṭadevatām gaṃdhādayonivedyāṃtāḥpūjāḥpaṃcopacārikāmaṃḍalaṃsaṃskṛ
taṃśiṣyamasminnevapraveśayet nadatsupaṃcavādyeṣusārdhaṃviprāśiṣāṃguruḥvidhivatkuṃ
bhumuddhṛtyatanmukhasthānmuradrumān śiśośirasivinyasyamātṛkāṃmanasājapan
mūlenasādhitaistoyairabhiṣiṃcetumātmavit avaśiṣṭenatoyenaśiṣyamāśāmayedguruḥ
uktāyaśiṣyovimalevāsasīparidhāyacācamyavāgyatobhūtvāniṣedhetsannidhoguroḥdevatā
mātmanaḥśiṣyesaṃkrātāṃdaiśikottamaḥpūjayadgaṃdhapuṣpādyairaikyaṃsaṃbhāvayaṃstayoḥnivṛttyādyāḥkalā
paṃcabhūtānāṃśaktayoyataḥ tasmādbhūtamayedehedhyātvātāvedhayecchiśoḥnivṛttiḥjānuparyaṃtaṃtalādārabhyasaṃsthitāḥ

pṛ0 28ba) jānunornābhiparyaṃtaṃpratiṣṭāvyāpyatiṣṭati nābheḥkaṃṭhāvadhivyāptāvidyāśāṃtistataḥparam
kaṃṭhāllalāṭaparyaṃtaṃvyāptātasmācchirovadhiśāṃtyatītākalājñeyākalāvyāptiritīritā
itivinyasyaśikhyāṅgedevatāṃbhāvayandhiyā amukamaṃtraṃdadāmītipratijñāṃśrāvayettataḥ da-
dasveticaternoktetāroccāraṇapūrvakaṃ dadyādvidyāṃtatastasmaivinītāyoṃvupūrvakam ādau
ṛṣyādikaṃcoktāsmṛtvācadevatāṃdhiyā gurustuprāṅmukhobhūtvāśiṣyaḥprācīmukhaḥsthitaḥ
trivāraṃdakṣiṇekarṇevāmecaivatathāsakṛt vrāhmaṇānāmeṣavidhistriśūdrāṇāṃtuvāmake
caturthepāṭhayitvātaṃśiṣyahastejalaṃpunaḥ ayaṃcamaṃtrāvayoḥsamānaphaladostvitivrāhma
ṇāvrūyuḥśiṣyaścapratigṛhyacaguruvidyāṃsamālabhyāṣṭottaraśataṃjapet athavāhyaṣṭakṛtvā
ścajapenmaṃtramananyayoḥ gururmaṃtradevatānāmaikyaṃsaṃbhāvayandhiyā praṇameddaṃḍavadbhūmauguruṃ
taṃdevatātmakam tasyapādāṃvujadvaṃdvaṃnijamūrdhaṃniyojayet athadakṣiṇā uktaṃcavrahma
saṃhitāyāṃvṛṣāvipravacoyastugṛhṇātimānavaḥśubhe adatvādakṣiṇānnāpisayātina
rakaṃdhruvam evaṃdakṣiṇāṃvastrayugmaṃcācāryāyanivedayedityādinālakṣaṇāyāāvaśya
katvam tadevaviśadayīta dīkṣāṃteti athacavṛhanmatsyasūktedīkṣāṃtedakṣiṇāṃprāhuḥ
svarṇagobhūmiṣaṇam vastrabhājanavastrānnapaśudāsāsanānica śarīramarthaṃprāṇāṃścasarvaṃtasmai

pṛ0 29a) nivedayet tataḥprabhṛtikurvītaguroḥpriyamananyadhīḥ yadyadiṣṭatamaṃvastuguruvetannive
dayet guravedakṣiṇāṃdadyātprakṣāyaśivātmane sarvasvaṃvātadardhaṃvātadardhaṃvātadājñayāna
caitsaṃcāriṇīśaktiḥkathamasyabhaviṣyati tathācapārvatīharasaṃvāde sarvasvaṃdakṣiṇāṃ
dadyādgāṃcadadyātpayasvinīm bhūmiṃvṛttikarīṃdadyātputrapautrānuyāyinīm tathācapāri-
jāteśvare guravedakṣiṇāṃdadyātsvavarṇavāsaḥsamanvitām anyathānaivasiddhiḥsyāda
bhicārāyakalpate ṛtvigbhyodakṣiṇāṃdadyātsamagrāṃprītamānasaḥvittaśāṭhyaṃvināsa-
rvaṃguravesannivedayet maṃḍapaṃmaṃḍapadravyaṃguravesamarpayet athavākimihoktenapārvatī
prāṇavallabhe gurvarthaṃmatimānnityaṃśarīramapisaṃtyajet tathāca smṛtaulaghuhārītaḥ e
kamapyakṣaraṃyastuguruḥśiṣyainibodhayet pṛthivyāṃnāstitaddravyaṃyaddatvāsoṛṇībhavet
bhojanaṃcānnapānīyamanyebhyopinivedayet guravevrāhmaṇebhyothipiṣṭaṃbhakṣyaṃprakalpayet
vṛddhabhyovālakebhyothanānābhakṣyaṃprakalpayet bhakṣyaṃbhojyaṃtathāyeṣyaṃlehyaṃpeyaṃcacarvaṇaṃ ādau
catvācaguraveviprebhyastadanaṃtaram vrāhmaṇāstarpayetpaścādbhakṣyabhojyasadakṣiṇāṃ guruḥsvaśa
ktirakṣārthaṃsahasraṃprajapenmanuṃ śiṣyaḥkuryātprayatnenaguroḥprītimananyadhīḥ tathāīśānasaṃ
hitāyāṃ dīkṣāṃkṛtvāyadāmaṃtrīupavāsaṃcaredyadi tasyadevaḥsadāruṣṭaḥśāpaṃpatatimūrdhani

pṛ0 29ba) dātāgṛhītānopoṣyedupavāsaḥśriyaṃharet bhaikṣyaṃhaviṣyaṃśākādivihitāniphalaṃpayaḥ
mūlaṃsakturyavotpannobhakṣyāṇyetānimaṃtriṇāṃ tasmādannaṃsamaśrīyāddhaviṣyānnenaśāṅkari na
nvekādaśādauviṣṇumaṃtrasyadānaśravaṇāttadvaca nasyabādhāpateḥkāmyenanityasyābādhāt
iticet āghrāyapitṛsevitamitivedasvopapattiḥ vastutastuditaraparamitibhāvaḥeṣā
kalāvatīdīkṣāproktāḥsarvaisamṛddhidā ityāgamakalpalatāyāṃcaturthaḥpaṭala 4
oṃnamaḥśivāya homastutrividhonityanaimittikakāmyabhedāt sarvatrahomasyāvaśya
katvamiti taduktarudrayāmale nājaptaḥsiddhyatemaṃtronāhutaścakadācana japahomobha
yārthatvātpūjāyāḥmūrtilakṣaṇamiti athahomavidhiṃvakṣyesarvataṃtrānusārataḥ tasyavaikuṃḍa
sādhyatvādidānīṃtannirūpyate viprāṇāṃcaturaaṃsyādrājñāṃvartulamiṣyatevaiśyānāmardhacaṃ
drābhaṃśūdrāṇāṃtryaśramīritam caturaśraṃtusarveṣāṃkecidicchaṃtitāṃtrikā taduktaṃtattvasā
rasaṃhitāyām āgamānanusṛtyaivavahniḥsaṃskriyatetudhaiḥtaistadaṃgulamānenakuṃḍā-
dyapividhīyatām kuṃḍasyarūpaṃjānīyātparamaṃprakṛtervapuḥ prācyāṃśiraḥsamākhyātaṃbā
hūdakṣiṇasaumyayoḥ udaraṃkuṃḍamityuktaṃyoniḥpādautupaścime sarvasiddhikaraṃkuṃḍaṃcatura
sraṃmurāhṛtaṃ savāghīkārikaṃkuṃḍaṃsarvadaṃcaturatsakaṃ caturasraṃmaheśānisarvakarmāṇi

pṛ0 30a) sādhayet hastaniyamoyathāgautamīye rathādidolikācaivapotaṃśakaṭamevaca mānāṃgu-
lenakartavyaṃnānyenāpikadācana muṣṭyaratripramāṇāniyatkiṃcitkathitānica yajamānasya
kartavyaṃnānyasyāpikadācana mānakriyāmāmuktānāmanyaktemānakarmaṇi mānakṛdya
jamānaḥsyādviduṣāmevanirṇayaḥ caturviṃśatyaṃgulāḍhyaṃhastaṃtaṃtravidoviduḥ karturdakṣi-
ṇahastasyamadhyamāṃguliparvaṇaḥ madhyasyadairghyamānenamānāṃgulamudāhṛtam yajamānā
sannidhau yavānāṃtaṃḍulairekamaṃgulaṃcāṣṭabhirbhavet tathācoktaṃsārasaṃgrahe yasyāṃgulo
yastasyāṃśoyavoṣṭamudāhṛtaḥ tilastatpaṃcamāṃśeṣyātṣaṣṭomāṣastilasyaca tā(ccatu
rviśatiḥkaraiḥadīrghayojitairhastaṃcaturviśatiraṃgulaiḥ aṣṭabhistairyavairjyeṣṭaṃmadhyamaṃsa
ptabhiryavaiḥ kaniṣṭaṃṣaḍbhiruddiṣṭaṃhastecamunimattama uvācavasiṣṭhaṭapaṃcarātre śā-)
(tāvadaṃśaścanīvārastasyaṣaṣṭolavopica sarvatraivaṃhitadgrāhyamaṃgulaṃmadhyamaṃgulaiḥ madhya-
maṃgulaiḥ madhyamāyāmadhyamaparvamānaṃ) radāyāṃcamuṣṭimātramitaṃkuṃḍaṃśatārdheparicakṣate
śatahomeratrimātraṃhastamātraṃsahasrake bhaviṣyottare sahasretvathahortavyekuryātkuḍaṃkarātmakaṃ dvihasta
mayutaṃtaccalakṣahomecatuṣkaraṃ tathācavijñānalalitāyāṃ vedalakṣaṃṣaṃṭakarecadaśalakṣaṃkarāṣṭa
ke daśahastāṃtukoṭyāṃvaihastasaṃkhyāvyavasthiteticaturasraṃcatuṣkoṇaṃdvihastādikeyāmalaḥ

pṛ0 30ba) pūrvapūrvasyakuṃḍasyakoṇasūtreṇanirmitam uttarottarakuṃḍānāṃmānaṃtatparikīrtiṃtam pū-
