taṃ sanyacoktaṃyāmatnaṃdvihastamayutelesoturhastamudīritam daśalakṣetuṣaḍhastaḥko
ṭyāmaṣṭakaraṃsmṛtam athavā ekahastamitaṃkuṃḍamekalakṣevidhīyate lakṣaṇāṃdaśakaṃ
yāvattāvaddhastenavarddhayet daśahastamitaṃkuṃḍaṃkoṭihomevidhīyate vasiṣṭapaṃcarātrekuṃ
ḍasvarūpamāha ekahastapramāṇaṃtaṃcaturasramudīritaṃ yāvānkuṃḍasyavistāraḥkhananaṃtā
vadiṣṭate kuṃḍānāṃyādṛśaṃrūpaṃmekhalāyāścatādṛśam caturasraṃcatuṣkoṇamityarthaḥa
