travitsarvakuṃḍake mekhalātritayaṃvāthadvitīyaṃcaikamevavā vedāgninayanocchedamaṃgu
ladvitayaṃkramāt taduktaṃkriyāsāre pradhānamekhalocchedamuktamatranavāṃgulam tadvā
