vacanopātutvādetatparimāṇakathanaṃmuṣṭyaratryekaviṣayamidam ekaikāṃgulatoyoniṃ 
kuṃḍeṣvanyeṣuvardhayet yavadvayakrameṇaivayonyagramapivardhayet itidvihastādiviṣaya
m atraviśeṣakābhāvādāyāmavistāronnatiṣuviṣṭavivṛtirititatvam tathācayajña
pārśve mekhalāyāṃcabahiḥsthānaṃsthalamityabhidhīyate caturasretunālaṃsyādyonyāmadhyesa
randhrakam sthūlamūlātusūkṣmāgrātannāsāsyānmanoharā bāhyasthaṃmekhalāṃcājyasthāna
mārabhyakārayet sarandhrakamityubhayatrasaṃbadhyate taduktaṃbhāskarācāryaiḥyononālaṃsaraṃ
dhrakam rudrayāmale yonyāmadhyevilaṃkuryāttadājyagrāhisaṃjñikam sthūlādārabhyanā
laṃsyādyonyāmadhyesaraṃdhrakam nārpayetkuṃḍakoṇeṣuyonitāṃtaṃtravittamaḥ sthalānmekhalā

pṛ0 32a) raṃbhasthalāt athavājyasthālyagdhikaraṇaṃsthalādvetyarthaḥ saraṃdhrakamadṛṣṭārthakami-
tikecit tathācayāmale nālamekhalayormadhyeparidheḥsthāpanāyaca raṃ-
dhraṃkuryāttathāvidvāndvitīyamekhaloparītiśruteḥ itivacanaṃtunālasyana-
saraṃdhratābodhakam kiṃtunālamekhalayoḥparidhimāha tatsaṃyogapariśi
ṣṭhebaddhamātrāḥparidhuyṛjavaḥsatvacovraṇāḥ trayobhavaṃtyaśīrṇāgrāekeṣāṃ
tucaturdiśam tattatkuṃḍānurūpaṃvāmānamasyānigadyate prāgagrābhi-
taḥpaścādudagagramathāparam nyasetparidhimanyaccedudagagraḥsapūrvataḥ
avraṇācchidrarahitāḥ abhitaḥagrepārśvadvaye dakṣiṇuttarataḥpaścātpaści
me udagagramuttarāgram trailokyasāre kuṃbhadvayasamāyuktāgajakuṃbhākā
ramūladeśayuktānatānā aṃguṣṭamekhalāyuktāṃguṣṭamitamṛdghaṭitayutā
mekhalāveṣṭanayutāmekhalāṃveṣṭanayutā tathādvehastagalitājyasthityākuṃḍetanyātobhavatī
tyarthaḥatevasvāyaṃbhuve aṃguṣṭamānauṣṭakaṃṭhākāryāśvatthadalākṛtiḥ aṃguṣṭamānoṣṭaṃkaṃṭheyasyāḥ
sātathā oṣṭotrāyaṃ tathācapaṃcarātre kalpayedaṃtareṇābhiṃkuṃḍasyāṃbujasaṃnnibhāṃ muṣṭiratryekahastānāṃ
nābhirucchedavistṛtā netravedāṅgulopetākuṃḍeṣvanyeṣuvardhayet yadvayakrameṇaivanābhiṃpṛthagudāradhīḥ

pṛ0 32ba) nābhikṣetretridhākṛtvāmadhyekurvītakarṇikām bahiraṃśadvayenāṣṭaupattrāṇiparikalpa
yet sruksruvausaṃpravakṣyāmimaṃtriṇāṃhitakāmyayā prakalpayetsrucaṃyāgevakṣya-
māṇenavartmanā śrīparṇīśiśapākṣīriśākhiśvekatamaṃguruḥ śiṃśapāśamī-
śīrīṣitikecit gṛhītvāvibhajeddhastamātreṣaṭtriṃśatāpunaḥ viśatyaṃśaibhave-
t ekāṃśenamitaḥkaṃṭhaḥsaptabhāgamitaṃmukham vīdīdyaṃśenavistāraḥkaṃṭhasyapa
rikīrtitaḥ mukhaṃkaṃṭhasamānaṃsyāndukhemārgaṃprakalpayet kaniṣṭāṃgulimānena
sarpiṣonirgamāyaca vedīmadhyevidhātavyābhāgenaikenakarṇikā vidadhītava-
histasyāekāṃśenābhitovadam tasyakhātaṃtribhirbhāgairvṛtamardhaṃśatobahiḥ aṃśe
naikaparitodalāniparikalpayet avaṭaṃrātam mekhalāmukhavedyoḥsyātparito
vāṃśamānataḥ daṃḍamūlāgrayoḥkuṃbhauguṇavedāṅgulaiḥkramāt gāṃḍīyugaṃsamāṃśaiḥ
syāddaṃḍasyānāharaṃritaḥ ṣaḍbhiraṃśaiḥpṛṣṭabhāgauvedyātkurmākṛtirbhavet haṃsasyavāha
stinovāpottriṇovāmukhaṃlikhet mukhasyapṛṣṭabhāgesyāt saṃproktaṃlakṣaṇaṃsru-

pṛ0 33a) caḥ sruvaścaturviṃśatibhirbhāgairāracayetsruvam dvāviṃśatyādaṃḍamānasaṃśairetasya
kīrtitam caturviṃśairānāhaḥkarṣājyagrāhyatacchiraḥ ānāhodīrghaḥ karṣasto-
lakadvayam aṃśadvayenavilikhetpaṃkemṛgepadākṛtidaṃḍamūlāgrayorgaṃḍī
