khyatādhikebhavedrogīhenīdhenudhanākṣayaḥ vakrakuṃḍeṣusaṃtāpomaraṇaṃbhinnamekhalaṃ
mekhalārahitośokohyadhikevittasaṃkṣayāḥ bhāryāvināśakaṃkuṃḍaṃproktaṃyo-
nyāvinākṛtam apahyedhvaṃsanaṃproktaṃkuṃḍayatkaṃṭhavarjitam atevavasiṣṭasaṃ
hitāyām tasmātsamyakparīkṣyeyaṃkartavyaṃśubhavedikam hastamātraṃsthaṃḍilaṃ
vāsaṃkṣiptehomakarmaṇi kriyāsāre kuṃḍamevavidhiṃnasyātsthaṃḍilevāsamāśrayet śā
radātilakenityaṃnaimitikaṃkāmyaṃsthaṃḍilevāsamāśrayet hastamātraṃtutatkuryāccaturasraṃsamaṃtataḥ

pṛ0 33ba) mahākapilapaṃcarātre saṃkhyānuktauśataṃsāṣṭaṃsahasraṃvājapādiṣu homesvāhāṃtamāha ya
