smṛtaḥgodānegodānākhyasaṃskāre caturthyāṃtuśikhīnāṃmādhṛtiragnistathāpare a
parevṛtihomādau prāyaścittevidhuścaivapākayajñetusāhasaḥśayaścitteprāyaścittā
tmakamahāvyāhṛnihomādaupākayajñepākāṅgahome vṛṣotsargagṛhapratiṣṭāhomā
daulakṣahomecavahniḥsyātkoṭihomehutāśanaḥpūrṇāhutyāṃmṛḍonāmasāntikevara
daḥsadā pauṣṭikaṃvaladaścaivakrodhogniścābhicārake koṣṭaṃtujaṭaronāmakravyādo
mṛtabhakṣaṇe mṛtadāheguṇaviṣṇudhṛtāsaṭatirapi sarvataḥpāṇipādaṃtaḥsarvato
kṣiśiromukhaḥviśvarūpomahānagniḥpraṇītaḥsarvakarmasu āhuyatyādikamatra
vodhyam agnipraṇayanānaṃtaraṃsarvatretyasyapāṭhoyujyate praṇītitimaṃtraliṃgāt
anyathāsthāpanāṃtarametadabhidhānaṃvyarthaṃsyāt guṇaviṣṇunāpiśratiriti āhū
yacaivahotavyaṃyatrayovihitonalaḥtathā śubhaṃpātraṃtukāmyaṃsyāttenāgniṃpraṇaye-
dbudhaḥtasyābhāveśarāvenanavenābhimukhaṃcatam pūrṇāyāṃviśeṣamāha sāmagā-

pṛ0 35a) nāṃtupūrṇāhomamityādimūrdhānaṃdivoratimititutaditarāṇāṃśāṃtidopikāyāṃvasi
ṣṭaḥaiśānyāmāharedbhasmasrucāvāthasruveṇavā vaṃdanāṃkārayettenaśiraḥkaṃṭhāṃsakeṣu
ca kaśyapasyetimaṃtreṇayathānukramayogataḥtathā tataḥśāṃtiṃprakurvītaavadhāraṇa
