taṃtrānusārataḥ śrathakṛtanityakṛtyoguruḥ śubhalagnetuṣāḍgārarahitaśuddhabhūmaudī-
kṣāṅgaṃyāgamaṃḍapanirmāṇakuryāt tatodīkṣāpūrvadinamaḍapamadhyeyathoktāṃvediṃnirmā
yataduparisarvatobhadramaṃḍalaṃkuryāt maṃḍapamaṃḍalayoḥpramāṇamanyatramapramāṇenusaṃ-
dheyatatīdīkṣādivaseprātaḥkṛtanityakṛtyogururmaṃḍapadvāramāgatyavahirupalipya
tatraprāṅmukhudaṅmukhovāupaviśet śuciḥpūrvamupoṣitaḥśiṣyopitatrāmatya
svastivācanapūrvakaṃsaṃkalpaṃkṛtvāgurugaṃdhādibhiḥsaṃpūjyavṛṇuyāt saṃkalpoya
