mukagotraṃthīamukadevaśarmāṇaṃśrīamukadevatāyāḥpadakṣaramaṃtradaiśikatvenai
bhiḥpādyādibhirabhyarcyabhavaṃtamahaṃvṛṇeoṃvṛtosmītivacanam tataḥśiṣyoya-

pṛ0 35ba) thāvihitaṃdīkṣākarmakurvitirvadet yathājñānataḥkaravāṇītiguruḥtataḥkṛtāṃja
