dāvarisarasvati narmadesiṃdhukāverijalesminsannidhiṃkuruityaṃkuśamudrayātīrtha
mābāhyatatrapraṇavenagaṃdhākṣatānnikṣipyamūlamaṃtramaṣṭadhājaptvādhenumudrāṃprada-
