dvārapūjāṃkuryāt tadyathā dvārasyordhvaśākhāyāṃ madhyevighnāyanamaḥtaddakṣiṇe ma
hālakṣmyainamaḥtadvāmesarasvatyainamaḥ dvāradakṣe vighneśāyanamaḥ gaṃgāyainamaḥ

pṛ0 36a) dvāravāme kṣettreśāyanamaḥyamunāyainamaḥdehalyāṃastrāyanamaḥevaṃpratidvāraṃpūjāṃkuryāt
tatoṅgaṃ saṃśodhyadakṣiṇapādapuraḥsaraṃgṛhaṃpraviśet tataḥpaṃcagavyasāmānārghatoyābhyāṃ
gṛhābhyaṃtaraṃsaṃprokṣyasaṃskāracatuṣṭayaṃkuryāt yathā mūlamaṃtreṇagṛhaṃvikṣet phaḍitigṛ
haṃprokṣayet phaḍitimaṃtreṇadarbhaistāḍayet humitibhyukṣaṇaṃkuryāt tataḥpūjāsthalerakta
