viniyogaḥkṛtāṃjaliḥpṛthvitvayādhṛtālokādevitvaṃvismanādhṛtā tvecadhārayamā-
nityaṃpavitraṃkurucāsanam itipaṭhitvā hrīṃśrīṃādhāraśaktikamalāmanāyanamaḥ
