tīkaraṇaparamīkaraṇamudrābhirghaṭadevatāmāvāhyatasminghaṭepīṭhānpūjayet oṃā

pṛ0 41a) dhāraśaktayenamaḥoṃkūrmāyanamaḥoṃanaṃtāyanamaḥoṃpṛthivyainamaḥoṃsudhāsāgarāyanamaḥoṃra
tnadvīpāyanamaḥoṃkalpavṛkṣāyanamaḥoṃratnamaṃḍapāyanamaḥoṃratnavedikāyainamaḥoṃma(hāsiṃ)
hāsiṃhāsanāyanamaḥitisaṃpūjyapuṣpaṃgṛhītvādevatāṃdhyātvāghaṭepuṣpaṃdattvāṣoḍaśopacāraiḥ
pūjayet tadyathā āsanaṃsvāgataṃcārghyaṃpādyamācamanīyakam madhuparkācamanasnānava-
sanābharaṇānica gaṃdhapuṣpedhūpadīpaunaivedyaṃvaṃdanaṃtathā prayojayedarśanāyāmupacāraṃstu
ṣoḍaśa taduktaṃmānasollāsesavuddhyāpradedenmaṃtrīhyupacārāṃstuṣoḍaśa saṃvuddhyāsaṃvodhanapa
dena pūjāyathā śrīamukadevateāsanekalpayāminamaḥsvāgataṃkuśalapraśnaṃ śrīamu
kadevaterghaṃkalpayāmisvāhāitimūrdhnidadyāt śrīamukadevatepādyaṃkalpayāmina-
mitipādayordadyāt śrīamukedevateācamanīyaṃkalpayāmisvāhetimukhedadyāt
śrīamukadevatemadhuparkakalpayāminamitimukhobujedadyāt śrīcumukadevateāca
manīyaṃkalpayāminamaḥ śrīamukadevatesnānīyaṃkalpayāminamaḥśrīamukadevate
vastraṃkalpayāminamaḥ śrīamukadevateyajñopavītaṃkalpayāminamaḥśrīamukadeva-
teābhaṃraṇāniyajñopavītaṃkalpayāminamaḥ śrīamukadevategaṃdhaṃkalpayāminamaḥ
śrīamukadevatepuṣpaṃkalpayāminamaḥśrīgrapukadevatedhūpaṃkalpayāminamaḥdīpaṃka

pṛ0 41ba) lpayāminamaḥnaivedyaṃpurataḥsamānīpārghajalenāstrāyaphaḍityabhyukṣyahuṃavaguṃṭhyavaṃitidhe
numudrayāmṛtīkṛtyataduparimūlamaṣṭadhājatvāśrīamukadevatenaivedyaṃkalpayāminamityu
tsṛjyaamṛtopastaraṇamasisvāhā itijalagaṃḍūṣaṃdattvāprāṇāyasvāhāpānāyasvā
hā samānāyasvāhāudānāyasvāhāvyānāyasvāhāitipraṇavādyaṃpaṃcaprāṇāhutīḥ
hutvātasyāḥsvīkāraṃvibhāvyoṃamṛtāpidhānamasisvāhāitipunarapośānaṃdattvā
śrīamukadevateācamanīyaṃkalpayāminamaḥityācamanaṃdattvāśrīapukadevatetāṃ-
vūlaṃkalpayāminamititāṃbūlaṃdattvāmukadevatāyainamitipuṣpāṃjalitrayeṇapū-
jayet tatratatrajalaṃdadyādupacārāṃtabāṃtarekesareṣvagnikonāgnikonāgnihṛdayādī-
ścapūjayet hrāṃhṛdayāyanamaḥ hrīṃśirasesvāhā hrūṃśikhāyaivaṣaṭhraiṃkavacāyahuṃ
agrehrauṃnetrebhyovauṣaṭ adyepūrvādiṣuastrāyaphaṭ iticatudiṃkṣupūjayet tataḥtattadde
vatāvaraṇānsaṃpūjyalokapālānpūjayet raṃdramagniyamaṃrakṣovaruṇaṃpavanaṃvidhum ī
śānnaṃpannagādeśamadhurdhvaṃpitāmahaṃ yathoktadikṣvotātpūjayet tatasteṣāmastrāṇi va
jraṃśaktiṃdaṃḍamasiṃpāśamakuśakaṃgadāmśūlaṃcakraṃpadmameṣāmāyudhānikramādviduḥkramā
dāyudhānyapi saṃpūjyadeyamānasyamaṃtrasyamaṃtrasyadaśasaṃskārānkuryāt tadyathājananaṃjī

pṛ0 42a) vanaṃpaścāttāḍanaṃbodhanaṃtathā athābhiṣekovimalekaraṇāpyāyanetataḥtarpaṇaṃdīpanaṃguptiḥ
deśaitāmaṃtrasaṃskriyāḥmaṃtrāṇyamāraṃkāmapyāduddhārojananaṃsmṛtam praṇavāṃtaritānkṛtvāmaṃtra
varṇāṃjjapetsudhīḥetajjīvanamityāhuḥmaṃtrataṃtraviśāradāḥpraṇavāṃtaritetideyamaṃtrasyaikai
kavarṇānaṃtaraṃpraṇavaṃdattvājapedityarthaḥetanmaṃtrasyajīvanam maṃtravarṇānsamālikhyatāḍa
yeccāndanāṃbhasā pratyekaṃvāyunāmaṃtrītāḍanaṃtadvadāhṛtam pratyekamitideyamaṃtrasyapratyakṣa
ropariyamitivāyubījamuccaraṃścanamiśritajalaṃdadyāt itimaṃtrasyatāḍanam vilikhyamaṃ
traṃtanmaṃtrīprasūnaiḥkaravīrajaiḥtanmaṃtrākṣarasaṃkhyātaiḥhanma**dyāṃtenabodhanamaḥtāmrapaṭādā
kiparthaḥyāṃtenetiekārasyāṃtorephaḥtathācaramitibījena etanmaṃtrasyabodhanam sva
taṃtroktavidhānenamaṃtrīmaṃtrasyasaṃkhyayā aśvatthapallavairmaṃtramabhiṣicadviśuddhaye svataṃtrokte
ti viṣṇupakṣeśuklacaṃdanajalenadevīpakṣeraktacadanenetyarthaḥ saṃciṃtyanatasāmaṃtraṃjyotirmaṃ
treṇanirdahet maṃtremalatrayaṃmaṃtrīvimalīkaraṇaṃ jyotirmaṃtreṇa oṃhrīṃitimaṃtreṇamalatrayaṃ
kuśodakenajaptenapratyarṇaṃprokṣaṇaṃmanoḥtenamaṃtreṇavidhivadetadāpyāyanaṃmatam tenamaṃtre
ṇadeyamaṃtreṇa etanmaṃtrasyāpyāyanam maṃtreṇavāriṇāmaṃtrītarpaṇaṃtarpaṇaṃmatam maṃtreṇadeya
maṃtraṇa tathācamūlamaṃtramuccāryamukamaṃtraṃtarpayāmītiprayāgaḥetanmaṃtrasyatarpaṇam tāramā

pṛ0 42ba) yāramāyogomanordīpanamucyate tārāḥoṃmāyāhrīṃramāśrīṃyogaḥsaṃvaṃdhaḥtenadeyamaṃtrasyā
dau oṃhrīṃśrīṃitivījatrayaṃdattvājapedityarthaḥetanmaṃtrasyadīpanam japyamācasyamaṃtrasya
mopanatvaprakāśanam saṃskārāḥdaśasaṃproktāḥsarvataṃtreṣugopitāḥyānkṛtvāsaṃpradāye-
namaṃtrīvāṃchitamāpnuyāt tatohomaṃkuryāt yathāprāṅmukhupaviṣṭaḥsvastivācana
pūrvakaṃsūryaḥsomitipaṭitvātilakuśajalānyādāyaviṣṇuḥadyetyādiamukagotraḥ
śrīamukadevaśarmācaturvargaphalaprāptikāmaḥśrīamukadevatāyāyadakṣaramaṃtrasyadī
kṣākarmāṅgabhūtaśrīamukadevatāyāḥyadakṣaramaṃtrapūrvakaṃtilājyādibhiraṣṭottarasa
hasraṃśataṃvāhomakarmakariṣyeitisaṃkalpayajjāgratitipaṭhet tatraprathamataḥsarvādhi
kārikaṃcaturaśraṃkuṃḍaṃnirūpyayāmitatrasahasrādihomeśalyādiśodhitepuruṣamāna
khani tevāśubhetatkuryāt taduktaṃviṣṇusaṃhitāyām ādībhūmiṃparikṣetavāstujñāna
viśāradaḥ śalyādīśodhayedyatnādathathāpuruṣaṃkhanet puruṣaṃkhanet puruṣaṃpuruṣa
pramāṇam ādaukuṃḍasthānaṃgemayenopalipyayāmānyārghaṃsaṃsthāpyasāmānyārghajalenā-
bhyukṣyapaṃcagavyairabhyukṣaṇaṃkuryāt tatracaturviśatyaṃgulapramāṇaṃcaturaśraṃnirmāyāṣṭāda
śasaṃskārānkuryāt yathāśāradātilake vīkṣaṇaṃmulamaṃtreṇaśareṇaprokṣaṇaṃmatam

pṛ0 43a) tenaivatāḍanaṃdarbhairvarmaṇābhyukṣaṇaṃmatam astreṇakhananodārauhṛdayenaprapūraṇam samīka-
raṇamastreṇasecanaṃvarmaṇāmatam kuṭṭanaṃhetimaṃtreṇavarmamaṃtreṇamārjanam vilepanaṃkalārū
pakalpanaṃtadanaṃtaram trisūtrīkaraṇaṃpaścāddhṛdayenārcanaṃmatam astreṇavajrīkaraṇaṃhṛ-
nmatreṇakuśeḥśubhaiḥcatuṣpathaṃtanutreṇatanuyādakṣapādanam yāyekuṃḍānisaṃskaryātsaṃskā
rairabhirīrivaiḥmūlamaṃtreṇadeyamānamaṃtreṇa tatsthānaṃpaśyet astrāyaphaḍititatsthānaṃpro
kṣayet astrāyapāḍitidarbhaisthāḍanaṃtāḍayet humititatsthānamabhyukṣayet astrāyapha
ḍitikuṃḍasyakhananam yāvānkuṃḍasyavistāraḥkhananaṃtāvadiṣyate astrāyaphaḍitimṛtti
keddharaṇaṃnamitimaṃtreṇaprapūraṇaṃmṛttikāṃtareṇasamīkaraṇārthaṃmṛttikoddhārasthāṃnaṃpūra-
yet astrāyaphaḍititatsthānaṃsamīkuryāt humititatsthānaṃsiṃcet haṃitimaṃtreṇavākuṭṭa
nam kuṭṭanaṃdṛḍhīkaraṇam prathavāhumitimaṃtreṇakuṭṭanam humitrimaṃtreṇakuṭṭanasthānaṃmā
rjayet namitimaṃtraṇatatsthānaṃgomayenomeyanopalepayet tatohumitimaṃtreṇatatkuṃḍa
kalārūpaṃbhāvayet tatonamitimaṃtreṇaraktasūtratrayenaśuklasūtrayenavāmadhyamekhalāṃveṣṭa
yet ititrisūtrīkaraṇam namitikuṃḍamarcayet itivajrīkaraṇam namitimaṃtreṇakuśo
tkuṃḍāṃtarecaturaśrekuryāt madhyeāvamadhyabhāgaḥpūrvasatyabhāgaḥpaścimeāhavanīyabhāgaḥ

pṛ0 43ba) uttarepravāhāryaḥdakṣiṇegārhaspatyaḥiticatuṣpathīkaraṇam itikecit vastutastukuṃḍamadhye
pūrvapaścimadakṣiṇottarakrameṇakuśacatuṣṭayadāvamevatat namitimaṃtreṇakuṃḍasyamadhyeme
khalāyāṃdakṣiṇapaścimottareṣuviṣṭaratrayasthāpanāryaṃdvādaśāṃgulapramāṇānmūlamaṃtreṇā
bhimaṃtritānkuśānāstaret tathācarāghavabhaṭṭaḥviṣṭarastaraṇārthaṃtumūlamaṃtrābhimaṃtrita
mdvādaśāṃgulamānaṃtuakṣapāṭaprakīrtitam ityakṣapāṭanam ityaṣṭādaśasaṃskārānkuryāt
athavātānisaṃskuryāccaturbhirvīkṣaṇādibhiḥyathā mūlamaṃtreṇakuṃḍaṃpaśyetastrāyaphaḍi-
tikuṃḍaṃprokṣayet astrāyaphaḍitidarbhaiḥkuṃḍaṃtāḍayet hramitikuṃḍamabhyukṣayet itisaṃskā
racatuṣṭayaṃvākuryāt kuṃḍakaraṇāśaktauhastapramāṇaṃsthaṃḍilaṃkṛtvāyathāsaṃbhavasaṃskāraṃkṛ-
tvāhomaṃkuryāt sthaṃḍilaṃyathā hastāyāmaṃsuvistāramaṃguṣṭonnataṃcaturaśraṃkārayet taduktaṃga
ṇaṃśavimarṣiṇam athavāsthaṃḍilaṃkuryāddhomārthaṃmaṃtrimuttamaḥaṃguṣṭaparvaṇocchedaṃhastā
yāmaṃsamaṃśubham athavāvarṇayattyekesthaṃḍilaṃhastamātrakam caturaṃgulamutsedhaṃbālukā
bhiḥsamaṃtatiti tataḥkuṃḍamadhyepūrvāgrarekhātrayaṃuttarāgraṃrekhātrayaṃvilikhyārghapātraṃsaṃsthā
pyatasyadakṣiṇerghapātravatpraṇītapātraṃprokṣaṇīpātraṃcasaṃsthāpyārghajalaṃtatrakiṃcinnidadyāt
tataḥpraṇavamuccāran arghajalenakhāmabhyukṣyaprāgagrāyāṃrekhāyāṃprathamarekhākrameṇapuyet

pṛ0 44a) prathamarekhāyāṃmukudāyanamaḥdvitīyarekhāyāṃīśānāyanamaḥtṛtīyarekhāyāṃ puraṃdarāyanamaḥuttā
rāgrarekhāyām prathamarekhāyāṃvrahmaṇenamaḥdvitīyarekhāyāṃvaivasvatāyanaḥkūrmāyanamaḥanaṃtā
yanamaḥpṛthivyainamaḥsudhāsāgarāyanamaḥratnadvījāyanamaḥkalpavṛkṣāyanamaḥtṛtīyarekhā-
yāmindavenamaḥitisaṃpūjyatanmadhyetrikoṇaṃtadupariṣaṭkāyāṃtaduparivṛttaṃlikhitvā oṃkā
ramuccaran arghajalenasaṃprokṣyataduparipīṭhācarsayet yathā oṃādhāraśaktyainamaḥoṃkūrmāya
namaḥoṃanaṃtāyaḥnamaḥoṃpṛthivyainamaḥoṃsudhāsāgarāyanamaḥoṃratnadvīpāyanamaḥoṃkalpavṛ
kṣāyanamaḥoṃratnavedikāyainamaḥoṃciṃtāmaṇigṛharājāyanamaḥoṃratnasiṃhāyanamaḥoṃānaṃ
dakaṃdāyanamaḥoṃsaṃvitrālāyanamaḥoṃtattvātmakayagrāyanamaḥoṃprakṛtimayapattrebhyonamaḥ
oṃvikāramayakesarebhyonamaḥoṃpaṃcāśadvījādyakarṇikāyainamaḥoṃdharmāyanamaḥoṃjñānā
yanamaḥ oṃvairāgyāyanamaḥoṃaiśvaryāyanamaḥoṃadharmāyanamaḥoṃajñānāyanamaḥoṃavai
rāgyāyanamaḥoṃanaiśvaryāyanamaḥoṃamukadevatāsthaṃḍilāyanamaḥ itipīṭhānisaṃpū
nyatanmadhyevāgīśvarīṃmṛttasnātāṃnīlendīvarasannibhām vāgīśvareṇasaṃyuktāmupa-
cāraiḥprapūjayet yathā vāgīśvarīsahitavāgīśvarehāgacchenyāvāhyidaṃpādyam
oṃvāgīśvarīvāgīśvarābhyāṃnamaḥ eṣorghaḥ itipādyādibhiḥ

pṛ0 44ba) saṃpūjyavāgīśvarābhyāṃnamitipuṣpāṃjalitrayeṇasapūjyoṃvāgośvarīvāgīśvarābhyāṃnamaḥiti
namaskuryāt tatognimaraṇisaṃbhavaṃsūryakāṃtādimaṇisaṃbhavaṃśrotriyāghārajaṃvāṇīyasvadakṣi
ṇekāsyapātresaṃsthāpyatasmādekāṃkāṣṭikāṃgṛhītvā oṃkravyādebhyaḥsvāhāitianenakuṃḍa
syanaiṛtyāṃdiśiprakṣipet tatovahniṃmūlenavīkṣyāstrīyaphaḍitiarghajalenāgniprokṣyā-
strāyaphaḍitidarbhaiḥsaṃtāḍyahumityarghajalenavahnimabhyukṣyatasminnāgnau rāṃjāṭharāgnayenamaḥ
rīṃvaindavāgnayenamaḥrūbhūmāgnayenamaḥitisaṃpūjya jāṭharavaidaṃvabhaumāmnīnāmaikyaṃvibhāvya rami
tipāvakacaitanyaṃtasminsaṃyojyapraṇavenāgnimabhimaṃtryavamitidhenumudrayāmṛtīkṛtyastrāya
phaḍitivahnimabhirakṣyahumitivaguṃṭhyavahnimūlamaṃtreṇasaṃpūjya vahniṃkarābhyāṃgṛhītvāu
ttolyajānuspṛṣṭamahītalaḥkuṃḍoparibhrāmyātmanomukhaṃvahniṃpraṇavamuccaran paramaśi
vajīvavuddhyāsohamitijīvavuddhyāvāgīśvaryāyonovinikṣipet tatovāgīśvarīvāgīśvarā
bhyāmācamanīyaṃnamitisaṃpūjyakāmeśvarīkāmeśvarayoḥsaṃgamaṃviciṃtyakāmeśvarīgarbhanā
ḍyāṃ taccaitanyaṃsaṃyojya oṃitikuśairdevyāyonimācchādyagarbharakṣārthaṃdarbhakaṃkaṇaṃdatvājvā
linīmudrāṃpradarśayet mudrālakṣaṇamāha maṇivaṃdhausamaukṛtvākaraupratihatāṃgulī madhya
memilitekṛtvāttanmadhyaṃguṣṭakaṃkṣipet vahnimudrīpayetpaścājvālinyāḥmudrayānayāḥ ta

pṛ0 45a) tovahnimaṃtreṇāgniṃprajālayet cityoṃgalahanahanadahadahapacapacasarvajñāpayasvāhāitya
gniṃprajālyakṛtāṃjaliḥagniṃprajvalitaṃvaṃdejātavedaṃhutāśanam suvarṇavarṇaṃmalaṃsasiddhaṃvi
śvatomukhaṃ ityanenāgnimupasthāpayet tatovahnessāttvikīnāṃsaptajihvānāṃsvadehenya
set liṃgamāyuśirovakraghrāṇanetreṣusarvataḥvahnīrārghīśasaṃyuktaḥsādiyāṃtāṃssaviṃdavaḥ
vahnermaṃtrāsamuddiṣṭājihvānāṃsaptadaiśikaiḥpāyurgudaḥsarvataḥsarvāṃgevyāpakaṃnyaset vahni
rephaḥiroyakāraḥarghīśaḥūkāraḥtenavyatkrameṇa saṣaśavalarayaḥsaviṃdavoviṃduyutāḥ
tena syuṣryuṃrapruvryulruṃpryuṃitivahneḥsaptajihvāmaṃtrāḥprakārāṃtarerephāvartimauvargaurephaṣaṣṭa
svarasthitauiṃduviṃduḥsamāyuktaujihvāvījānyanukramāt aṃtimauvargauyavargauyalaravi-
tiyavargaḥśaṣajñahitiśavarmaḥatimauetauvargauvirephaurepharahitauyalavaśaṣasahāḥte
navyutkrameṇahasaṣaśavalayāḥiṃdurardhacaṃdraḥviṃduranusvāraḥityuktityarthaḥśāradāmatāma
laṃvyātha jihvāstāstrividhāḥśektāguṇabhedenakarmasu hiraṇyāgaganāraktākṛlānyāmu
prabhāmatā bahurūpātiriktācasāttikoyāgakarmasu padmarāgāsyuvarṇānyātṛtīyāvaddha
lohitā lohitānaṃtaraṃśvetādhūminīcakarālikā rājasyorasanāvahneḥvihitākāmyaka
rmasu viśvamūrteḥsphuliṃginyodhūmavarṇāmanojavāḥlohitānyākarālākhyākālītā

pṛ0 45ba) masiīritāḥetāḥsaptaniyujyaṃtekūrakarmasumaṃtribhiḥsvasvanāmasamābhāḥsyuḥjihvākalyā
ṇaretasaḥkalyāṇaretasovahneḥprathamataḥsāttikīnāṃsvadehenyāsaṃkuryāt sprūṃhiraṇyāyaina
maḥliyoṣpraṃ**gaganāyainamāḥgudeḥsryuraktāyainamaḥśirasiḥ vryuṃkṛṣṇāyainamaḥmukhelryusu
prabhāyainamaḥghrāṇespryuṃbahurūpāyainamonetreypryuatiraktāyainamaḥsarvagātreṣunyaset tato
hiraṇyāgaganāraktākṛṣṇāsuprabhābahurūpā atiraktānāṃsaptajihvānāṃadhidevatāpra
markṣyapitṛgaṃdharvayakṣanāgapiśācakāḥrākṣasāḥsaptajihvānāmīritādhidevatāḥama
rtyodevaḥadhidevatānāmapisvadehenyāsaṃkuryāt oṃdevebhyonamaḥliṃgye oṃpitṛbhyonamaḥ
gudeḥ oṃgaṃdharvebhyonamaḥśirasi oṃyakṣebhyonamaḥmukhe oṃnāgebhyonamaḥghrāṇadvaye oṃpi-
śācebhyonamaḥnetradvayerākṣasebhyonamaḥsarvagātrevyāpakaṃnyaset vahnenaṃgaṃmanūnnyasettanā-
yuktenagavartmanāsahasrārcitaḥsvastipūrṇāuttiṣṭapuruṣaḥpunaḥdhūmavyāpīsaptajihvodhanurdha
ritikramāt ṣaḍaṃgamanavaḥproktājātibhiḥsahasaṃyutāḥtathākaranyāsaṃskuryāt oṃsahasrā
rciṣeaṃguṣṭābhyāṃnamaḥaṃguṣṭayoḥoṃsvastipūrṇāyatarjanībhyāṃnamaḥtarjanyoḥoṃutiṣṭapuruṣā
