yādaṃgamukhyānāmādhṛtīnāmanukramāt ekaikāmāhutīsamyaksarpiṣādaiśikottamaḥ
aṃgamukhyānāmaṃgapradhānām āvṛtīnāṃyasyadevasyayatsaṃkhyāāvaraṇadevatāḥtāsāṃta
taḥāvaraṇadevatāmuddiśyamūlenaikaikāhutīṃjuhutīṃ agneraṃgavibhāgamāha

pṛ0 51a) śāradātilake yataḥkāṣṭaṃtatoḥśrotraṃyatodhūmotranāsikā yatrālpajvalanaṃnetraṃyatoṃgarasta
taḥśiraḥyatraprajvalitājvālāsājihvājātavedasaḥasyāṃtarjahuyādagnervipaścitsarvaka
rmasukarṇahomebhavedvyādhirnetrendhatvamudīritam nāsikāyāṃmanaḥpīḍāmastakedhanasaṃkṣa
yaḥprakṛtahomaṃsaṃpādya sūryagaṇeśaśivagopālādibhyopiekaikāhutiṃjuhuyāt ta
tomahāvyāhṛtihomaṃkuryāt oṃbhūḥsvāhā oṃbhuvaḥsvāhāoṃsvaḥsvāhā oṃbhūrbhuvaḥsvā
hāitihutvāmūladevatāṃgaṃdhādibhiḥsaṃpūjyatilājyādibhiḥprakṛtahomaṃkuryāt homa
prakāramāha haviṃdānaṃtutpūvrapāṇinākartavyam taduktaṃgavākṣataṃtrecittrahastenakarta
vyaṃnācittreṇakadācana hotucakṣuvināśāyayajamānovinaśyati tathācatripurāḍaḍamā
re cittrahastehavirdāvaṃkriyatecahutāśane dātuḥpuṇyaphalaṃnāstihotācanarakaṃvrajet
bhairavamaṃtrepi haviruttānahastenavaiśvānaramukhehutam hotuścakṣurvināśāyayajamā-
novinaśyati homemudrātrayaṃproktaṃmṛgīhaṃsīcasūkarīmṛgīkaniṣṭātarjanyohaṃsīmu-
ktakaniṣṭikā sūkarīkarasaṃkaucamitimudrāḥprakīrtitāḥmṛgīcaputrakāmārthāhaṃsī
savaṃphalapradā abhicāreṣuyajñeṣusūkarīkathitāvudhaiḥprakṛtihomaṃsamāpyaguruḥśi
ṣyaṃpaṃcagavyaṃpāyayitvāvidhivatsthāpitāṃvardhanīmuddhṛtyaśirasimātṛkāṃmanasājapan

pṛ0 51ba) mūlenasādhitaiḥkuṃbhajalairabhiṣiṃcet avaśiṣṭatoyenaśiṣyamācaret udgāyagātramā
rjanaṃkṛtvādhautīvāsasīparidhāyācamet tataḥsūkṣmavastreṇavoṣaḍitimaṃtramuccaraṃśi
ṣyanetrevadhnīyāt tataḥkaregṛhītvātaṃśiṣyaṃkuṃḍasamīpesamānīyanetrabaṃdhaṃdūrīkṛtyasva
vāmekuśāstaraṃsthāpayet tatogururamukamaṃtraṃdadāmītipratijñāṃsrāvayet tataḥśi
ṣyodadasvetivrūyātpraṇavapūrvakam tatoguruḥśiṣyāṃgemātṛkānyāsaṃkṛtvāvastreṇa
śiraḥpravṛtyādauṛṣyādikaṃcoktvāsmṛtvācadevatāṃdhiyāśiṣyasyadakṣiṇekarṇevā
ratrayaṃvrūyāt vāmakarṇeekavāraṃvrūyāt maṃtraṃdattvāgururjalīṃgṛhītvāvidyeyaṃmaṃtrovā
tavamamasamānaphaladhātrīdātāvāstuitivinītaśiṣyasyahastejalaṃdadyāt astviti
śiṣṭavrūyuḥ tataḥśiṣyogurumaṃtradevatānāmaikyaṃbhāvayanmaṃtraṣaṣṭottaraśataṃjapet aṣṭa
vāraṃvā tathāca vijñānasaṃhitāyām gurovidyāṃsamālabhyahyaṣṭottaraśataṃjapet athavā
pyaṣṭakṛtvaścajapenmaṃtramananyadhīgururapisvaśaktisiddhyarthaṃnyāsaṃkṛtvāṣṭottarasahasraṃśa
taṃvājapet athavāpyaṣṭatvaśrajapenmaṃtataḥśiṣyojapaṃsamāpyadevatātmakaṃguruṃdaṃḍava
tpraṇamyatasyapādāṃvujadvaṃdvaṃmūrdhniyojayitvāstavaṃkuryāt yathā namastenāthabhamavaṃśi
vāyagururūpiṇe vidyāvatārasaṃsiddhyaisvekṛtānekavigrahaḥnārāyaṇasvarūpāyapara

pṛ0 52a) mātmakamūrtaye sarvajñānatamobhedabhānavetrisvarūpiṇe svṛtaṃtrāyadayātṛptavigrahāyaśi
vātmane parataṃtrāyabhaktānāṃbhavyānāṃbhavyarūpiṇe vivekināṃvivekāyavimarṣāyavima-
rṣiṇām prakāśānāṃprakāśāyajñānināṃjñānarūpiṇe tvatprasādādahaṃdevakṛtakṛtyo
smisarvataḥahaṃmṛtyumahāpāśādvimuktosmiśivosmica itipaṭhitvāguruṃstūyāt
tatogururhastābhyāṃśiṣyamastakaṃdhṛtvāutthāpayet yathā uttiṣṭavatsamuktosisamyagā
cāravānbhava ityuktvāśiṣyamutthāpayet maṃtrācārānkathayet tatoguravedakṣiṇāṃdadyāt
taduktaṃvrahmasaṃhitāyām vṛthāvipravacāṃyastugṛhṇātimānavāḥśubheadatvādakṣiṇāvāpi
sarvātinarakaṃdhruvam dīkṣāṃtedakṣiṇāṃprāhuḥsvarṇagobhūmibhūṣaṇam vasubhājanavastrānneśu
dāsāsanānica yadyadiṣṭatamaṃvastuguravetaṃnnivedayet tathāca kapilapaṃcarātre sarvasvaṃdakṣi
ṇāṃdadyādbhāṃcadadyātpayasvinīm bhūmiṃvṛttikarīṃdadyātputrapautrānuyāyinīm tathācapārijāteśvare
guravedakṣiṇāṃdadyātpratyakṣāyaśivātmane gururvarthaṃmatimānnityaṃśarīramapisaṃtyajet ekamayya
kṣaraṃyastuguruḥśiṣyenibodhayet pṛthivyāṃnāstitaddravyaṃyaddatvāsaunaṇībhavet tataḥpūrṇākā
le oṃagnetvaṃmṛḍanāmāsimṛḍanāgneagnayepādyaṃnamaḥitipādyādibhiḥsaṃpūjyapūrṇaṃdayātyathā
agnipurāṇam mūrdhānaṃdenamaṃtreṇasaṃsraveṇacadhārayāmūrdhānedivoratniṃpṛthivyāvaiśvānamṛtā

pṛ0 52ba) mājātamagnimkaviṃ saṃmrājamatithiṃjanānāmāsannāpātraṃjapaṃtudevāḥdadyādutthāyapūrṇāṃ
tulopaviśyakadācanetimūrdhānandivetiyajuṣāṃpūrṇahomaṃyaśasojuhomītimāmagānā
m tathācakṛṣṇānusaṃhitāyām sruksruvaucottānāsyogṛhītvāśaṃkhamudrayāsthitvānā
bhisekṛtvādhyāyandevaṃmaheśvaram paṃcāṅgulaṃtyaktvāśaṃkhamudrayādhāryaḥpaṃcāṃgulaṃbahi-
styaktvādhārayecchaṃkhamuddayetivācaspatimiśrakṛtamahādānanirṇayadhṛvacanāt tāṃ
trikamanamāha srukasruvaucottānāsyaugṛhītvā oṃbhuvovāyavecāṃtarikṣāyacadivecamaha
tecasvāhā oṃsurāyādityācacaṃdramasecanakṣattrebhyaścadigbhyaścamahatecasvāhā sruksru
vāvadhomukhokṛtvāmūlenavauṣaḍaṃtenapūrṇāṃdadyāt tatogniṃpādyādibhiḥsaṃpūjyavastranā
rikelaphalādyagnaudadyāt tatogniṃnamaskuryāt sarvataḥpāṇipādosisarvatokṣiśiro
mukhaḥviśvarūpomahānagniḥpraṇītaḥsarvakarmasu āyurārogyamaiśvaryaṃdhṛttiṃsattvaṃbalaṃ
yaśaḥtejovarcaḥpaśūnbījaṃśauryaṃsāmrājyamevacasaubhāgyaṃkarmasiddhiṃcakulajyeṣṭaṃsukartṛ-
tāṃ sarvametatsarvasākṣinpraviṇodorirīhinaḥagniṃprajvalitaṃvaṃdejātavedaṃhutāśanam
suvarṇavarṇamamalaṃsaṃsiddhaṃviśvatomukham itipaṭhitvānamaskuryāt tataḥkṛtāṃjaliprā
rthayedanenayathā ābrahmabrahmaṇovrahmavarcasījāyatāṃsārāṣṭrerājanyaḥśūriṣyavyotīvyā-

pṛ0 53a) dhīmahārathojāyatām oṃdogdhīdhenunīḍhāvadvānāśusaptiḥpuraṃdhriryoṣāviṣṇurethaṣṭāḥsubhe
yoyuvāsyayajamānasyavīrojāyatām oṃnikāminikāmenaḥparjanyovarṣatophalavatyono
ṣadhayaḥpathyaṃtāṃyogakṣemonaḥkalpaṃtāṃ itiprārthayet tatoṅgadevatāvaraṇaṃtadaṃgevilīnaṃvi
bhāvyabhagavatidevatepūjitāsikṣamasvetisaṃhāramudrayā svahṛdisamānīyakṛtāṃjaliragniṃ
visarjayet yathā oṃyajñayajñāṃgacchayajñapatiṃgacchasvāṃyoniṃgacchasvāhāeṣateyajñoyajñapa
tesahasktavāksarvavīrastvaṃjuṣasvasvāhāitipaṭhitvāgnervisarjanaṃkuryāt tatovrahmaṇeda-
kṣiṇāṃdadyāt tathāsmṛtiḥvrahmaṇedakṣiṇāṃdeyāyatrayāparikīrtitākarmāṃtenucyamānā-
yāpūrṇamātrādhikābhavet hoturvastayugaṃkāṃsyamityapiśruteḥtathācaśaktāśaktabhedā
dubhayam yathāpūrṇapātramānīyatilakuśajalānyādāyaviṣṇuḥoṃayā'mukemāsiamu
kapakṣe'mukatithauamukagotraḥśrīamukadevaśarmāśrīamukadevatāyāyadakṣara-
maṃtrasyadīkṣākarmāṅgahomakarmapratiṣṭārthamidaṃpūrṇapātraṃvrahmaṇohaṃdadeitida-
kṣiṇāmutsṛjyavrahmavimocanaṃkuryāt anena oṃuttiṣṭavrahmaṇasyatedevayaṃta
stvemaheupaprayaṃtumarutaḥ sudānaviṃdraprāśūnbhavāsacāitivrahmavimocanaṃ
kuryāt tataḥ paristaraṇakuśāghṛtāktāṃstūṣṇīmagnauprakṣipet tatratilakārthaṃ

pṛ0 53ba) kuṃḍasyeśānakoṇābhasmamānīyapātrāṃtaresthāpayet śāṃtidīpikāyāṃvasiṣṭaḥeṣānyā-
māharedbhasmasruveṇāthasrucāpivā baṃdhūnāṃkārayettenaśiraḥkaṃṭhāṃsakeṣucakaśyapasye
timaṃtreṇayathānukramayogataḥtataḥśāṃtiṃprakrurvītaavadhāraṇavācakam athahomada-
kṣiṇā prapaṃcasāre ekādaśārdhakaṇikākāṃcanasyadadyātsadaivaguravethasahasrahoma
ardhārdhapaṃcakaṇikādvikaṇācamārdhāsyādbhakṣiṇehakathitāmunibhistridhaiva śāradā-
yocasahasrahomevitareddakṣiṇāṃniṣkamānataḥtadardhaṃvāsuvarṇevāyathāvibhavamānataḥ
viṣṇuṃvātadardhaṃvāitiśaktyapekṣayāvikalpaḥnatuaicchikaḥniṣkeapravṛtteḥniṣkaṃma
lamitisaṃpradāyaḥtaśyasuvarṇavatuṣṭayaṃpaṃcakṛṣṇalakomāṣastesuvarṇastuṣoḍaśapalaṃ
suvarṇaścatvāritiśāstrasyaniścayaḥkṛṣṇalaḥsvarṇamāṣakaḥviśvaprakāśe akṣālaṃkā
rayonniṣkaṃniṣkaḥsvarṇacatuṣṭayeniṣkamaṣṭādhikasvarṇaśatedānparakarṣayoḥityuktam
oṃtkalāstu aṣṭakaṇikenadvātriṃśiktikamitaṃniṣkamāhuḥdakṣiṇācapradātavyāgra
hādīnāṃvisarjanam tatohomasthaledugdhaṃdattvāpṛthivyāgrahādīnāṃvisarjanam tatoho
masthaledugdhaṃdattvāpṛthiviśītalābhavetivadet tataḥkṛtāṃjaliḥhomakarmācchidrama
stutatogururyajñasthalādghaṭasannidhogatvopaviśet tataḥśiṣyaguravodakṣiṇāṃdadyāt ya

pṛ0 54a) thātilakuśajalānyādāyaviṣṇuḥoṃādyāmukemāsiamukapakṣemukatithāvamukago
ttrāḥśrīamukadevaśarmāśrīamukadevatāyāyadakṣaramaṃtrasyadīkṣākarmapratiṣṭārthamiṃdaṃ
kāṃcanam amukagotrāyaśrīamukadevaśarmaṇaguravetubhyamahaṃdade guruḥsvastītivrū
yāt vittaśāṭhyaṃvināsarvaṃguravesannivedayet maṃḍapaṃmaṃḍapadravyaṃguravesannivedayet tato
gururghaṭemūladevatāṃpādyādibhiḥsaṃpūjaṃtābūlaṃdattvāpunarācamanīyaṃdattvāṅgadevatā
gaṇaṃtadaṅgekirīṭinaṃvibhāvyaśrīamukadevatepūjitāsikṣamasvetyuktvāsaṃhāramudrayā
vahannāsāpuṭenadevatāṃsvahṛdisamānīyaprāṇāyāmaṃkṛtvātmānaṃtatsvarūpaṃvibhāvya
nirmālyaṃgṛhītvāīśenirmālyaśeṣeṇatattaddevaṃsamarcayet īśānakoṇetrikoṇamaṃḍa
laṃvyāpakamaṃḍalāyanamitipuṣpaiḥsaṃpūjyanirmālyaṃgṛhītvā oṃamukadevatāyainama
itimaṃḍaloparipūjayet gatasāraṃtunaivedyaṃtataścaitatsamuddharet aiśānyāṃtadbhujedatvākiṃ
citsthānaṃviśodhayet tadbhujenirmālyabhujetecaviśvaksenaḥsmṛtoviṣṇuḥtejaścaḍovi
vasvataḥcaṃḍīśvarītathāśaktiścaṃḍeśaḥśaṃkarasyaca laṃbodarogaṇapateramīhyucchiṣṭa
bhojinaḥtathācāgamakalpadrumedīkṣāyāṃpūjayetkuṃbheyaṃtrādaupratyahaṃyajet tatoghaṭaṃ
saṃcālyasthānāṃtaresaṃsthāpyakṛtāṃjaliḥadyakṛtaitadamukadevatāyāyadakṣaramaṃtrasya

pṛ0 54ba) dīkṣākarmācchidramastu tatoghaṭajalenaśiṣyamabhiṣiṃcet yathā surāstvāmabhiṣiṃcaṃtu
vrahmaviṣṇumaheśvarāḥvāsudevojagannāthastathāḥsaṃkarṣaṇaḥprabhuḥprayumnaścāniruddhaścabha
vaṃtuvijayāyate ākhaṃḍalogniḥbhagavānyamorvainaiṛtastathā varuṇaḥpavanaścaivadhanadhya
kṣastathāśivaḥvrahmaṇaḥsahitaḥśeṣodipālāḥpāṃtutesadākīrtiḥlakṣmīrvṛtirmedhā-
puṣṭiḥśraddhākṣamāmatiḥbuddhirlajjāvapuḥśāṃtiḥstutiṣkāṃtiścamātaraḥetastvāmabhi
ṣiṃcaṃtudharmapatnyaḥsamāgatāḥādityaścaṃdramābhaumovudhajīvasitārkajāḥgrahāstvā-
mabhiṣiṃcaṃturāhuḥketuścatarpitāḥdevadānavagaṃdhavāyakṣarākṣasapannagāḥvṛṣayomu
nayogāvodevamātāevaca devapatnyodhruvānāgādaityāpsarasāṃgaṇāḥastrāṇisarva-
śāstrāṇirājānovāhanānica oṣadhānicaratnānikālasyāvayavāścaye saritaḥ
sāgarāḥśailāstīrthānijaladānadāḥ etatvāmabhiṣiṃcaṃtusarvakāmārthasiddhaye mahāvā
madevyṛṣiḥvirāḍgāyatrīcchaṃdaḥiṃdrodevatāśāṃtikarmaṇiviniyogaḥoṃkayānaści
ttrābhuvadūtisadāvṛdhaḥsakhākayāśaniṣṭayāvṛtā kastvāsatyomaṃdāṃnāmaṃhiṣṭomatsa
dandhasaḥdṛḍhācidārujevasu abhiṣunaḥsakhīnāmavitājanitrīṇām śataṃbhavasyūtaye
oṃsvastiniṃdrovṛddhaśravāḥsvastinaḥpūṣāviśvedevāḥsvastinastārkṣāriṣṭanemiḥ

pṛ0 55a) svastinovṛhaspatirdadhātu itighaṭajalenābhiṣiṃcyayajñabhasmanāvaṃdanāṃkuryāt yajñabha-
smagṛhītvā oṃkaśyapasyatryāyuṣaṃśiṣyasyalalāṭedadyāt jamadagnisnyāyuṃṣitikaṃṭheda
dyāt yaddevānāṃtryāyuṣaṃmitiaṃsayoḥtatteastatryāyuṣaṃitihṛdayaṃdadyāt tatāśī
rvādaṃkuryāt tataḥśiṣyoguruṃdaṃḍavatpraṇasyayathāsukhaṃviharet gururapiyathāsthānaṃga
cchet anyebhyopidīnānāthebhyaḥkiṃciṃddayātkumārīcapūjayet tathācoktamāgamaka
lpadrume tataḥsvastiracittenayogavarmasamabhyaset gaṃgāyāṃgopradānenadivyaṃvarṣaśatatraya
m yatphalaṃprāpyatenityaṃmārādhyāpnotitatphalam kurukṣettregayāyāṃcaprayāgepuru
pottame gosahasrapradhānenayatphalaṃsamavāpyate tadetadakhilaṃpuṇyaṃprāpnotyevana
saṃśayaḥsamagramasamagraṃvāyodadyātpūjitaṃhareḥkadācidapinityaṃvāputrapuṣpādi
kaṃbahuḥkiṃtīrthasevayādānairanyairbahubhireritaiḥārādhanāsamarthastudadyādarśanasādha
naṃ yodātuṃnaivaśaknotikuryādarśanadarśanam nistārāyatadevālaṃbhavāṭauparitaḥkṣa
ṇāt itipūjāvidhānenanayetpratidinaṃcayaḥihāvāpyātalāṃlakṣmīmaṃtebhūyātparaṃpadam
dīkṣāṃkṛtvāyadāmaṃtrīupavāsaṃsamācaret tasyadevāḥsadāruṣṭaḥśāpaṃpatatimūrdhani dātāgṛ
hītānopoṣyedupavāsaḥśriyaṃharet tasmādannaṃsamaśrīyādvavisyānnenaśaṃkari athasaṃkṣepa

pṛ0 55ba) dīkṣā muhūrtesarvatobhadrenavakuṃbhaṃvidhāyaca modakaṃgaṃdhapuṣpādyāmarvitaṃvastrasaṃvṛtam sa
rvauṣadhinavaratnapaṃcapallavasaṃyutam surāmāṃsīvacākuṣṭaṃśaileyaṃrajanīdvayam śaṭīcaṃpa
kamustaṃvasarvauṣadhigaṇasmṛtaḥpṛśniparṇīśyāmalatātejapattraśatāvarī guḍavīsahade
vācamahauṣadhigaṇaḥsmṛtaḥsarāmāṃsījaṭāmāṃsīśaileyaṃśailarajanīyaṃdvayam haridrā
drāruharidrāpṛśnipaṇīṃpippalīsahadevāghṛtakumārīnavaratnaṃtuśāradāyām muktāmā-
ṇikyavaidūryagomedānvajavidumau padmarāgaṃmarakataṃnīlāṃcetiyathākramam tatodevā
rcanaṃkṛtvāhunedaṣṭottaraṃśatam huneditiśaktiviṣayam śiṣyaṃsvalaṃkṛtavaidyāmupajña
mupaveśayet maṃtritaṃprokṣiṇītoyaiḥśāṃtikuṃbhajalaistathā mūlamaṃtreṇāṣṭottaraśatamaṃ
tritenābhiṣecayet athasaṃpādayenmaṃtraṃhastaṃśirasinidhāyaśamostvityakṣatāndadyā
t tataḥśiṣyorcayedgurum yadvādīkṣāṃtarakramaḥśaṃkhamabhyarcyasākṣaṃtadaṃvunābhiṣiṣyā
ṣṭavāraṃmūlenakekaraṃvidhāyāṣṭaujapetkarṇeupadeśadvayaṃvidhiḥupadeśāṃtaramāha caṃ
drasūryagrahetīrthesiddhakṣettreśivālaye maṃtramātraprakathanamupadeśaḥsucyate iti
śrīśrīyadunāthacakravartiviracitāyāmāgamakalpalatāyāṃprathamaḥpallavaḥoṃtatsat
oṃnamaḥśivāya śrīparavrahmaṇenamaḥ athātrahomadravyāṇāṃpramāṇamabhidhīyate karṣamā

pṛ0 56a) traṃghṛtaṃhomeśuktimātrāṃpayaḥsmṛtam śāstrīyatolakadvarṣaḥpalaṃcaturthāṃśaḥkarṣaḥpalaṃsu
varṇāścatvāraḥśuktirardhapalaṃtathā uktānipaṃcagavyānitatsamānimanīṣibhiḥtatsa-
maṃmadhudugdhānnamakṣamātramudāhṛtam dugdhānnaṃparamānnaṃ akṣamātraṃtolakadvayam dadhi
prasṛtamātraṃsyāllājāḥsyuḥmuṣṭisammitāḥprasṛtiḥpaladvayam pṛthukāstatpramāṇāḥ
syuḥsaktavopitathoditāḥguḍaṃpalālārdhamānaṃsyāccharkarāpitathāmatā grāsārdhaṃca
rumānaṃsyādikṣuḥparvāvadhiḥsmṛtāḥmayūrāḍamasaṃgrāsekaikapatrapuṣpāṇitathāpū
ṣāṇinikalpayet kadalīphalanāragaphalānyekaikaśoviduḥmātuluṃgaṃcatuḥkhaṃḍaṃ
patasaṃdaśadhākṛtam mātuluṃgaṃniṃbojaṃbhīraviśeṣaiḥpanasaṃkaṃṭakīphalam aṣṭadhā
nārikelānikhaṃḍitānividuḥvudhāḥtridhākṛtaṃphalaṃvailaṃkapitthaṃkhaṃḍitadvidhā u
rvārukaphalaṃhomekapikhaṃḍathataṃtridhā urvārukaphalaṃkarkaṭīphalam phalānyanyānya
khaṃḍānisamidhaḥsyurdaśāṃgulāḥdūrvātrayaṃsamuddiṣṭaṃguḍūcīcaturaṃgulā vrīhauyomuṣṭimā
trāḥsyuḥmudgamāṣāyaśvāpi tāṃḍulāḥsyutadardhāṃśāḥkoivāmuṣṭisaṃmitāḥgodhūmara-
ktakalamālovihitāmuṣṭimānataḥtilāḥculakamātrāḥsyuḥsarṣapāstatpramāṇataḥ
alakamātrāḥkarṣamātrāḥśuktipramāṇaṃlavaṇaṃmaricānyapiviṃśatiḥ puraṃbadaramā-

pṛ0 56ba) naṃsyādāmaṣaṃtatsasmṛtaṃ puraṃgugguluḥrāmaṭhaṃhiṃgucaṃdanāgurukarpūrakastūrīkuṃkumānica
