ktaṃtudakṣiṇāmūrtau sāvadhānāvadhāraya karṣamātraṃgṛtaṃhomeśuktimātraṃpayaḥsmṛtam
aśītiguṃjāparimitaṃśāsutolakam taddvayaṃkarṣaḥśāstroktatolakaṭhayaṃśuktiḥu
ktānipaṃcagavyānitatsamānimanīṣibhiḥ śuktisamāni tatsaṃmaṃmadhudugdhānnamakṣa
mātramudāhṛtam akṣamātraṃbahiugaphalapramāṇam payaśrulakamānaṃsyāttathāmādhi
tikecana nanusaṃgatametatsyāddravadravyesruvaśruteḥtatkathaṃmayudugdhāderbhaveśrulaka
mānataḥ ucyateśvatthapattrādervidhānāttatparaṃbhavet vastutacculakaṃmadhyatanaṃsruvasamaṃ
catat kovirodhaḥsruveṇaivadruvadravyahutāḥbhavet dadhiprasṛtimānaṃsyāllājāḥsyurdu
ṣṭisaṃmitāḥpṛthukāstatsamānāsyuḥsaktavopitathoditāḥguḍepalārdhamānaṃsyāccha
rkarāpitathoditā grāsārdhaṃcarumānaṃsyādikṣuḥparvāvadhirmataḥmayūrāṃḍasamogrāmasta
dardhaṃ mayūrāṃḍasamaṃmayūraḍiṃbasamaṃekaikaṃpattrapuṣpāṇitathāpūpānikalpayet kadalī
phalanāragaphalānyekaikaśoviduḥmātuluṃgaṃcatuḥkhaṃḍaṃpanasaṃdaśadhākṛtam mātuluṃgaṃ
niṃbaphalaṃekaikaṃmātuluṅgānītyevaṃkecidihocire aṣṭadhānārikelānikhaṃḍitānivi

pṛ0 57a) duḥvudhāḥtridhākṛtaṃphalaṃbailaṃkapitthaṃkhaṃḍitaṃdvidhā urvārukaphalaṃhomakathitaṃkhaṃḍitaṃ
dvidhāurvārukaphalaṃkarkaṭīphalaṃlā khārbhojitiprasiddhiḥphalānyanyānyakhaṃḍānisa-
