ktetuhavirdravyetilājyaṃhavirucyate anuktecāṃjanadravyeghṛtamevāṃjanaṃviduḥ saṃkhyā
nuktausahasraṃsyāddravyānuktaughṛtaṃtathāsamidhānuktaviṣayepālāśyaparikīrtitāḥda
kṣiṇāmūrtitaṃtretuprāhaitacchāṅgaṃsaṃhitā ājyadravyamanādeśehomeṣucavidhīyate sa
muddiṣṭamidaṃsarvasmṛtidṛṣṭenavartmanā lājādihemehastenasāṃgulenavidhīyate sami
tpuṣpaphalādīnāṃhomaḥsyānmṛgamudrayā dravyadravyesruvaḥproktomaṃtrataṃtraviśāradaiḥmi
litvānāmikāṃguṣṭamadhyamāgrāṇiyojayet śiṣṭāṃgulyunmṛtīkuryānmṛgamudreyamī-
ritā prasaṃgācchāstroktaṃpramāṇamabhidhīyate paṃcakṛṣṇalakomāṣastesuvarṇāstuṣoḍa
śa palaṃsuvarṇāścatvāroniṣkamaṣṭottaraṃśatam niṣkramakṣavadaṃtyekeniṣkaṃpalamathā

pṛ0 58a) pare dveguṃjerupyamāṣaḥsyātpalānidharaṇodaśa dvātriṃśatpalakaṃprasthaṃsyamaṃmuktaṃsvayaṃbhuvā
