pradakṣiṇāstyaktakamyācchatrābhāḥśikhinaḥśikhāḥśubhadāyajamānasyarājyasyāpi
viśeṣataḥkuṃdendudhavalodhūmovahneḥproktāśubhāvahaḥkṛṣṇaḥkṛṣṇagatevarṇāyajamā
naṃvināśayet kṛṣṇagatervahneḥśvetorājyaṃnihaṃtyāśunāyamaḥsurasannibhaḥkharasvarasamo
vahnerdhvaniḥsarvavināśakṛt kharogaṃrdabhaḥpratibaṃdhohutabahoturduḥkhapradābhavet cchinnā
vṛttāśikhākuryānmṛtyuṃdhanaparikṣayam śukapakṣanibhobhūmaḥpārāvacamamaprabhaḥhā-
nituragajātīnāṃgavāṃcakurutecirāt evaṃvidheṣudoṣeṣuprāyaścittāyadeśakaḥmūle
nājyenajuhuyātpaṃcaviṃśatirāhutīḥ itiśrīāgamakalpalatāyāṣaṣṭaḥ paṭalaḥ 6
oṃnamaḥśivāya śrīparavrahmaṇenamaḥoṃsāmānyapūjāṃvakṣyāmimaṃtrīṇāṃsiddhidāyi
nīṃ athaprātaḥsamutthāyadhīmānvrāhmemuhūrtake vrahmaraṃdhresthitepadmesahasradalaśo
bhite śrīguruṃparamātmānaṃvyākhyāmudrālasatkaram dvinetradvibhujaṃprītaṃdhyāyedakhila

pṛ0 59a) siddhidam evaṃdhyātvācatatpādasmṛtapīyūṣadhārayā prakṣālitaṃnijaṃdehaṃmaccintyasthiramā
nasaḥsvaguruṃhṛtkamaledhyātvāyathāvatsveṣṭadevatām tatprabhāpaṭalavyāptaṃdehaṃsvaparici
tayet praṇamyājñāṃgṛhītvāsyṛṣyādinyāsapūrvakam maṃtrārthaṃsaṃsmaraṃstīrthaṃgatvāśākho
ktavartmanāsnātvāpaścātsvamaṃtreṇṛṣyādinyāsapūrvakaṃ dhyātvoṣṭadevatātīrthasāvā-
hyāṃkuśamudrayā tīrthāmāvāhanaṃtu gaṃgecayamunecaivagodāvariititīrthaṃmaṃtreṇavami
tyamṛtabījenamudrayādhenusaṃkhyayāmṛtīkṛtyatattīrthaṃśareṇaivaturakṣayet||tajjalede-
vatāmūrtidhyātvātaccaraṇasrutetīrthenimajjyatrirvidvānmanasāmaṃtramuccarankṛtvāghamarṣa
ṇaṃbhūyaḥsaṃdhyādikṛtapūrvakam japtvāmūlamanuṃtvaṣṭāviṃśatipramitaṃtataḥvakṣyamāṇenamaṃ
treṇatāvatsaṃkhyaṃpratarpayet abhiṣiṃcettatomūrdhnitadvatkalaśamudrayātattaddevasyagāyatrī
japitvāpaṃktiśastathā oṃghṛṇisūryādityetyaṣṭārṇenacabhāve arghaṃdattvāthamūlenada-
śadhāmaṃtritairjalaiḥ ācamyadipatīrnatvāgaccheddevagṛhaṃtataḥvamityamṛtabījenāmṛtī
karaṇaṃsnānasyabahutvātprakṛtenimajjanam aghamarṣaṇamitiśūdretaraviṣayam tarpa-
ṇaṃtu saṃtarpyapīṭhamaṃtraiḥsakṛtsakṛtprathamamacyutaṃtatrāvāhyapūjayettatoyairavākhilaiḥ
samupahāraiḥbaddhvāthadhenumudrāṃtoyaiḥsaṃpādyatarpaṇadravyam tadvaddhyāṃjalinātaṃsuvarṇaca-

pṛ0 59ba) ṣakīkṛtenatarpayatudhūpaḥsvakalpavihitānsakṛtsakṛrttarpayetparivārān tarpayāmipada-
yojyaṃmaṃtrātesveṣunāmasudvitīyāṃteṣucapunaḥpūjāśeṣaṃsamāpayet itiprayogādau gā-
yatryācānusaṃdheyāḥghṛṇiḥsūryādityitimaṃtrastudvijaviṣayevavaidikatvāttanmaṃtra
syahrīṃhrīṃsityādināmaṃtreṇaśūdrādinārghaudeyaḥtatodvāsadipūjāvaikartavyābhūti
micchatāācamyavidhivāyaḥtkuryātsāmānyārghaṃtutadyathāstreṇapātraṃsaṃśodhyahṛ-
nmaṃtreṇaprapūjyaca tīrthamaṃtreṇacāvāhyatīrthasaṃvitpramaḍalāt tajjalegaṃdhapuṣpāṇini
kṣipettāramuccaran astreṇaśodhayitvaitatspṛṣṭvāmūlaṃjapettrissaḥdattayeddhenumudrecasā
mānyārghāyamīvitāḥastreṇāstramaṃtreṇaphaḍitimaṃtreṇetyarthaḥhṛnmaṃtreṇanamitimaṃtreṇa
gaṃgecayamunecaivagodāvarisarasvati narmadesiṃdhukāverījalesminsannidhiṃkuru eṣatī-
rthamanuḥproktauduritaughavināśanaḥtīrthāvāhanaaṃkuśamudrayetyarthaḥtajjalenasāmānyārgha
jalenatāramurccaran oṃkāramuccaran spṛṣṭvārghajalaṃspṛṣṭvāmūlaṃmūlamaṃtraṃtajjalairastramaṃtre-
ṇadvāramabhyukṣyapūjayet vighnaṃdvārordhaśākhāyāṃmahālakṣmīṃsarasvatīm etattritayapū
janaṃtupāṭhakrameṇaivadvārordhvaśākhāyāmitidvārasyadakṣiṇamadhyavāmabhāgeṣu taduktaṃpū
rṇaparddhatau dvārasyadakṣiṇevāmegaṇeśaṃcasarasvatīm urdhveduṃbarakemadhyetatodvāraśri-

pṛ0 60a) yaṃyajet tatodakṣiṇaśākhāyāṃvighnaṃkṣettreśamanyataḥtayoḥpārśvagategaṃgāyamunepuṣpavāri
