makalpadrumeca naiṛtyāṃdiśivāstvīśaṃvrahmaṇaṃcasamarcayet paṃcagavyārghatoyābhyāṃpro
kṣayaudyāgameḍapam paṃcagavyaprakāramāha smṛtiśāstre gomūtraṃgomayaṃkṣīraṃdadhisa

pṛ0 61a) rpiḥkuśodakam paṃcagavyamidaṃprāhurmaṃtrataṃtraviśāradāḥgomūtrasyacabhāgārdhaṃśakṛtkṣī
rasyacatrayam dvayaṃdadhnoghṛtasyaikamekaṃcakuśavāriṇaḥgāyatryādāyagomūtraṃgedhadvāre
tigomayam āpyāyasīticakṣīraṃdadhitkābaṇetivaidadhi tejosītighṛtaṃcaivade
vasyatvākuśodakam maṃtrādyaparijñānetupraṇaveṇaivaśodhayet yathāāhṛtyapraṇa
venaivutthāyapraṇavenaca praṇaveṇasamālodyapraṇaveṇapunaḥpit paṃcagavyenatatadde
haṃmaṃḍapaṃcavipraṇaveṇasamāloḍāpraṇaveṇapunaḥpiven paṃcagavyenataddehemaṃḍapaṃca-
viśodhayet taduktaṃgautamīye palamātraṃdugdhabhāgaṃgomūtraṃtāvadviṣyate ghṛtaṃcapala
mātraṃsyādgomayaṃtolakadvayam dadhiprasṛtamātraṃsyātpaṃcagavyamidaṃsmṛtam athavā
paṃcagavyānāṃsamānobhāgiṣyate mūlamaṃtreṇasaṃmaṃtryakuśāgreṇaivaśodhayet tenasarvavi
śuddhiḥsyātsapāyanikṛṃtanam tataḥtīkṣṇadaṃṣṭamahākāyekalpāṃtadahanopamam bhaira-
vāyanamastubhyaṃmanujñāṃdātumarhasi ityanujñāṃgṛhītvāsyajapasthānaṃviśodhayet cata
ṣprākāraṃtacchuddhaṃvidadyādvīkṣaṇādibhiḥvīkṣaṇaṃmūlamaṃtreṇaśareṇaprokṣaṇaṃmatam
tenaivatāḍanaṃdarbhairdharmaṇābhyukṣaṇaṃrmataṃcaṃdanāgurukapūrairdhūpayeṃdataraṃsudhiḥataraṃmaṃ
ḍapasya vikirānvikiraittatrasaptajattvāśarānnanā lājacaṃdanasiddhārthabhasmādūrvākṣatākuśaḥ

pṛ0 61ba) vikirāitisaṃdhiṣṭāmahāvighnaughanāśakāḥukteṣurāsaneṣvekaṃcailājinakuśauttaram ve
dikāyāṃpravinyasyaprokṣayetsalilaiḥśubhaiḥādhārādipṛthivyaṃtāstatrasaṃpūjyadevatāḥ
merupṛṣṭṛṣiḥcchaṃdaḥpṛthivyāsutalaṃmatam daivatākūrmavyākhyātaḥsaṃsmaredṛṣipūrva
kaṃ pṛthitvayādhṛtālokādevitvaṃviṣṇunādhṛtā tvaṃcadhārayamāṃnityaṃpavitraṃkurucāsana
m itimaṃtraṃjapanpīṭheprāṅmukhovāpyudāṅmukhaḥsvastikādikameṇaivṛjukāyoviśe
dvudhaḥsvastikādikrameṇaivaścāsanaprapaṃcenuprapaṃcenusaṃdheyaḥādhārādiādhāraśaktyā
di baddhapadmāsanomaunisamāhinajiteṃdriyaḥsyāpayeddakṣiṇebhāgapūjādravyāṇidai
śikaḥsuvāsitāṃbusaṃpannaṃmadhyekugbhaṃsuśobhanam prakṣālanāyakarayauḥpṛṣṭepātraṃni
veśayetbhūtaḥśuddhiṃtataḥkuryātsarvakarmaphalāptaye bhūtaśuddhivihīnenakṛtāpūjā
bhicāravat viparītaphalaṃdadyādabhaktyāpūjanaṃyathā ititadākaraṇeniṃdyārthavāda
śruteḥjapādyasarvamaṃtrāṇāṃvinyāsenavinālipeḥkṛtaṃtanniṣphalaṃviṃdyāttasmātpūrvaṃ
lipiṃnyaset ityanenacamātṛkānyāsasyacatathātvāt devobhūtvāyaneddevaṃnādevode-
vaparcayet ityanenāprāptadevabhāgasyepūjāyāmanadhikāritvāt tathoktaṃkramadīmi
kāyām ityavyutīkṛtatanurvidadhītatanunyāsamitivacanānuvaudhāccataupūjādā

pṛ0 62a) vaśyakotayordevabhāvānpakatvāditibhūtaśuddhilipinyādaupūjādauniyatausmṛtauta
thācoktaṃviśuddheśvare japārthasarvamaṃtrāṇāṃvinyāsaccalipevinā kṛtaṃtanniṣphalaṃvi-
dyāttasmādādaulipiṃnyaset śaṭhakrameṇaprathamatobhūtaśuddhirihābhidhīyate tathoktaṃ
kramadīpikāyām śrotonirmaladhautasūkṣmavasanodhautāṃghripāṇyānanaḥsvācāṃtaḥsu
pavitramudritakaraḥśvetordhvapauḍojjvalāḥprācīdigvadanonibaddhasudṛḍhaṃpadmāsanaṃsva-
stikaṃvāmīnaḥsvagurūnāṇādhipamatavaṃdetavaddhāṃjaliḥkṛtāṃjalipuṭaubhūtvāvāma
dakṣiṇapārśvayo vatvāguruṃgaṇeśānaṃbhūtaśuddhisamācaret pāvakrameṇaivanamaskāraḥ
vāmeguruṃdakṣiṇatogaṇeśaṃdurgāpuraḥkṣetrapaticapaścāt ityanenadurgākṣettrapāla-
yorapikecit tathāpuṭāṃjalirbhūtvāvāmegurutrayaṃyajet dakṣiṇeścagaṇeśānaṃmū
rdhnidaivanatiṃcaret itikalpataruḥoṃsahasrāravavarmāsudarśanamanuḥsmṛtaḥoṃsaha
srārahuṃphaṭ itimaṃtraḥsugaṃdhamuṣpamaṃdenasurabhīkṛtamastakaḥkṣipeduttarataḥpuṣpamaṃ
trīnāmacamudrayā itipūjāpradīpaḥathabhūtaśuddhipradīpaḥathāstramaṃtreṇaviśuddhā
pāṇītritāladigbaṃdhahutāśaśālān vidhāyabhūtātmakametadaṅgaviśodhayeccha
ddhamatiḥkrameṇa tritālamūrdhvardhvaastramaṃtrasahitaṃ ūrdhvordhvamasumaṃtreṇakuryāttālaca

pṛ0 62ba) yaṃtataḥtenamaṃjanitaṃtejaḥkuryāddakṣāṃsamaṃtataḥitivacanāt hutāśaśālaṃvahniprakā
ram tataḥsuṣumṇāvartmanātmānaṃparamātmaniyojayet yogayuktenavidhinācinmaṃ-
treṇasamāhitaḥkāraṇesarvabhūtānāṃtatvānyapiviciṃtayet vījabhāvenalīnāni
vyutkramātparamātmani cinmaṃtraḥsohamitimaṃtraḥmanunāhaṃsavedasyityanenahaṃsiti
matreṇānayanamitipūjāpradīpaḥnaitāvatāsohamitimaṃtrasiddhiḥvastutaḥcinmaṃtreṇa
vyutkrameṇayojayetparamātmani itiśruteḥubhayorevacinmaṃtratvamaviruddhamititatvāni
paṃcaviṃśatiścaturviṃśatirvā taduktaṃprapaṃcasāre bhūtaṃdriyedriyārthairuddiṣṭatatvapaṃcaviṃ
śatikaṃ karaṇopetairetaistatvānyuktānyavahitacaraṇādyairiti iṃdriyāṇijñāneṃdriyā-
ṇipaṃcakarmedriyāṇipaṃcetidaśa iṃdriyāṇāmarthāścadaśa aṃtaḥkaraṇaṃmanobuddhira-
haṃkāraścoṃtaṃcaparikīrtitamiti pṛthivyāptejovāyvākāśāḥmaṃdharasarūpasparśaśa
vdaghrāṇarasanācakṣustvakśrottravā(bhuvanodhyoṣaṇakaraṃ svakaṃdehaṃtenapratatavavapuṣāpū
rvasakale)kṣāṇipādapāyupasthavacanādānagamanavisargānaṃdātmakaṃpaṃcaviṃśatita-
ttvāmivījabhāvenatatralīnāniviciṃtyiḍāvaktredhūmraṃsatatagatibījaṃmalavakasmarenmaṃ
trīpūrvaṃsakalaṃbhuvanodhyoṣaṇakaraṃ svakaṃdehaṃtenapratatavapuṣāpūrvasakalaṃvi-

pṛ0 63a) śoṣavyāmuṃcenpavanamathamārgeṇakhamaṇeḥtenaivamārgeṇavilīnamārutaṃbījaṃviciṃtyāru
ṇamāśuśukṣaṇeḥ āpūryadehaṃparidahyavāmatomuṃcetsamīraṃsahabhasmanāvahiḥkhamaṇermā-
rmeṇasūryavartmanāṭaparamatīvaśubhramamṛtāṃśuparthānavidhuṃnapatulalāṭaṃcaṃdramamutaḥsaka
lārṇamayīm laparajapātparacayeccatapāsakalavapu ramṛtaucavṛṣṭimathavaktrakarādyami-
dam ṭaparaṃvidhuṃvamiticaṃdrabījamityarthaḥamṛtaḥlalāṭacaṃdrāt lapajapātlaparala
kārasyaparovakārastasyajapāt vamitiścamṛtavījajayāt amṛtaucavṛṣṭinipātya
tayāvaśiṣṭabhasmanāsakalaṃvapuḥracayeditipradīpaḥevaṃtataḥsaṃśoṣayeddehaṃvāyubīje
navāyunā vahnibījenanenaivasaṃdahetsakalāṃtanum viśleṣayaṃstadādoṣānamṛtenā-
mṛtāṃbhasā āpādyaplāvayeddehamāpādatalamastakam saṃjātenirmaledehadavatārādhanakṣa
me ātmalīnānitattvānisvasthānaṃprāpayettataḥ ātmānaṃhṛdayāṃbhojamānayetparamātma
naḥmanunāhaṃsadevasyakuryānnyāsādikaṃtataḥnyāsādikaṃsvataṃtroktaṃ haṃsadevamaṃtraḥhaṃsi
ti uktaṃcasārasamuccaye saṃyojyajīvamathadurgamamadhyanāḍīmārgeṇapuṣkaraniviṣṭaśi
veṣusūkṣme haṃsenadehamamareṃdrapurogatenasārdheṃdunābhamitasādvidadhītabuddhyāiti ta-
thācobhayapakṣamapipramāṇikam āmareṃdrapurogatenalakāraprathamenarepheṇetyarthaḥ

pṛ0 63ba) pūrakaṃṣoḍaśamātrayā kubhakaṃcatuḥṣaṣṭimātrayā recakaṃdvātriṃśanmātrayetibhāvaḥaya
mapiprāṇāyāmaviśeṣaḥprāṇāyāmecatathātvasyavakṣamāṇatvāt atrakecinpāpapu
ruṣasyaśodhanādikaṃvadaṃti tanmatekukṣopāpapuruṣaṃciṃtayet yathā tataḥtaruṣani
bhaṃpāpamanādibhavasaṃcitaṃ brahmahaṃtyāśiraskaṃcasvarṇasteyabhujadvayam surāpānahṛ
dāyuktaṃgurutalpakaṭidvayam tatsaṃsargipadaṃdvadvamaṃgapratyaṃgapātakam upāpātaka
romāṇaṃraktaṃśmaśrutivilocanaṃ khaḍgācarmadhanaṃkṛṣṇaṃkukṣodakṣiṇataḥsmarait vāmaku
kṣauviciṃtayet itiadhipāvitikecit tataḥsaṃśoṣayeddehaṃpūrakādikrameṇavaiḥ
gurutalpetigurutalpagamanenetyarthaḥvidadhyātmātṛkānyāsamitivacanānmātṛkā
nyāsasyāvaśyakatvam tathācamātṛkāmaṃtrasyṛṣirvrahmāsamuddiṣṭogāyatrīcchaṃ
daroritam sarasvatīsamākhyātādevatāmātṛkākayā halaḥsvarāḥsamākhyātā
bījāniśaktayastathā śirovadanahṛdgrahyapādeṛṣyādikaṃnyaset ṣaḍagānividhe
yānijātiyuktānidaiśakaiḥaṃguṣṭādiṣvaṃgulīṣunyasedeṅgaiḥ sajātibhiḥastretu
talayernyasetkuryāttālatrayaṃtataḥdiśastenaivabadhnīyācchoṭikābhiḥsamāhitaḥhṛ
dādiṣuvinyasedaṅgamaṃtraṃtataḥsudhāḥhṛdayāyanamaḥpūrvaṃśirasevahnivallabhām śikhāyaiva

pṛ0 64a) ṣaḍityuktaṃkavacāyahumīritam netratrayāyavauṣaṭsyādastrāyaphaḍitikramāt ṣaḍaṅgamaṃtrā
nityuktānṣaḍaṃgeṣuniyojayet paṃcāṃgānimanoyasyatasyanetramanuṃtyajet aṃgahīnasyamaṃ
trasyasvenaivāṃgānikalpayet jātayaścanamaḥsvāhāvaṣaṭhuṃvauṣaṭphaṭkārevajā
tiṣaṭkamidaṃproktaṃhṛdayastrāṃtaṃsaṃyutam astraṃtutalayoriti yadyapyastraṃtutalayoḥ
nyaseditivacanātpaṃcāṃgapakṣepiastranyāsaḥkaratalayorevatathāpiracayatukaradvaṃdvepaṃcāṃ
gamaṃlipaṃcakitikramadīpikāvacanāt kaniṣkayorevāstranyāsitikavacamaṃtrastu
paṃcamasvarayuktohakāraḥpaṃcamasvaraḥhrasvaḥukārastadyuktaṃhakāraḥsaviṃdurityarthaḥtena
humitibīṃjabhavati tathācakavacāyeti paṃcamasurayuktohakārohumitikavaca
maṃtraḥsavaṣaṭ śikhāhumitivarmaṇisthitamitikramadīpikāvacanāt anyathāta
trachaṃdobhaṃgāpatteḥ atastvaritāmaṃtredīrghaṃtanucchadamiti abhihitaṃ tathācobhayerevaka
vacamaṃtratvamāyāti netratrayetisaṃbhavaduktakamidaṃ yatratunetradvayaṃ tatranetrābhyāmitiva-
ktavyaṃ aṃgahīnasyānuktāṃgamaṃtrasyasvenaivamūlamaṃtreṇaivaatrakaranyāseaṃguṣṭābhyāṃnamityā
diprayogasyapramāṇābhāvāt tadāṃgakatathāyathāsameritaṃkare itikramadīpikāvaca
nācca hṛdayāyanamityevaprayogaḥitipūjāpradīpaḥtatraaṃguṣṭādiṣvaṃgulīṣunyame-

pṛ0 64ba) daṃgaiḥsajātibhiḥitiśāradātilakavacanānurodhāt tasyārthaḥaṃguliḥsajāti
bhiraṃgairaṃguṣṭādiṣvagulīnyasedityarthaḥnacāṃgulisājātyaṃhṛdayadiṣvapītivācya
m vyavahāravirodhāditi kiṃcakramadīpikāvacanasyāpyayamevārthaḥyathāvatpra
kāreṇāṃgapaṃcakaṃkaresamīritaṃtathātatprakāreṇaivahṛdayepītiapica ādau
cāṃgaṃmamuccāryamaṃtraṃpaścānnyasetsudhīritivacanavirodhāt karanyāseityabhidhāna
syavyarthatvāt tasmādaṃguṣṭābhyāṃnamityevaprayogaḥvahniprāyetivacanātsvāhādi
prayogo'nusaraṇīyastarjanyādau evaṃkarāṅganyāsauvidhāyamātṛkanyāsaṃkuryāt
yathā oṃpaṃcāśalipibhrirviviktamukhadoḥpadmasyavakṣaḥsthalāṃbhāsvatmaulini
vaddhacaṃdraśakalāmāpīnatuṃgastanīm mudvāmakṣaguṇāṃmudhāḍhākalaśaṃvidyāṃcaha
stāṃbujerbibhrāṇāṃviṣadaprabhāṃtrinayanāṃvāgdevamāśraye pacāśallipibhiritia-
kāsadikṣakārāṃtalipibhiryathākrameṇāṃgamastakaṃciṃtanīyam taduktaṃprapaṃcasā
reprakacaṭapayādyaiḥsamabhirvarṇavargairvirācataimukhabāhūpādamadhyākhyamṛtveti mu
drādikaṃdakṣiṇādhaḥkrameṇaprādakṣiṇyena mudrājñānam tathā maṃguṣṭatarjanīyogā
jñjñānamudrāprakīrtiteti sthānānyāhalalāṭamukhavṛtākṣiśrutighrāṇeṣugaṃḍayoḥ

pṛ0 65a) oṃṣṭadaṃtottamāṃgasyaroḥetmaṃdhyaṃdyakeṣucapārśvayoḥpṛṣṭatonābhaujaṭharehṛdayāṃsakeka
kuryasecahṛtpūrvapāṇipādayugeapi jaṭharāvanayormyasenmātṛkārṇānyathākramam
kaṣāṃcinmate hṛdayādiṣuaṃyādiṣurephenyāsaḥpādayoḥśaṣoḥbhujayoścamahārnyā
saḥ oṃmādyaṃtonamotovāsaviṃduḥviṃduvarjitaḥpaṃvāśadakṣaranyāsaḥkrameṇaivaṃvidhī
yate itiviśvasāraśravaṇāt atrakevalānāṃsavirgāṇāṃcasṛṣṭikrameṇavisarga-
biṃdusaṃhitānāṃsthitikrameṇasabiṃdunāṃmaṃhārakrameṇanyāsaḥsthityādaunyāseviśe
ṣaḥtaduktaṃśāradātike nyāsetsargānvināṃsṛṣṭyādhyātvādevīyathāvidhi sargabiṃ
dvaṃtikāṃnyase'rṇāyyāṃsthitivartmanā tathācavaiśampāyanasaṃhitāyām biṃdusa
rgānvitāṃnyasedgulphādisthitivartmanā jānvaṃtaṃtutatodevigṛhasthānāṃbhavedaya
m ukārādivakārāṃtāṃyojayetparadevatāmitividyātpūrvoditānvanyānṛṣyā
dīnaṃgasaṃyutām dhyāyedvarṇeśvarīmaṃtravallabhenasamanvitām vallabhomaheśaste-
nayutām tasyadhyānamāha siṃdūrakāṃtimasitābharaṇaṃtrinetraṃvidyākṣasūtramṛgayo
tavarāndadhānam pārśvasthitāṃbhagavatīmapikāṃcanāṃgīṃdhyāyetkarāvradhṛtapusta-
kavarṇamālām viśeṣānabhidhānādviṃdusargarahitopisṛṣṭikrameṇaivanyāsaḥ pra

pṛ0 65ba) thamopasthitatvāt akārāṭikṣakārāṃtanyāsevasṛṣṭiprakāraḥsthitītivyācaṣṭe ṭā
rṇābhyāmiti ṭakāsadikṣakāraparyaṃtaṃvarṇānvitasyaakārādiaikārāṃtānvinyasediti
kevalabiṃduyuktaṃnyāsamāha biṃduyutāmimāṃsetsaṃhṛtyāpratilomataḥvidyātprarvodi-
tānnyāsānṛṣyādīnaṃgasaṃyutām dhyāyedvarṇamayepadmedevīṃvāgvallabhāṃśivām dhyāna
m akṣasrajaṃhariṇapotamudagraṭaṃkaṃvidyāṃkarairavitaṃradadhatīṃtrinetrām ardheṃdumauli
maruṇāmaraviṃdabhāsāṃvarṇaśvarīṃpraṇamatasnanabhāranamāṃ saṃhṛsesasyaivavikaraṇaṃprati
lomitiititathācakṣakāramārabhyaakāraparyaṃtaṃnyasedityarthaḥanyaprakāraścagaura
vabhayānnalikhitaḥprāṇāyāmaṃpravakṣyāmisarvataṃtrānusārataḥpavanaseyamanatvapunā-
caretyamihajaptamasauanumicchati athavā akhileṣuharimaṃtrajapādiṣumūla-
maṃtratityanenamūlamaṃtrasyavidhānāt athavā aṃgajanmamanunāsusaṃyamaṃsakaleṣukṛ
ṣṇajapakarmasusahitaikasaptakṛtivāramabhyasaṃstanuyātsamastaduritāpahāriṇāi-
tyādināvījasyāpyabhidhānāt tasmādubhayapakṣakīrtanādekadeśenvayaḥtathāce-
cchāvikalpaḥmūlamatroṣṭākṣaragopālamaṃtraḥkramadipikāyāṃ tathācamūlamaṃtreṇatve-
nābhidhānaṃt daśākṣarīvā pakṣāṃtaramāha athavāsādhakaḥkuryātpraṇavenāśusaṃyamam

pṛ0 66a) strībhiḥśūdraścakartavyolokikenāsusaṃyamaḥtriṣadvādaśavāraṃvāyarataḥparatojapet pa
rataḥparatitiparaḥparityarthaḥśuciḥprāṇāyāmānpraṇavasahitānṣoḍaśavaśīprabhā-
tesāyaṃcapratidivasamevavitanutedvijopastaṃvruṇapraharaṇakṛtāṃhovikalitaṃpuratye
tamāsādihaduritadulaucadahanāḥprabhātesāyaṃcityatraphalabhūmāṃśatrayātmakaḥso
yaṃpūrakakuṃbhakarecakaiḥprāṇāyāmastāvaddvividhobhavatisagarbhogarbhaścajapadhyānā-
dibhiryuktaṃsagarbhataṃdurvudhā tadapetasagarbhaṃtuprāṇāyāmaparejaguḥtatprakāramāha i-
ḍayākarṣayedvāyuṃvāhyaṃṣoḍaśamātrayāvārayetpūstiṃmaṃtrīcatuḥṣaṣṭyātumāṃtrayā su
ṣumnāmadhyakaṃsamyakadvātriṃrāmnātrayāśanaiḥnādyāpiṃgalayācainaṃrecayedyogavittamaḥ
prāṇāyāmamidaṃprāhuryogaśāstraviśāradāḥbhūyobhūyaḥkramāttasyavyānyāsenasamāca
ret mātrāvṛddhikrameṇaivasamyagdvādaśaṣoḍaśa iḍayetipūraṇaṃprathamaprāṇāyāmāprāyeṇa
dvitīyepiṃgalayaivapūraṇātyenaivaṃsaṃtyajettenapūrayeditiśravaṇāt yathāpūraṇaṃ
tadanyayārecanamitisakalaprāṇāyāmānugataṃṣoḍaśamātrayetyupalakṣaṇam
mātrāvṛddhikrameṇaivetyādinādhikenāpipūraṇaśravaṇāt sanatkumārasaṃhi
tāyām dakṣayārecayedvāyuṃdvātriṃśanmātrayātataḥmātrāca mārkāḍeyapurāṇe

pṛ0 66ba) nimeṣonmeṣaṇemātrākāliti iḍayākarṣayedvāyuṃmanoḥṣoḍaśamātrayāḥ suṣumṇāma
dhyamaṃkṛtvāvidyāvatkṣaṇadhārayet yenaivapūrayedvāyuṃtenevarayetpunaḥubhayormadhyamaṃkṛ
tvātattanmātrābhidhāyaṇam pīṭhanyāsamathovakṣyepathāvadavadhāraya kalpayedātmano
dehepīṭhaṃdharmādibhiḥkramāt dharmaṃjñāṃnaṃcavairāgyamaiśvaryaṃvinyasetkramāt mukhapārśve-
nābhipārśveadharmādīnprakalpayet dharmādayaḥsmṛtāḥpādāḥpīṭhagātrāṇicāpare a
naṃtaṃhṛdayepadmamasminsūryaṃdupāvakāḥeṣāṃsvasvakarṇānyasyāḥpraṇavākṣarapūrvikāḥsa
tvāditriguṇānnyasettathevātragurūttamāḥ ātmānamaṃtarātmānaṃparamātmānamevaca jñā
nātmānaṃnyasettadvanmātrayāvījapūrvakam śāradāyām ṛṣyādinyāsānaṃtaraṃpīṭhanyā
suktaḥ tataḥcopāsyamatrasyanyāsāṛṣyādikāṃścaret tathācaviśuddheśvaretaṃtre ṛ
ṣinyāsomūrdhnideśekaṃdastumukhapaṃkaje devatāhṛdayecaivavījaṃtuguhyadeśake śaktiṃ
capādayoścaivasarvādikīlakaṃnyaset ṛṣistu maheśvaramukhījñātvāyaḥsākṣāttapa
sāmanum saṃsādhayatiśuddhātmāsatasyṛṣirīritaḥgurutvānmastakecāsyanyāsa
statparikīrtitaḥsarveṣāṃmaṃtratatvānāṃsādhanācchaṃducyate akṣaratvātpadatvāccamukhe
cchaṃdaḥsamīritam ṛṣicchaṃdoparijñānāttamaṃtraḥpalabhāgbhavet daurbalyaṃyāti-

pṛ0 67a) maṃtrāṇāṃviniyogamajānatām itiṛṣinyāsasyāvaśyakatvaṃitibhāvaḥmaṃtraśāstreta
thāproktaṃprāptamaṃtreṇadhīmatā yasyamaṃtrasyayenyāsāḥkartavyāḥśuddhimicchatā japa
tarpaṇahomārcāḥsiddhamaṃtrakṛtāyupi aṃganyāsādibhiḥhīnānadā	phalānya
mī nyāsānsamaṃtānnyasataḥsvadehetralokyametadvaśametipuṃsaḥpāpānisadyaḥpraśa
maṃprayāṃti trasaṃtibhūtānisapannagāni ādauvṛṣyādivinyāsaḥkaranyāsamataḥpara
m yatoyadyakṣaranyāsaḥpadanyāsaśutaḥparam yadīdipadanyāsepyanuṣajāte otsa
rgikakramoyaṃkvacitkalpoktenāpivādhyate puraścaraṇacaṃdrikāyāṃca ta-
ttatkalpaviśeṣoktānnyāmānanyānsamācaret kramadīpikāyāṃtu aṃga-
nyāsaṃvidhāyṛṣyādinyāsuktaḥ dhyānasvarūpamāha dhyānaṃcātmeṣṭadeva
syamanasāvedanaṃmatam yajjīvavrahmaṇoraikyaṃsohaṃsyāditivedanam tannirgu
ṇaṃhṛdaṃbhojaṃkarṇikākaṃsarānvitam svīyeṣṭadevatāṃtatradhyāyedāgama-
deśitām evaṃyadvedanetattumaguṇaṃdhyānamucyate evaṃdhyātvātathātmānaṃ
pūjayedvāhyayogataḥ ātmāgrataccatuṣkoṇaṃṣaḍasraṃcatrikāṇake

pṛ0 67ba) sāmānyārghajastenaivakṛtvāṃgāniprapūjayet āgneyādiṣukoṇeṣuhṛdādyaṃ
gacatuṣṭayaṃ netramagredivāsvasuṃmūlenakṣālitaṃtataḥ redikāyāṃpravinyasya
bhālayechaṃkhamasvatāḥ sādhāraṃsthāpayedvidvānvāmatovahnimaṃḍale vahni-
maṃḍaletrikoṇe tatragaṃdhādikaṃdeviprakṣipeddhṛdayāṇunā ādipadātpuṣpā
kṣataparigrahaḥhṛdayāṇunānamitimaṃtreṇa arghasvarūpamāha gaṃdhapuṣpākṣa
tivakuśāgratilasarṣapaiḥ sadūrvesarvadevānāṃmarghoyaṃparikīrtitāḥpurāṇa-
māha pūrayedvimalapāthasāsradhīraparikṣaraiḥpratigataiḥśiroṃtakaiḥ akṣa
rairmātṛkākṣaraiḥpratigatairvimalomasthaiḥśiroṃtagaiḥsvāhāṃtagaiḥ aṃkā-
rāṃtairapikecit vilomamātrakāmaṃtrapāṭhānaṃtaraṃmūlamaṃtropipaṭhanīyāḥ
ityapikecit tatratīrthamanunābhivāhayettīrthamuṣṇarucimaṃḍalāṃtataḥ

pṛ0 68a) svīyahṛtkamalatohariṃtathāgāyinīṃtaduparipradarśayet tajjalaṃnamaṃtravīkṣi
taṃvarṇasamavaguṇṭhādotpūjāmūlamaṃtrasakalīkṛtaṃnyasedaṃgakaiścakalayedviśesa
teḥnayanamaṃtravīkṣitaṃvauṣaḍitimaṃtravīkṣitaṃ varmaṇāhumitimaṃtreṇa tīrthāvāha
naṃmaṃkuśamudrayā taduktaṃgautamīye tīrthamāvāhayedvidvānmudrayāṃkuśasaṃjñayā
prākapradarśitoyaṃtīrthamaṃtraḥsakalīkṛtamabhimaṃtritam tathācaśāradāyām
mūlamaṃtraṃjapetsṛṣṭvājapettasyāṃgamaṃtravit dhenumudrayāmṛtīṃkṛtyasakalīka
raṇaṃ taduktaṃ amṛtīkaraṇaṃkṛtvāciṃtayediṣṭadevatām aṃganyāsenasa-
kalīkṛtyāstreṇadiśodaśa akṣatādiyutamacyutīkṛtaṃsaṃspṛśaṃjapatimaṃ-
tramaṣṭamaḥmatsyamudrayācchādyajapet taduktaṃ aṣṭakṛtvejapenmūlamācchādyama
tsyamudrayeti dakṣiṇeprokṣiṇepātramādāyādbhiḥpūrayet kiṃcidarghāṃṣusaṃ

pṛ0 68ba) gṛhyaprokṣaṇyaṃbhasiyojayet prokṣaṇīpātratoyenatenātmānaṃtrivārataḥprokṣyapraṣpā
dikaṃcāpimūlenaprokṣayetsudhīḥdakṣiṇe pūrvasthāpitārghasyadakṣiṇe prokṣaṇaṃ
cakareṇaivaprokṣayennijamātatraṃtatomunātriḥkareṇaṃmanunātathākhilam sā
dhanaṃkusumacaṃdanādikamiti pādyasyacācamanīyasyamadhuparkasyacāpyatha pā
trāṇyādhārayuktānisvarṇādiracitānica sthāpayetpuratastānipūrayecchāstrava
rtmanā pādyādipātrasthamāhaarghasyottarataḥkāryaṃpādyamācamanīyakam itivaca
nāt svarūpāṇyāha pādyaṃśyāmakadūrvābjaviṣṇukāṃtājalaiḥsmṛtam jātīlavaṃga
kakkolavaṃgakakkolajalerācamanīyakam ājyaṃdadhimadhūmiśramadhuparkaḥsa
mīritaḥpunarācamanīyekevalajalena taduktaṃgotamīye tenaivamanunākuryādadbhi
rācamanīyakam ājyaṃdadhimadhūmiśramadhuparkaḥsamīritaḥ punarācamanīyaṃke
valajalena taduktaṃgotamīye tenaivamanunākuryādadbhirācamanīyakam ekasmi
nnapipātrevāpādyādīniprakalpayet sarvopahāravastūnāṃmabhāvebhāvayeddhiyā

pṛ0 69a) sarvopahāriti upahāraviśeṣābhāvemanasākalpanamitipūjāpradīpaḥtacciṃtyaṃsāmānyā
bhāvaparamitiniṣkarṣaḥathamānasapūjā athamūrdhanimūlacakramadhyenijanāthaṃgaṇanā
yakasamarcyanyāsanakramataścamūlamaṃtrairjalagaṃdhākṣatapuṣpadhūpadīpaiḥprayajedathamūlamaṃtra
toyonijamūlehṛdayedhruvoścamadhye tritayaṃsmarataḥsmarettadekīkṛtamānaṃdaghanaṃtaḍi
llatābham tattejoṅgaiḥsāvayavīkṛtyanijanāthaṃguruṃpīṭhamaṃtraiḥoṃādhāraśaktayenamaḥityā
dimaṃtraiḥsmarataḥkāmabījenetyarthaḥtataḥsaṃpūjjayeddevaṃgaṃdhādyaiḥmūlamuccaranpaṃcakṛtvāpunaḥ
kuryātpuṣpāṃjalimananyadhīḥuttamāṃgehṛdādhārepādasarvāṃgakekramāt athavāpādyaṃda-
ttvāsamarcayedgaṃdhapūṣpādyaiḥtāṃbūlagītanartanavāyaiḥ saṃtoṣyaculakasalilena
vrahmāpaṃṇākhyamanunākuryātsvātmārpaṇamaṃtrī arpaṇamastuagrelikhyate mā
nasapūjāyāṃnaivedyadānaṃnāsti vinānaiveyagaṃdhādyairupamanyatsamācaret gurupadiṣṭa
vīdhināśaṣamanyatsamāpayet śeṣaṃtattatkalpoktam itimānasīpūjā vāhya
pūjāṃpravakṣyāmimaṃtriṇāohitakāmyayā evaṃdehamayepīṭhecitayedaṣṭadevatām mudrāpra

pṛ0 69ba) darśyavidhivadarghasthāpanamācaret itivacanān arghasthāpanamidānīṃmeva tadanuṣṭānaṃdī
kṣāpallavenusaṃdheyam śastaṃnijaikyenatathaivacakrecittrepaṭevāyajanaṃnabhūmau mohāda
sausthaṃḍilagaṃyajeccedraśyetrivargādapisiddhametraḥ sāligrāmemanauyaṃtremaṃḍaleprati
māsuca nityaṃpūjāhareḥkāryaḥnatukevalabhūtaleḥ bhūniṣedhastumaṃḍalātirahita
bhūmiparaḥyaṃtrasyāvaśyakatvamāha ādaulikheyaṃtrarājaṃtatatkalpoktalakṣaṇam sau
varṇyerajatetāmrepīṭhebhūrjapaṭebhuvi vināyaṃtreṇacetpūjādevatānaprasīdati duḥkhani
ryatrāṇādyaṃtramityāhustaṃtravedinitikuryādyatramitivacanādyaṃtrasyavaśyakatvam pī
ṭeśrīkhaṃḍādinirmiteanuktakalpeyaṃtrakaraṇamāhavṛhanmatsyasūkteyaṃtraṃtuvilikhetpadma
dalāṣṭakasamanvitam ṣaṭkoṇakarṇikaṃtatravedadvāropaśobhitamiti paṃcāyatana
dīkṣāpakṣe paṃcadevatāsthānaniyamamāha śaṃbhaumadhyagateharītaharabhūdevyoharauśaṃ-
karebhāsyenāmasutāravaugaṇapatīśājāṃbikāḥ sthāpitāḥdevyāṃviṣṇuharaikadaṃta
ravayolaṃbodarejeśvarenāryāḥśaṃkarabhāgatotiśubhadāvyastāstuhāniṣpadāḥ śaṃkara
bhāgataḥīśāditaḥ tathācoktaṃsamāyāmātṛkāyām pūrvesūryaṃprapūjyāthadakṣiṇe
gaṇanāyakam īśvaraṃpaścimedeśeuttareviṣṇumarcayet tasmāccaturdiśikramavaśānni

pṛ0 70a) rmāyacakraṃśubhaṃsūryaṃhastimukhaṃparasmaraharaṃgopālamenaṃtathā dhyātvārādhyatatobahuvidhaiḥpu
ṣpaiścagaṃdhādibhirnānādivyasugaṃdhamādekaphalairuddhāmayetsvehṛdi tathācajñānamālā
yām bhavānīṃtuyadāmadhyeaiśānyāṃmādhavaṃyajet āgneyyāṃpārvatīnāthaṃnaiṛtyāṃgaṇanā
yakam pradyotanaṃtuvāyavyāmācaryastuprapūjayet ātmanaḥpuratobhadrodevatāpuratastathā
pūrvāśekalpitāmaiṣāsarvadevārcanematāitidakṣiṇāmūrtisaṃhitāyām devāgresvasyacā-
pyagreprācīproktāgurukrameti uttarāśāmukhodeviyadācakraṃsamarcayet uttarāśātadādevipūrvā
śaivenasaṃśayaḥ īśānakoṇaṃdevīśitadāgreyaṃnasaṃśayaḥ paścimābhimukhomaṃtrīyadāca-
kraṃsamuddharet paścimāśātadājñeyāpūrvāśaivanasaṃśayaḥvāyukoṇaṃtadājñeyamīśānaṃrākṣa
saṃmatam dakṣiṇābhimukhomaṃtrīyadācakraṃsamuddharet pūrvāśaivatadāsādigrakṣaḥkoṇaṃtuva
hnimat asyārthaḥviṣṇuśivadurgāgaṇeśasūryāṇāṃmadhyeyāiṣṭadevatāḥ tāsāṃmadhyepūja-
nīyā tadbhinnacatuṣṭayamīśānādikoṇacatuṣṭayeṣupūjanīyam yathā śaṃbhaumadhya
gatehariḥsūryaḥgaṇeśaḥdurgāitipūjanīyā evaṃviṣṇvādiṣubodhyam pīṭhasyottara-
syāṃgurupaṃktiḥ pūjanīyāgurupaṃktistuguruparamaguruparameṣṭiguruparāparagu
ravaḥpīṭhaśaktayaḥ ādhāraśaktyādijñānātmanyāṃtāḥpūjyāḥ

pṛ0 70ba) pūrvodikesareṣumadhyecatattatkalpoktapīṭhaśaktīḥsaṃpūjyāḥmadhyepīṭhamanuyajediti
pūrvādidiṅniyamastupūjyapūjakayormadhyeprācītikathyatebudhaiḥ taddakṣiṇaṃdakṣiṇaḥ
syāduttaraṃcottaraṃmatam pṛṣṭatupaścimaṃjñeyaṃsarvatraivaṃprayojayediti pūrṇāyāgepū
jayedityanuvṛttau mūlenamūrtisaṃkalpadhyātvādevaṃyathāvidhi sāvāhyapūjayettasyāṃ
maṃtrīmatrasyadevatām mūrtisaṃkalpapīṭhoparisthāpayitvākalpadrumacchāyāyāḥ
saṃsthitāṃmūrtidhyātvāmūlamuccāryāmukamūrtayenamitipūjayet mūlenamūrtimiṣṭvā
syāṃchāyāṃyāṃkalpaśākhināmitivacanāt āvāhanaprakārastupūrṇāyāge mūlādhā
resphuraddīpteśikhākārāṃśivāṃsmaret śāradāyāṃca mūlamaṃtraṃsamuccāryasuṣumṇāvartma
nāsudhīḥ ānīyatejaḥsvasthānānnāsikāraṃdhranirgatam karasthamātṛkāṃbhojecaita
nyapuṣpasaṃcaye saṃyojyavrahmaraṃdhreṇamūrtyāmāvāhayetsudhīḥ mātṛkāṃbhaujasvarūpaṃtuśā
radāyām vyomerdaurasanārṇakarṇikamityādirūpam karasthapuṣpanicayaṃvibhāvya
mūrtyāmāropayet āvāhyasaṃsthāpanaṃsannidhānaṃsannirodhamanaṃtaram sakalīkaraṇaṃpa
ścādvidadhyādavaguṃṭhanam amṛtīkaraṇaṃkṛtvākurvītaparamīkṛtim kramādetāniku
rvītsamudrābhisamāhitaḥāvāhanādirūpaṃsiddhāṃtasāre atevābhipūrṇasyasattvasyai

pṛ0 71a) vārcanādiṣusadevaṃsaṃmukhībhāvamāvāhanamitīritam śivasyāvāhitasyāsyavidyā
dehennasaṃtatam sthirīkaraṇamuddiṣṭaṃsthāpanaṃbhaktitorcane pūjyāṃprapūjyamānaṃtugṛ
hītvānugrahādikam karttuṃsāmarthyamasyehatatsānnidhyaṃpracakṣyate āsamāptestupū-
jāyāṃsonnidhyaṃhiśivasyayat sasannirodhuddiṣṭovibhorapyasyabhaktitaḥ ānaṃdāya
tanaṃtattvaṃsaccidānadalakṣaṇam tadatrasakalīvyāptaṃdhyeyaṃsyādavaguṭhanam avabhi
nnasvabhāvānāṃyadabhinnaṃprayojanam aṃgānāmaṃgināsārdhasamṛtikaraṇaṃtvidam kṣa
mātasyāparādhānāṃvijñaṃyāparamīkṛtiḥ somaśambhunāpyetadevoktam evaṃsūrūpamā
vāhanādividheyam athopacārānkurvītmaṃtravittaṃtradeśitān prayojayedarcanā
yāmupacāraṃstuṣoḍaśa āsanaṃsvāgataṃcārghyaṃpādyamācamanīyakam pradhuparkācamanaṃ
snānavasanābharaṇānica sugaṃdhasumanodhūpadīpanaivedyavaṃdanam arghādyāḥpaṃcapaṃcai
vagaṃdhādyāitibhedataḥ gaṃdhādibhirnivedyāṃtāḥpūjāpaṃcopacārikā paṃcopacārā
nādautāṃbūlāvaśyakatvavyavahārāstubhramamūlaṃkevadurlabheupacāreśuyatkartavyaṃtadā
ha upacāreṣusarveṣuyatkiṃciddurlabhaṃbhavet tatsarvaṃmanasādhyātvāpuṣpakṣepeṇapūjayet tatratatra
jalaṃdadyādupacārāṃtarāṃtarai devatāyāściraḥkuryātkusumopahitaṃsadā pūjākāledevatāyānoparibhrāmayetkaram

pṛ0 71ba) itipūjāpradīpaḥpuṣpadāneviśeṣamāha puṣpaṃvāyadivāpattraṃneṣṭaṃtāvadadhomukham duḥ
khadaṃtatsamākhyātaṃyathotpannaṃtathārpaṇam puṣpaṃvisarjayeddevimudrayājñānasaṃkhya-
yā aṃguṣṭatarjanīyogājñānamudreyamīritā tarpaṇānipunaḥkuryāttrivāraṃtattvamudra-
yā aṃguṣṭānāsikābhyāṃtutattvamudreyamīritāiti suṃdararahasyavṛttau adhomukhaṃpha
laṃneṣṭaṃpuṣpāṃjalividhaunata itivacanādaṃjalidānaniyamonāstiḥ upacāravidhiṃ
vakṣyedattvācāthaśubhāsanam svāgataṃkuśalapraśnaṃnigadedagratoguroḥ pādyaṃpādāṃvuje
dadyāddevasyahṛdayānunānamitimaṃtreṇa svadhāmaṃtreṇavadanedadyādācamanīyakam sva
dhāmaṃtraḥsvadhetisvarūpam arghyaṃdiśettatomūrdhniśiromaṃtreṇadaiśikaḥśiromaṃtraḥsvā
hetimaṃtraḥ sudhānunātataḥkuryānmadhuparkaṃmukhāmvuje anurmaṃtraḥsudhānuḥvamiti
maṃtrityarthaḥ tenaivamanunākuryādadbhirācamanīyakam tenaivamudhāmanunaivaarghaṃ
dattvāvāpādyaṃdadyāt tadāha kramadīpikāyām datvāsanaṃsvāganamityudīryatathā
rghapādyācamanīyakānideyānītyādiśravaṇādicchādikalpitibhāvaḥ ācamanī
yaṃvāratrayaṃdadyāttaduktaṃpūrṇāyāge sudhetyācamanīyam hitrivāraṃmukhapaṃkeje mu
kuṭoparipuṣpaṃcavauṣaḍityarpayetsudhīḥ itipūrṇāyāgavacanāt vauṣaḍitipuṣpadāna

pṛ0 72a) mitiśruteḥ vastutevauṣaṭnamityevamaṃtraḥkecittusudhārghādidāneṣvapitathā tadukta
m pāṣāṃḍākuśe namaḥsvadhācasvāhācavauṣaḍitikramam hṛtparaḥsaramuccāryapādyā
dīniprakalpayet tathācārghyaṃnamaḥitidāmaṃtraḥkecittatsudhāmaṃtreṇavadanapū
tivacanesudhetipāṭhaṃkalpayaṃti tacciṃtyam gaṃdhādibhiḥkārayetsnānaṃvāsasīpari-
dhāpayet dadyāddivyopavītaṃcahārādyābharaṇaiḥsaha abhyarcyadevegaṃdhādyairaṃgādīnpūjaye-
ttataḥaṃgapūjāceyaṃdevatāśarīre tathācaśāradāyām dhūpādidānānaṃtaramuktam yathā
aṃgādilokapālāṃtaṃyajedāvaraṇānyapi anaṃtaraṃmūlepuṣpāṃjalitrayaṃdatvāprāgivapu
ṣpāṃjalipaṃcakaṃtadyāditipradīpaḥ vastutastu tataḥpuṣpāṃjaliṃdatvāparivārārcanaṃcare
ditirāghavabhaṭṭāityetraivavacanaśrute saṃkhyāvāsādakābhāvāditi adyāvaraṇapūjā
tatra kesareṣvagnikoṇādihṛdayādīnipūjayet netramagrediśāsvastraṃdhyātavyāṃga
devatāḥ tuṣārasphaṭikaśyāmanīlakṛṣṇāruṇārciṣaḥ varadābhayadhāriṇyāḥpradhā
natanavaḥstriyaḥevaṃca āgneśāsuravāyūnāṃdikṣucatvāryupakramātiti śaṃbhuvaca
naṃśivapūjāviṣayamitipūjāpradīpaḥkesareṣusthānaviśeṣānupadeśakalpeṣu upadeśetu
tatraivāṃgapūjā praṇavādicaturthyamaṃgānāṃnamuktvānamoṃtenapūjayetyathāoṃhṛdayāyanamaḥoṃśirasesvāhāitikecitkaścittu

pṛ0 72ba) oṃhāṃhṛdayāyanamaḥ oṃhīṃśirasesvāhāṣaḍadīrghabhājābījenaṃpūjāmāhapradhānatanava
itimukhadevatāyāḥśarīrabhūtāityarthaḥpaścādabhyarcanīyāḥsyuḥkelpoktavṛttayaḥkramā
t aṃteyajelokapālānamūnpāriṣadānvitām iṃdramagniyamaṃrakṣovaruṇaṃpavanaṃvidhum
īśānaṃpannaṃgādhīśamaturdhvaṃpitāmaham rakṣoniṛtivaruṇayormadhyeūrdhvaṃiṃdreśānayo
rmadhyeūrdhvaṃiṃdreśānayormadhyejātyadhipitibhāvapradhānanirdeśātsādhipatyopetānityartho
lakṣyate tathācasurādhipatayeiṃdrāyanamitikecit caṃdrikāyāṃcapatrādhīśvaravarṇāstra
parivārāṃsaṃgatān iṃdrādīnnacaryedityuktam pattraṃvāhanaṃ kanakakapilanīlaśyāmalaśve
tadhūmrāmalasitaśuciraktāvarṇatovāsavādyāḥ karakamalavirājatsāyudhādivyaveśā
vividhamaṇigaṇasrakprasphuraṃtoraṇāḍhyāḥteṣāṃvāhanānyāha airāvatastaṭāmeṣomahi-
ṣaḥpretasaṃjñakāḥ makarākhyomṛgapaścāduragovṛṣabhastathā kūrmohaṃsaḥkramādeṣāṃvāha
nānividurvudhāḥ kvacidanaṃtarasyarathovahanamuktaḥsvarūpamāha athavikasitakiṃśukā
bhamagnicchagalagataṃsitaśaktiyuktahastaṃ maṇimayamukuṭaṃyajetsugadhaiḥkusumavaraiddhṛ
tavānsukuṃḍalaṃca itisārasamuccayavacanaṃsthacchāgalapadasyacchāgalomeṣitiṭī
kākāraḥ evaṃsmṛtauca bhagaṃdarajanakapāpaprāyaścittameṣīdāne devānāṃyomukhaṃhavyavā

pṛ0 73a) hanaḥsarvapūjitaḥtasyatvaṃvāhanaṃpūjyaṃdeveśeṃdrairmaharṣibhirityādimaṃtramuktavān prasiddhi
stuvahneḥcchagalavāhanatvenaivapūjāmaṃtramāha tathācapūrṇāyāgeiṃdravajrahastāyasurā-
dhipatayepadam savāhanāyapadaṃpaścātsaparivārāyetyapi namoṃtaṃcaivamanyeṣāṃvāhavāhanā
dikamuddharet anyeṣāmagnyādīnām vāhanādikamityādinā svanāmāstrādhipatyapa
rigrahasūcitaḥmaṃtroyathā iṃdrāyavajrahastāyasurādhipatayesavāhanāyasaparivārāyanama
itimaṃtraḥ pūjāyāṃ evamagnyādīnāmapimaṃtrovodhavyaḥitikecit graṃthāṃtarasvarasātsāṃgāya
svāyudhāyetyādiprakāreṇāpiyojayaṃti pītādivarṇāyetyapikaścit eṣāṃmaṃtrāṇyāha daṃ
bholiśaktyabhidhadaṃḍakṛpāṇapāśavaṃḍāṃkuśāhvayagadātriśikhārapadmāḥ arcyābahirnija
svalakṣitamauliyuktāḥsvasvāyudhābhavasamudyatapāṇipadmāḥdaṃbholirvajraḥkṛpaṇaḥkha
ḍgaḥtriśikhātriśūlaṃ eṣāṃyathāsaṃkhyenānvayaḥnijasvalakṣitamauliyuktāiti
svaṃsvakirīṭanirmitasvasvanāmasvāyudhacihnāityarthaḥ athavāidraṃsyahastevajra-
mevāyudhamubhayecetibhāvaḥ keṣāṃcinmatevādyupyāpyudhaḥ taduktaṃpūrṇāyāge
vāyavedhvajahastāyaprāṇādhipatayetataḥ itipūrṇāyāgasvarasādeyaṃvadaṃti
śaktigadestrīrūpeatrottareviduḥpūjanīyaḥ (kvaciduttaradikpūjaḥkuvīriti)

pṛ0 73ba) kvaciduttaradikpūjaḥkuvīritiśravaṇāt tasyavāhanaṃmanuṣyāḥastraṃcadetibhāvaḥe
vaṃcadhūpadīpadānāṃtaremevāvaraṇapūjābhyadevagaṃdhādyairaṃgādīnpūjayettatitiśāradā-
tilakavacanāt ādipadasvarasāddhūpadīpaparigraha tatraprakāramāha agurūśīraguggu
laśarkarāmadhucādanaiḥ dhūpayedājyasaṃmiśrairnīcairdevasyadaiśikitiśāradāyām graṃthā
tarepi śārāṃgārairghṛtavilasitairjarjaraiḥsaṃvikīrṇairguggulvādyairghanaparimalaivapamāsā
dyamaṃtrī dadyānnīcairdanujamathanāyāpareṇāthadoṣṇāghaṃṭāṃgaṃdhākṣatasukusumairarcitāṃvā
dayānaḥ tattaddīpaṃsurabhighṛtasaṃsiktakarpūravartyādīptaṃdṛṣṭyāprativiṣadadhīḥpadmaparyaṃta
muccaiḥkṛtvādatvāstutimathavidhāyāmaṃyitvāthapādyaṃsārghāmaṃkalpayatuvipulasvarṇa
pātrenivedyam nīcairdevasyādhaḥkṛtvādānamityarthaḥapareṇavāmakareṇaghaṃṭāṃvādayā
nitiśravaṇāt bhūpadīpadānepitadvādanamavaśyakamitibhāvaḥ padmaparyatamasta-
kasyapadmaparyaṃtaduccairuccairdarśanaṃdvīpasyetyarthaḥghṛtenetyupalakṣaṇam tathāca vartyā-
karpūragarbhiṇyāsarpiṣātilajenavā āropyadarśayedvīdhānuccaiḥsaurabhaśālinaḥiti
śravaṇāt tailasyāpyabhidhānāt naivaidyaṃdānamāha naivedyaṃpurataḥkṛtvāstreṇaprokṣya
oṃkāreṇataduparipuṣpaṃnikṣipet tathācoktaṃ saṃsthāpyapurataḥprokṣatāreṇasumanonyasedi

pṛ0 74a) tipratipattiprakāramāha vītihotradayitāṃtamuccaranmūlamaṃtramathanikṣipejjalam arpaye
ttadamṛtātmakaṃhavirdoḥ yujācakusumaṃsamuddharet nivedayāmidayitejuṣāṇedaṃhavirha
re naivedyārpaṇamaṃtroyaṃsarvācāmunijākhyayā vītihotradayitetivītiṃhotraagniḥta
syadayitāsvāhetyarthaḥ sarvārcāsusarvadevārcāsunijāgnyāyātattaddevatānāmnā tathācadu
hitibhāvaḥ amṛtopastaraṇamasisvāhetyācamayettataḥgrāsamudrāṃvāmadoṣṇāvikaco
tpalasannibhām pradarśayandakṣiṇenaprāṇādīnāṃcadarśayet prāṇāpānavyānodānasa
mānāḥkramāccaturthyāyuktāḥuccāraṇīyāḥkramaśovahnijāyāyutāstathāpānīyama
mṛtīkṛtyamudrayādhenusaṃkhyāyācūlakodakamamṛtāpidhānamasiṭhadvayam anenadeva
tāhastedattvācāthaviciṃtayet ācārātpunarācamanīyamapitatoghṛtādisaṃdīptānpiṣṭa
kādivinirmitān pārāvatabhramākārānuccaidīpātpradarśayet ārātikamidaṃproktaṃ
ghaṃṭāvādanapūrvakam gatasāraṃtunaivedyaṃnataścaitatsamuddharet aiśānyāṃtadbhujedattvā
kiṃcitsthānaṃviśodhayet tadbhujedevatocchiṣṭabhujesthānaviśodhanam ucchi
ṣṭabhojanedātuṃtecaviśvaksenaḥsmṛtoviṣṇustejaścaṃḍovivasvataḥ caṃḍeśvarītathā
śakteścaṃḍeśaḥśaṃkarasyaca laṃbodarogaṇapateramīhyucchiṣṭabhojanaḥ tāṃbū**

pṛ0 74ba) tāṃbūlakamabhisamarpyasravādyagītanṛttaiḥsutṛptamabhipūjayatātpureva gaṃdhādibhiṣṇupa
rivāramathārghamasmaidattvāvidhāyakusumāṃjalimādareṇastutvāpraṇamyaśirasāculako
dakenātmānamarpayaṃtu taccaraṇāṃvjamūle iteḥpūrvaṃprāṇavuddhidehadharmādikārataḥ jā
gratsvapnaṣuptyavasthāsumanasāvācākarmaṇāhastābhyāṃpadbhyāmudareṇaśiśnāyatkṛtaṃyadu
ktaṃyatsmṛtaṃtatsarvaṃvrahmārpaṇebhavatusvāhā māṃmadīyaṃcasakalaṃharayecasamarpaye punaḥpū
jācagaṃdhādibhirdīpāṃterupacāraiḥpunaryajediti śāradāyāṃtupaṃcopacārainityuktagaṃdhā
dayovivedyāṃtāpūjāpaṃcopacāriketi prasannāceyamākhyātāsarvadevaprasāṃdine yathā
śaktijapaṃkṛtvātaṃjapaṃsarvasaṃpade dakṣiṇedevahastetuarpayetpūrvavatsudhīḥ arnaṇamaṃ
trastu guhyātiguhyetyādirūpaḥ yathāśaktīti attottarasahasraṃvā daśavātaduktaṃ
pūrṇāpaddhatau saṃkhyānuktauśataṃsāṣṭaṃsahasraṃvājapādiṣuiti puṣpāṃjaliṃpunardattvā
sāhāṣṭāṃgaṃpraṇamenmuhuḥ tathācoktaṃviṣṇukalpalatāyāṃ dorbhyāṃcapadmāmaṃsābhyāṃmu
rasāśirasā dṛśāmanasāvacasācetipraṇāmāṃṣṭāṃgīritaḥbāhubhyāmathajānubhyāṃva
casāśirasādṛśāpaṃcāṃgakāḥpraṇāmoyaṃpūjāsrapravarāvimauaṣṭāṃguttamaḥproktaḥ
paṃcāṃgomadhyamaḥsmṛtaḥnadevaṃpṛṣṭataḥkṛtvāpraṇāmaṃkṛcidacaret paścātkṛtvātuyede

pṛ0 75a) vaṃbhramitvāpraṇamennaraḥtasyaihikaṃphalaṃnāstinaparatradurātmanaḥbhrāṃtvābhrāṃtvācatuṣyārthaṃyaḥ
kṛṣṇaṃpraṇamennaraḥaṣṭāṃgapraṇipātenamuktistasyakaresthitā parivāragaṇaṃsarvamupasaṃ
hāramudratyā tanmūrtāvupasaṃhṛtyadevatāṃprītamānasaḥkṣamasvetivisṛjyāthamaṃtreṇavyāpa
kaṃtriśaḥvidhāyadevatāṃpaścātsvīyahṛtsarasīruhe suṣumṇāvartmanāpuṣpamāghrāyodvā
sayetsudhīḥ evaṃta nirmālyaṃśirasādhāryaṃsarvāgeṣvanulepanam naivedyaṃcopabhuṃjītada
ttvātadbhaktiśālinai tatoguronnamaskāraḥevaṃca devatārcanāvaśiṣṭaṃyatsalilaṃśaṃkha
madhyagam agnelagnaṃmanuṣyāṇāṃvrahmahatyāṃvyapohati etānyanyānipūjāyāṃsādha
nānibahūnyapi uttamānicamadhyāninyūnānivividhānivai svasthaḥsamarthaḥkurvī
tetyuttamairevasādhanaiḥ madhyamomadhyamairevanyūnonyūnaiścasādhanaiḥ āpayapisamartho
pinyūnairevasamācaret yathāśaktiyathānyāyaṃyathālokāvigarhitam pūjāṃvi-
starataḥkartuṃyonaśaktimānavaḥ sihāṃgeṃdravajrādyaiḥpūjayediṣṭadevatām atha
vādevatāmaṃtraṃdhyātvāsamyakprapūjayet athavāmānasīṃkuryādātmapūjāmathāpi
vākprapūjayetathavākevalovalāṃpūjāṃbāhyāṃkuryādvicakṣaṇaḥ arcāmātresama
rthaśceddadyādarcanasādhanam sapūjyaivajapaṃkuryānnamaṃtraṃkevalaṃjapeditivacanātpū

pṛ0 75ba) jāyāāvaśyakatvamitipūjāpradīpaḥ tacciṃtyaṃpūjātunirjanekāryānakuryājjana
sannidhaukadāciddehahānistunacavyaktiḥ kadācanavaraṃpūjāparityānaprakāśyāka
dācaneti kulacūḍāmaṇivacanavirodhāt vastutodhikāriniyaṃtritamitidhye
yam athedānīṃcapūjāyāmuktaṃyadvihitaṃtathā niṣiddhaṃcāpitatsarvamucyategraṃtha
varyake taduktaṃyāmale nākṣatairarcāyedviṣṇuṃnatulasyāvināyakam nadūrvayārca
yedurgāṃbilapattrairdivākaram unmattamakāpuṣpaṃcaviṣṇorvarjyaṃsaṃdāvudhaiḥevaṃcagaṃdhapu
ṣpākṣatayavatkaśāgratilasarṣapaiḥsāmānyaḥsarvadevānāmarghoyaṃparikīrtitaḥ i
tyādiprāptasyākṣatadānasyaniṣedhakamiti kiṃtu puṣpābhāvejalevāpi durvayā
taṃḍulenaca nityaṃpūjāprakarttavyābhaktibhāvenadaiśikaiḥ ityādināpuṣpādyaṃbhāvā
dideśaprāptasyakevalataṃḍuladānasyaniṣedhakamitibhāvaḥ gauttamīyenaraktaṃjā
tugṛhṇīyāccaṃdanaṃraktapuṣpakam vilapattraiḥprasūnairvānārcayeddevakīsutam graṃ
thāṃtare devīnāṃcārkamaṃdāramādityetagaraṃtathā gaṇeśāyacasūryāyaraktapuṣpamatipri
yam niṣiddhānyāha śivekuṃdamadaṃtīṃcadhūṣīṃbaṃdhūkakatake japāṃraktāṃtrisaṃdhyecamā
latīraktacaṃdanam raktavarṇaṃhayāriṃhavarvarāṃparivarjayet tathāśuṣkaistunārcayedvi

pṛ0 76a) ṣṇuṃpattraiḥpuṣpaiḥphalairapi snātvānītaiḥparyuṣitairyācitaiḥkṛṣṇavarṇakaiḥsnātvānītairma
dhyāhnasnānāṃtaramānītairitisaṃpradāyaḥ svayaṃvikāsitaṃpuṣpaṃsvayaṃcapatitaṃbhuvi varja
yedvṛhatīpuṣpamagaṃdhaṃcaviśeṣataḥsvayaṃvikasitaṃsvayaṃhastenavikāsitamityarthaḥta
thā kālikādautathātyājyaṃvinācaṇyakapadmakaiḥ tathātripattrānpūnakusumairnārcaye
ttukadācana bhūgataṃcāṃgasaṃspṛṣṭaikeśakīṭādidūṣitam kumudaṃpaṭalaṃcaivaśirīṣaṃpa
rivarjayet bhūgataṃvarjayetpuṣpaṃśephāliṃbahulaṃvinā chinnabhinnedoṣābhāvamāha
vilasyakhadirasyaivatathādhātrīdalasyaca tamālasyacapadmasyachinnabhinnenaduṣpati
tathānakṣattravidyādau vṛhatmatsyasūkte puṣpaṃśreṣṭaṃraktakokaṃbaṃdhūkaṃśatapattrakam va
rbarādvitayaṃcaivakarṇikāradvayetathā bakasaṃdhāracūtānikaravirāniśasyate ma
likātritayaṃjātīkṣaumapuṣpaṃjayaṃtikā vilapuṣpaṃkuravakaṃmunipuṣpaṃcakesa
raṃ vāsaṃtīdvitayaṃcaivakāśapuṣpaṃmanūvakam damanaṃcalaṃnagaṃcapūtrīśephālikāṃ
tathā sugaṃdhiśvetalauhityaiḥkusumairarcayeddalaiḥtathādevīpūjāsadākāryājala
jaiḥsthalajairapi vihitairavihitairvāpibhaktiyuktenacetasārāghavabhaṭṭopisa
rvapuṣpaiḥsadāpūjāvihitāvihitairapikartavyāsarvadevānāṃbhaktiyogotrakāraṇaṃtathācoktaṃbhaviṣye

pṛ0 76ba) alābhenatupuṣpāṇāṃpatrāṇyapinivedayet pattrāṇāmapyalābhenaphalānyapini-
vedayet phalanyāsasyalābhetutṛṇagulmauṣadhīrapi oṣadhīnāmalābhetujala
mātraṃnivedayet jalābhāvetubhāvenabhaktyāsapūjitobhavet itietadvacanadva
yamabhāvetyaṃtabhaktiviṣayam tathākālītaṃtre apāmārgaustubhṛṅgaistusugaṃdheśveta
lohitai anāśvagraṃthagauravabhayānnalikhitamitisaṃkṣepaiḥ itiśrīāgamakalpa
latāyāṃsaptamaḥphaṭalaḥ oṃnamaḥśivāya śrīparavrahmaṇenamaḥ athasaṃkṣepataḥsarva
devānāṃnityapūjā taduktaṃyāmale ādāvṛṣyādibhirnyāsaḥkaraśuddhistutatparam
aṃgādivyāpakavyāsohṛdādinyāsevaca tālatrayaṃcavigbaṃdhaḥ prāṇāyāmastataḥ
param dhyānaṃpūjājapeccetisarvataṃtreṣvayaṃkramaḥ pūjātumūladevatāeva athapūjo
yamuktāsanamudrālakṣaṇānijānūrvoraṃtarekṛtvāsamyaṣṭyadataleubhe ṛjukāyo
viśedyogīsvastikaṃtadudīritam vāmorūparidakṣiṇaṃcacaraṇaṃsaṃsthāpyavāsaṃpuna
rdakṣorūparipaścimenavidhinādhṛtvākarābhyāṃdṛḍham aṅguṣṭahṛdayenidhāyacivukaṃ
nāsāgramālokayedetadvyādhivi ekāriyamināṃpadmāsanaṃprocyate athamudrāḥpra
vakṣyāmisarvataṃtreṣugopitāḥ yābhirviracitābhistumodaṃtesarvadevatādakṣiṇāṃguṣṭa

pṛ0 77a) tarjanyāvagralagneparāṅgulī prasāryasaṃhatottānāeṣāvyākhyānamudrikādakṣāṃguṣṭaṃparo
guṣṭetiptvāhastadvayenatu sāvakāśā mekamuṣṭikuryātsākuṃbhamudrikā adhoṃgu-
ṣṭhākhalumuṣṭiḥśikhāyāṃkaradvaṃdvāṃgulayorvarmaṇisyuḥ nārācamuṣṭyuhutavāhuyugma
kāṃguṣṭatarjanyuditodhvaniśca viśvagvibhaktaḥkathitastrimudrāyatrākṣiṇītarjani
madhyamestaḥnaitradvayaṃtrabhavedanāmāṣaḍaṃgamudrākathitāyathāvat aṃjalyākhyanamu-
drāsyādvāmadevābhidhācasā kaniṣṭāṃguṣṭakausaktaukarayorititaretaram tarjanīmadhya
mānāmāsaṃhatābhugnavarjitā mudraiṣāgālinīproktāśaṃkhasyoparicāliteti śaṃkha
syoparicālitāsatīgālinyākhyāṃlabhateityuktaḥ ṛjbīcamadhyamāṃkṛtvātarjanīma
dhyaparvaṇi saṃyojyākuṃcayetkiṃcinbhadreṣāṃkuśasaṃjñitā vāmāṃguṣṭaṃtubadhnīyāddakṣiṇe
natumuṣṭinā kṛtvoṃtānāṃtatomuṣṭimaṃguṣṭaṃtupramārayet vāmāṃgulistathāśli
ṣṭāḥ saṃyuktāḥ svaprasāritāḥ dakṣiṇāṃguṣṭasaṃśliṣṭāmudraiṣāśaṃkhasaṃjñayā
mithaḥkaniṣṭakebaddhātarjanībhyāmanāmike anāmikordhvasaṃśliṣṭadīrghama
dhyamayoradhaḥ aṃguṣṭāgradvayaṃnyasedyonipradeyamīritā anyonyābhimukhā
śliṣṭakaniṣṭānāmikepunaḥ (tathaivatarjanīmadhyādhenumudrāsamīritā

pṛ0 77ba) tathaivatarjanīmadhyādhenumudrāsamīritādhomukhedakṣahastetādṛśaṃvāmahastakam
dhārayenmatsyamudreyamarcanesthāpanematā hastābhyāṃmaṃjaliṃbaddhānāsikāmūlapa
rvaṇoḥ āṃguṣṭaunikṣipetseyaṃmudrātvāvāhanīmatā āvāhanosamākhyātāmudrādai
śikasattametivacanādadhomukhītviyaṃcetsyātsnāpanīmudrikābhavet tatsṛṣṭyāṃguṣṭa
muṣṭostusaṃyogātsannidhopanī aṃgatāṃtaḥpraveśitāṃguṣṭāsaivasaṃrodhinīmatā uttāna
muṣṭiyugalāsaṃmukhīkaraṇīmatā devatāṃgoṣaḍaṃgānāṃnyāsaḥsyātsakalīkṛtiḥ
tathācaṣaḍaṃgamudraivasakalīkṛtiḥ gatathāṣaḍaṃgamudraivasakalīkaraṇamudreti
tātparyam cānyathā mudrāprakāraṇetatsvarūṣābhidhānamatāṃtaraṃ savyahastakṛtāmuṣṭi
rdīrghāyomukhatarjanī  avaguṭhanamudreyamabhitobhrāmitāsatī anyonyābhimukhī
ityādinādhenumudrāuktāmṛtīkaraṇaṃkuryāttayāsādhakasattamaḥ anyonyagravitā
ṅguṣṭāprasāritaparāṃguliḥmahāmudreyamuditāparamīkaraṇevudhaiḥprayojayedināṃmudrāṃ
devatāhvānakarmaṇiadhaḥkṛtodakṣahastaḥprasṛtovaramudri ūrdhvokṛtovāmahastaḥpra
mṛtobhayamudrikā hastautusaṃmukhaukṛtvāsaṃlagnausaṃprasāritau kaniṣṭāṃguṣṭakau
saktaumudraiṣācakrasaṃjñakā spṛśetkaniṣṭopakaniṣṭakedvesvāṃguṣṭamūrdhvoprathamehamu

pṛ0 78a) drātathāparātarjanimadhyamesyādanāmikāmadhyamikecamadhyānāmikātarjanimadhya
māsyottadvaccaturthīsakamiṣṭikāstāḥ syātpaṃcamīmadhyamataḥpradiṣṭāprāṇādimudrā
nijamaṃtrayuktā adhomukhaṃvāmahastamūrdhvāsyaṃdakṣahastakam kṣiptāṃgulībhiragulī
bhiraṃgulībhiḥ saṃgrathyaparivartayet eṣāsaṃhāramudrāsyādvisarjanavidhaumatā vakṣmaiha
mupacārāṇāṃmudrāḥtaṃtreṣudeśitāḥ prasārayedubhauhastauvidveṣoviniyojitau agu
lyovistṛtāḥkāryāmadhyeṃguṣṭautuvinyaset devasyāmanuvinyāsepadmamudrāṃpradarśayet
īṣannamrāṅgulirdakṣasaṃyojyāṃguṣṭakaṃvaram svāgatasvastikāmudrāmadhyāmūlāgatāṃ
guliḥ upacāresvāgatetuprayoktavyāvipaścitā svastimudrādvihastotumudrātvarghasya
kīrtitā taucaprasāritauhastaupādyamudrāprakīrtitā deśinīmūlagāṃguṣṭādakṣiṇā
dhaḥkanīyasīm prasāryāmadhyamāstisromudrācāmeprakīrtitā saṃyuktānāmikāṃ
guṣṭautisronyāḥsuprasāritāḥ madhuparketusāmudrāsaṃkalpakalaśaṃkarekṛtvāmu-
ṣṭiṃtathāsnānemadhyamāṃguṣṭakaumatā anyāḥprasāritāstisromudrāvasrasyakīrti
tāḥ kaniṣṭāṃguṣṭakaulāgnautisropyanyāḥprasāritāḥ yajñopavītamudreyaṃ
kathitāmaṃtrapāragaiḥ madhuparkāsamutthānāmudrālaṃkaraṇīmatā

pṛ0 78ba) muktānināmikāmuṣṭirgaṃdhamudretikīrtitā uktitādhaumukhīmadhyāvaddhāṃguṣṭāyadī
ritā puṣpamudrātathākhyātāpuṣpadānavivardhinī aṃguṣṭatarjanīlagnātisraḥsaṃkuci
tāḥparāḥ mudrādhūpapradānesyāddevānāṃtuṣṭikāriṇī uttānāpoṣpikīmudrādevamudreti
gīyate paṃcāṃgulyagrasaṃyuktāproktitordhvamukhīyadi tridhānibaddhāmudreyaṃnaivedyasyapra
kīrtitā madhyamānāmikāṃguṣṭāḥsaṃlagnāgrādhomukhāḥ anyāḥprasāritāṃgulyogo
mukhīsāprakīrtitā tyaktapradeśinīmuṣṭiḥsūcīmudretikīrtitā rakṣāmudretisaivoktā
samaṃtādbhramaṇaṃyadi dvaukaraupṛṣṭasaṃlagnaubhrāmayedgrathitāṃgulīḥ koṭiketisamākhyā
tāpraṇāmetāpradarśayet deśinyaṃguṣṭayormadhyedatvāṃgulicatuṣṭayam vidhāyasaṃpuṭī
kṛtvālagnāṃguṣṭosamutsṛtau kuṃbhamudredṛśīśasyahṛllekhākacchapīmatā prasāryada-
kṣiṇaṃhastaṃkaniṣṭādyagrimāṃgulī kramādākuṃcayedorghaṃmudrāsaṃhāriṇīmatā mithaḥ
pṛṣṭārpitauhastāvanyonyagrathitāṃgulī kṛtvāvaddhāparāvṛtyanatvāsāsyātkramāpaṇī
itiśrīāgamakalpalatāyāmaṣṭaḥmeḥpaṭalaḥ oṃnamaḥśivāya oṃpuraścaryāṃpravakṣyāmi
maṃtriṇāṃsiddhidāyinīm yasyāvijñānamātreṇasarvasiddhīśvarobhavet puraścaraṇasaṃpa-
nnomaṃtrohiphaladāyakaḥ kiṃhomaiḥkiṃjapaścaivakiṃmaṃtranyāsavistaraiḥ rahasyānācamaṃtrā

pṛ0 79a) ṇāṃyadinasyātpurastriyā purastriyāmaṃtrāṇāṃpradhānaṃjīvamucyatejīvahīnoyathādehīsa
rvakarmavivarjitaḥ puraścāraṇahīnohitathāmaṃtraḥprakīrtitaḥ tasmādādaupuraścaryāṃkṛtvā
sādhakasattamaḥ prayogaṃtutataḥkuryātsarvaṃsādhakadurlabham labdhātusadgurorvidyāṃpura
ścaryāsamācarettathācatārārahasyavṛttau maṃtraṃnītvāguroḥpārśvegurubhaktiparāyaṇaḥ
maṃtraśrotrāsyahṛnnetraprāṇānvijñāyatattvataḥ yatnāccakīlakaṃjñātvākuryānmaṃtrapuraskri
yām maṃtrāṇāṃpraṇavaḥśrotraṃmukhaṃrephaḥprakīrttitam svarāścacakṣuṣījñeyāmaṃtravidbhiranaṃ
taram atiriktāścayevarṇāhṛdayaṃparikīrtitam tathāca japahomatarpaṇābhiṣeka
vrāhmaṇabhojanam paṃcāṅgopāsanaṃlokepuraścaraṇamiṣyate yatrajapahomādausaṃkhyā
noṣkātatrāṣṭasahasrasaṃkhyāt taduktaṃvārāhītaṃtreyeṣāṃjapecahomevasaṃkhyānoktāmanī
ṣibhiḥteṣāmaṣṭasahasrāṇisaṃkhyāsyājjapahomayoḥ sahasramaṣṭaujuhuyāllakṣajā
peprakīrttayedityuttādalepāṭhaḥyasmiṃścanigamenaivamaṃtresaṃkhyāvidhīyate tatrasarvatra
maṃtrāṇāṃsaṃkhyānṛddhiḥyugakramāt kalpoktaivakṛtesaṃkhyātretāyāṃdviguṇaṃbhavet
dvāparetriguṇāsaṃkhyākalausaṃkhyācaturguṇā taduktaṃpūrṇāparddhatau saṃkhyānuktauśataṃ
sāṣṭaṃsahasraṃvādaśāpiveti japasthānamāha taduktaṃyoginīhṛdaye puṇyakṣetraṃna-

pṛ0 79ba) dītīraṃguhāparvatamastakaṃ tīrthapradeśaḥsiṃdhūnāṃsaṃgamaḥpāvanaṃvanam upānāni
viviktānibilamūlaṃtadaṃmireḥtulasīkānanaṃgoṣṭaṃvṛṣaśūnyaḥśivālayaḥa
śvatthāmalakīmūlaṃgośālājalamadhyataḥ devatāyatanaṃkūlaṃsamudrasyanijaṃ
gṛham gurūṇāṃsannidhānaṃcacittaikāgrasthalaṃtathā pretabhūmyādikaṃcaivatattatka
lpapradarśitam dīpasthānaṃsamāśrityakṛtaṃkarmaśubhāvaham caturaśrāṃbhuvaṃkṛtvā
koṣṭānāṃnavakaṃlikhet pūrvādikoṣṭevilikhetsaptavargānanukramāt lakṣamī
śesurānyugmakramāccaivalikhettataḥ dikṣupūrvāditoyatrakṣettrākhyāyakṣaraṃsthitam
mukhaṃtasyatujānīyāddhastāvubhayataḥsthitau koṣṭekukṣeubhepādaudveśiṣṭaṃpucchamī
ritam krameṇānenavibhajenmadhyasthamapisādhakaḥ mukhastholabhatesiddhikara-
sthaḥsvalpajīvanaḥ udāsīnaḥkukṣisaṃsthaḥpādasthoduḥkhamāpnuyāt pucchasthaḥ
pīdyatemaṃtrīvaṃdhanoccāṭanādibhiḥkūrmacakramidaṃproktaṃmaṃtrāṇāṃsiddhisādhanam
aṭṭāṭṭakeśaktipīṭhekṣattraṃtīrtheṣuvāpunaḥaraṇyeparvatedeśekūrmacakraṃnaciṃtayet a
jñātanāmavāstaucatatranāmaprakalpayet saptavargeti kacaṭatapāḥpaṃcavargāḥyalara
vaśeṣasahetidvovargoḥevaṃsaptavargābhavaṃti lakṣamitisvarūpam īśeaiśānyāṃdiśi

pṛ0 80a) likhedityarthaḥ madhyemadhyakoṣṭamapinarā dhākṛtvāṣṭasukoṣṭeṣuakārādidvaudvau
svarolikhet madhyemūlamaṃtraṃlikhet athavānyaprakāreṇapuraścaraṇamiṣyate taduktaṃ
vīrataṃtre aṣṭamyāṃcacaturdaśyāṃpakṣayorubhayorubhayorapi kṛṣṇapakṣeviśeṣeṇasā
dhayedvīrasādhanam tatsārdhaprahareyāmegatecasurasuṃdadari śavaṃvāthacitāṃvāpinī
tvāgatvāyathāsukham sādhayetsvahitaṃmaṃtrīmaṃtradhyānaparāyaṇaḥ bhayaṃcaivanakartavyaṃ
hāsyaṃtatravivarjayet caturdiśaṃnanirīkṣenmaṃtrametatsamavyaset pūjādravyaṃpravakṣyā
minānātaṃtrānusārataḥ sāmiṣānnaṃguḍachāgaṃmadhūpāyamapiṣṭakaṃ nānāpuṣpaṃcanai
vedyaṃsvasvakalpoktasādhitam cittāsthānaṃsamānīyabaṃdhubhiḥśastrapāṇibhiḥsamā
naśīlasaṃpannaiḥsādhakonirbhayaḥśuciḥtathāca yoginīhṛdayebalyarthaṃsāmiṣā
nnaṃcaguḍachāgaṃtathāmadhu piṣṭakaṃparamānnaṃcapayomūlaṃphalaṃtathā saptarātriṃba-
liṃdatvācatuṣpātraṃcaturdiśi pātratrayaṃsacasavyesthāpayenmanunāsadāsvaguruṃdhrātṛvargaṃvā
vrāhmaṇānvāpisuvratān svahṛdānapirakṣārthaṃkiyaḍūreniveśayet citāyālakṣaṇaṃvakṣyesa
rvasiddhipradāyakam taduktaṃyāmale asaṃskṛtācitāgrāhyānatusaṃskārasaṃskṛtetisādhakaṃtu
pravakṣyāmipūrvoktaṃbhairavenatu mahāsāhasikaścaivamahābalaparākramaḥdayālusvacchahṛdayaḥsarvaprāṇihiterataḥ

pṛ0 80ba) evaṃvidhaguṇopetaḥkuryāccacitisādhanam saṃkalpaṃprathamaṃkuryātsvastivācanapū
rvakam sāmānyārghaṃvidhāyaivatataḥpūjāṃmamārabhet vastrālaṃkārabhūṣādyaibhūṣitaḥ
pūrvadiṅmukhaḥsaṃkalpoyathā oṃadyetyāmukagotraḥśrīamukadevaśarmāṣmaśā
nasādhanamahaṃkariṣye itisaṃkalpa astrāṃtamūlamaṃtreṇayāgabhūmiṃcaśodhayet
mūlamaṃtreṇahaṃkārāṃtamūlamaṃtreṇadhyātvāguroḥpādapadmaṃgaṇeśaṃvaṭukaṃtathāyogi-
nīṃmātṛkāṃcaivakṣettrapālaṃtathaivaca saṃpūjyaivagṛhaṃgacchedvāmapādapuraḥsaram astramaṃtra
jñorakṣāmātmanikārayet vakṣyamāṇenamaṃtreṇapuṣpāṃjalitrayaṃkṣipet maṃtroyathā uktaṃ
vīrataṃtreyecātrasaṃsthitādevarākṣasāścabhayānakāḥpiśācāḥsiddhayopakṣāgaṃdharvāpsa
rasāṃgaṇāḥyoginyomātarobhūtāḥsarvāścakhecarastriyaḥ siddhidāstābhavaṃtyatrata
tathācamamarakṣakāḥ praṇamyamanunānenapuṣpāṃjalitrayaṃkṣipet śmaśānādhi-
patyaṃpaścādbhairavaṃkālabhairavam mahākālaṃyajedyatnātpūrvādidikcatuṣṭaye pādyādi
bhiścasaṃpūjyabaliṃpaścānnivedayet balidānaprakāramāhayathāpūrveśmaśānādhipatiṃ
paṃcopacāraiḥ saṃpūjyaanenabaliṃdadyāt yathā oṃhūṃśmaśānādhipimaṃsāmiṣānnaṃhūṃ
mahābaliṃgṛhnagṛhṇāyayagṛhṇāpayavighnanivāraṇaṃkurusiddhiṃmamaprayacchasvāhā

pṛ0 81a) tatodakṣiṇasyāopūrvavadbhairavaṃsaṃpūjya oṃhūṃbhairavabhayānakaśmaśānādhipimaṃsāmi-
ṣānnaṃhūṃmahābaliṃgṛhṇagṛhṇāyayagṛhṇāyayavighnanivāraṇaṃkurusiddhiṃmamapraya
cchasvāhā tataḥpaścimāyāṃrūrvavatyādyādibhiḥkālabhairavaṃsaṃpūjya oṃhūṃkālabhai
ravaśmaśānādhipimaṃbalimityādinābaliṃdadyāt tatuttarepūrvavatpādyadibhirmahā
kālaṃsaṃpūjya oṃhūṃmahākālaśmaśānādhipimaṃbaliṃityādibaliṃdadyāt vi
tāmadhyetatodadyādvaliṃtrayamanuttamam kālarātrimahākālikālikecoraniḥ-
svane gṛhāṇemaṃbaliṃmātardehisādhyamanuttamam kālikāyaibaliṃdatvābhūta
nāthāyadāpayet huśabdāṃtebhūtanāthāṃteśmaśānādhipityapiprāṇavādye-
namanunādāpayedvalimuttamam oṃhuṃbhūtanāthaśmaśānādhipitimaṃtraḥ huṃśa-
bdāṃtesarvagaṇanāthāṃtecādhipāpaśmaśānamastakaṃdatvāpūrvavaccasamuddharet
tārāyenabaliṃdattvāpaṃcagavyenasuṃdari adbhiḥsaṃprokṣaṇaṃkṛtvāpītavastreli-
khennamaḥ bhūrjevāvaṭapattrevātatrapīṭhamanuṃtataḥ pīṭhamāstīryatasminvaibaddha
vīrāsanaṃtataḥ virārcanenadeveśirakṣādikṣuprakalpayet asyārthaḥpīta
vastrādautattatkalpoktapīṭhamaṃtraṃlikhitvātaduparivyājacarmādyāmanaṃmāstī-

pṛ0 81ba) ryataduparidhīrāsanakrameṇopaviśyavirāchanamaṃtreṇacaturdikṣurakṣāṃkuryāt vīrābana
maṃtrastu hūṃhūṃhrīṃhrīṃkālikeghoradaṃṣṭraṃpracaṃḍenāyikedārayanahanaasminmahāvighnaṃ
chedayachedayasvāhā hūṃphaṭ anenamaṃtritaṃloṣṭaṃdaśadikṣuvinikṣipet yadisādhako
bhayavihvalobhavatitadāsarvaiḥsuhṛdvargaiḥparirakṣaṇīyaḥtatastu tattatkalpoktabhūta
taśuddhyādinyāsajālaṃsamāpyeṣṭadevatāṃsaṃpūjya saṃkalpaṃkṛtvāiṣṭadevatāṃdhyāyanmaṃtraṃ
japet saṃkalpastu oṃadyetyādi amukagotraḥ śrīamukadevaśarmāmukamaṃtrasyasi
ddhikāmaḥ amukamaṃtrasye yatsaṃkhyajapamahaṃkariṣyeitisaṃkalpejapet japaniyama
stuekākṣarasyamaṃtrasyadiksahasraṃjapaṃcaret dvyakṣareayutārdhaṃcatryakṣareṣṭasahasrakam
ataḥparaṃtumaṃtrāṇāṃgajāṣṭakasahasrakam gajoṣṭasaṃjñakaḥaṣṭottarasahasramityarthaḥ
yadyasahyabhayaṃkarṇenetrevastreṇabaddhayeta tatordhapatraparyaṃtaṃyadikiṃcinnadṛśyate ja
yadurgākhyamanunāsarṣapāndikṣunibhiyet oṃdurgedurgerakṣaṇisvāhā oṃtilosisau
madaivatyogomavastṛptikārakaḥ pitrūṇāṃsukhadātātvaṃmartyānomamarakṣakaḥ itimaṃtraṃsa
muccāryatilāndikṣuvinikṣipet īśānādicaturdikṣvitiśeṣaḥ tataḥsaptapadaṃgatvā
punastatraivasaṃviśet punaḥsveṣṭadevatāṃdhyātvāsaṃpūjyapunaḥjapet yadyāgatyavaraṃgṛhṇa

pṛ0 82a) itivākyamudīrayettadātāṃkārayetsatyaṃmaṃtrījapaparāyaṇaḥ tataḥsatyaṃkārayitvāva
rayedvaramuttamam japādaubalimāhṛtyajapāṃtecabaliṃharet tathācoktaṃyoginīhṛda
ye japāṃtecabaliṃdadyāddevatāyaiyathānidhi māhiṣaṃcchāgalaṃvāpigṛhītvāvarameva
ca japāṃtejapamāśvevāvaliṃdehītibhāṣate piṣṭakenabaliṃdadyānmāhiṣaṃcchāgame
vavābaliṃcayavapiṣṭakanirmitaṃdhānyodbhavaṃvābaliṃdadyāt punaryadivaraṃdehikuṃja
raṃdehiyācate dināṃtarepradāsyāmipratijñāṃśrāvayettataḥ itipratijñāṃsaṃgṛhyagṛhaṃga-
cchedyathāsukham aparehnitatodadyātpiṣṭenanarakuṃjarān tathācoktaṃkālikāpurā
ṇe yavakṣodamayaṃvāpiśālikṣodamayecavā caṃdrahāsenavidhivattattanmaṃtreṇaghātaye
t candrahāsenakhaḍgena samāpyasādhanaṃdevidakṣiṇāṃvibhavāvayiguruveguruputrāyatatpa
tnyaivānivedayet parehninityakriyāṃkṛtvāpaṃcagavyaṃpītvāpiṣṭakanirmitavaliṃdadyādanena
yeṣāṃjamānohategṛhṇāṃtuimaṃbaliṃ itivaliṃdatvāpaṃcaviṃśatibhojavrāhmaṇānbhojaye
t tathācayoginītaṃtre gathā parehninityamācāryapaṃcagavyaṃpivettataḥvrāhmaṇānbho
jayettatrapaṃcaviṃśatisaṃkhyakān saptapaṃcavihīnānvākrameṇaivadaśāvadhi bhuktvācabāṃ
dhavaiḥsārdhaṃnivaseduttamesthaleyadinasyādviprabhojyaṃtadānirdhanatāṃvrajettenacetridhaṃnatvaṃsyāttadādevīprakupyati

pṛ0 82ba) trirātraṃvātuṣaḍrātraṃnavarātraṃtugopayet strīśayyāṃyadigacchettutadāvyādhivinirdi
śet gītaṃśrutvātuvadhironiścakṣuḥnṛtyadarśanāt yadivaktidinevājyaṃtadāsyamū
katābhavat tripaṃcadivasaṃyāvaddehedevasyasaṃsthitiḥnasvīkuryādgaṃdhapuṣpaṃvahiryā-
tiyadātadā tadāvastraṃparityajyadhautavastraṃcadhārayet tathācādamakalpakrame
athavakṣyāmisaṃkṣepādvīrasādhanamuttamam kṛtenadivasaikenasiddhiṃviṃdatimānavaḥ
yaṣṭiprabhṛtyastrabhinnaṃśūlaviddhaṃpayomṛtam śavamānīyakartavyaṃnagrāhyaṃsvecchayāmṛ
tam rātrauprathamayāmyarghetatragacchetsamāhitāḥpaṃcopacārasāmagrīsasurāṃtatrasaṃhare
t guḍārdrakarasenaivasurātravrāhmaṇasyaca gauḍīneyākṣattriyenāmādhvīvaiśyonatatratu
kadalīmadhusaṃmiśraśaṇatvaksarasaiḥsurā śūdreṇātrapradātavyādātavyaṃnaivasaṃspṛśet
māṣabhaktaṃcabalyarthaṃdhūpadīpādikaṃtathā tilāḥkuśāḥsarṣapāścasthāpanīyāḥpraya
tnataḥ oṃādhāraśaktyainamaḥityuccāryāsanesamupaveśayet bhūtaśuddhiṃtataḥprāṇaṃsaṃ
yamyamātṛkāṃnyaset aghorasyamunicchaṃdodevatāṃgānivinyaset śikhāṃtenaivabaddhā
gniprākāraṃbaṃdhanaṃdiśaḥ sudarśanenavārakṣamumābhyāṃvāprakalpayet jayadurgākhyamā
treṇasarṣapāndikṣuvikṣipet oṃtilosisomadaivastṛptikārakaḥ pitṛṇāṃsvargadātā

pṛ0 83a) tvaṃmartyānāṃmamarakṣakaḥ bhūtapretapiśācānāṃvighneṣuśāṃtikārakaḥ itikṣiptvātilānā
tmacaturdikṣuśivāditaḥ kālabhairavanāmānaṃmahābhairavasajñakam vaṭubhairavabhairavomāṣa
bhaktibaliṃdiśet tataḥśavaṃkṣālayitvāsnāpayeccaprayatnataḥ yadiraktāktakastviṣṭhe
dbhairavāścabhayaṃbhavet ailālavaṃgakarpūrajātīkhadirasāndrakaiḥtāṃvūlatanmukhekṣiptvāśa
vaṃkuryādadhomukham sthāpayitvācatatpṛṣṭaṃcaṃdanenavilepayet vāhumūlātukayuṃ
taṃcaturathaṃvibhāvyaca madhyepadmaṃsamālikhyadalāṣṭakasaṃmanvitam tataścaiṇeyama
jinaṃkaṃbalāṃtaritaṃnyaset pūjādravyaṃsannidhaucadūrecottarasādhakam saṃsthāpyāsa
namabhyarcyatatrāśvārohavadviśet kuśānpādataledatvāśavakeśānpramārjyaca dṛḍhaṃni
baddhyajuṭikāṃtattaddevasvarūpiṇīm tasyāṃdevaṃsusaṃpūjyapaṭhedutthāyasaṃmukhe oṃvaśe
bhavadeveśasvakāṃmameṣṭasiddhiṃdehivīrasiddhivatāṃvarabaddhābhavadeveśiamukamame
ṣṭasiddhiṃdehivīrasiddhikṛtāṃvare paṭṭasūttrasyarajjāthacaraṇaubadhayedṛḍham oṃbhī
mabhīrubhayābhāvabhāvyalocanabhāvuka trāhimāṃdevadeśadevānāmadhipādhipa itipādata
letasyatrikoṇaṃcakramullikhet tenotvātvaṃnaśaknotiśivaścaniścalobhavet upaviśya
punastyasyavāhūniḥsāryapārśayoḥhastayoḥkuśamāstīryapādautatranidhāpayet auṣṭhausaṃpuṭakokṛtvāsthiraci

pṛ0 83ba) ttāsthiredriyā sadādevaṃhṛdidhyātvāmaunījapamathābhavet calāsatādbhayaṃnāstibhayejā
tevadettataḥyatprārthayasibalitvenadātavyāṃkuṃjarādikam dināṃtarettadāsyāmisvanā
makathayasvame ityuktāsaṃskṛtoktyācanirbhayastupunajapet punaścenmadhuraṃvaktivakta
vyaṃniyamenavai tataḥsatyaṃkārayitvāvaraṃcaprārthayettataḥyadisatyaṃnakarotivaraṃvāna
prayacchati tadāpunarjapenmaṃtremekāgrayatamānasaḥsatyekṛtevalaṃlavdhāsaṃtyajettujapā
dikam phalajātamitijñātvājuṭikāṃmocayettataḥ śavaṃprakṣyālyasaṃsnāpyabaṃdhanaṃ
mocayatpade pādacakraṃmārjayitvāpūjādravyaṃjalekṣipet śavaṃjalethagartevānikṣi-
pyasnānamācaret tatastusvagṛhaṃgatvābalidadyāddināṃtare agrimarātrauyeṣāṃdevā
nāṃjayamānohaṃtegahṇaṃtumayādattamimaṃbaliṃ itiyairyācitānaścanarakuṃjakasū-
karān datvāmiṣṭamayānevakartavyaṃsamupoṣaṇam parehninityamācāryapaṃcagavyaṃ
pivettataḥ vrāhmaṇānbhojayettatrapaṃcaviṃśatisaṃkhyakān paṃcapaṃcavihinatvākra
meṇaivaṃdaśāvadhi tataḥsnātvācabhuṃktvācanivaseduttamesthale yadinasyādviprabhojyaṃ
tadānirdhanaṃtāvrajet tenacennirdhanaṃtvaṃsyāttadādevaḥprakupyati trirātraṃvāthaṣaḍrītraṃ
navarātraṃtugopayet strīśayyāṃyadigacchedvaitadāvyādhiṃvinirdeśet gītaṃśrutvātha

pṛ0 84a) badhirotiścakṣurnṛtyadarśanāt yadivaktidīnavākyaṃtadāsyamūkatābhavet paṃcadaśadi
naṃyāvaddehedevasyasaṃsthitiḥ nasvīkuryādgaṃdhapuṣpaṃbahiryātiyadāyadā tadāvastraṃparitya
jyadhotavastraṃcaṃdhārayet devagovrāhmaṇāṃdīścapratyahaṃspṛśecchuciḥ prātarnityakriyāṃ
tetuvilāpatrodakaṃpivet tataḥsnāyāttugaṃgāyāṃprāpteṣoḍaśavāsaresvāhāṃtaṃmūla
muccāryatarpaṇāṃtenamaḥpādam anenavidhinādevaṃtarpayeddaiśikottamaḥ tathācamuṃḍa
mālāyām śrīdevyuvāca rahasyātirahasyaṃmepuraścaryāvidhiṃprabho vadasvayadanuṣṭānātsa
rvakāmābhavaṃtihi śrīīśvaruvāca gṛhītvāsadgurordīkṣāṃśubhekāledivāniśi ārā
movaiṣṇavaḥproktomadhyamaśraivadīkṣitaḥ anayādīkṣitoyovaisevaparamoguruḥ śaktikṣe
ttreṣugaṃgāyonadyāṃparvatamastake pavitrecasthaledeviyajedvidyāṃprasādhayan śaktikṣe
ttrekāmarūpādau tatrasthitvājapellakṣaṃsākṣāddevīsvarūpakaḥ tatobhavatividyegatrailo
kyavaśakāriṇī caturdaśasahasrāṇisevitehipadāṃvuje tatobhavatideveśitavapū
jārataḥpumān kāyenamanasāvācāsvavarṇakaśatādibhiḥ saṃtoṣyaparayābhaktyāguruṃ
dīkṣāṃsamāśrayet pūrvoktasthānamāśrityajapapūjāṃsamāśrayet prātaḥkālaṃsamā-
rabhyajapenmadhyadināvadhi prathamehaniyajjaptaṃtajjaptavyaṃdinedine (nyūnādhikaṃ

pṛ0 84ba) nyūnādhikaṃnajaptavyasamāpteḥsadājapet gateprathamayāmetutṛtīyapraharāvadhi
niśāyāṃcaprajaptavyaṃrātriśeṣejapennaca haviṣyaṃbhakṣayedrātraunakadāciddinenaca
laghvāhāraṃprakuvītayuvatīpūjanerataḥ bhaikṣyaṃhaviṣaṃśākādivihitāniphalaṃpa
yaḥ mūlaṃsakturyavotpannobhakṣyāṇyetānimaṃtriṇām tathācavṛhanmatsyasūkteśā
kaṃmūlaṃbhaikṣyaṃhariṣyaṃsuktavothavā athavākṣobhyānnaṃsyātpuraścaraṇavṛttaye niṣiddhamā
ha madhumāṃsaṃtathākṣāralavaṇaṃtelamevaca snigdhaṃparyuṣitaṃcaivanisnehaṃkīṭadūṣita
m kāṃcikaṃgṛṃjanaṃbilaṃkalaṃjaṃlasu naṃtathā  musūraṃkodravaṃmāṣaṃmaṃḍūkaṃcaṇakā
dikam tāṃbūlaṃkāṃsyapātraṃcadivābhojanamevaca evamādīnicānyānijapakāle
vivarjayet anyathābhojanāṃteṣāṃsiddhiṃnāpnotisādhakaḥ gṛṃjanaṃmūlikākṛttira
ktavarṇaṃgājaritiprasiddhiḥ maṃḍūkaṃmaṃḍūvāitiyasyaprasiddhiḥkaudravaṃkoḍitiyasyapra
siddhiḥ svanārīmanyanārīṃvāpūjayetsarvasu nādhamaisaṃgatiḥkāryāsarvaprāṇihiterataḥ
yasyāyāvāṃjapaḥproktastaddaśośamanukramāt tattaddravyairjapasyāṃtehomaṃkuryāddinedi
ne homasyatudaśāṃśevatarpaṇaṃproktamevaca tarpaṇaṃtaddaśāśenavipreṃdrānyuvatīku-
lakanyakāḥsaṃbhojayetprītiyutaiḥdravyairnānāvidhaiḥśubhaiḥtarpaṇaprakāramāha haṃsa

pṛ0 85a) pārāyaṇetarpaṇaṃtuprakurvītapayasāpāyasenavā ājyenamadhunāvāpisurayāmaṃtrasādha
kaḥvrāhmaṇaiḥkṣīttrayaivaiśyaiḥśūdrairasyāyathākramāt vināmāṃsenamatsenamatsyenapuṃśvalī
sevanaṃvinā namaṃtrasiddhirbhavatitasmādyataparobhavet tathā mādanaṃsakalaṃvastuvarjaye
tkanakādikam kanakaṃpātakītasmāddharmovedavidāṃvaraḥkālikāpurāṇe vrāhmaṇa
stusurāṃdatvāvrāhmaṇyādevahīyate sugātrarudhiraṃdattvāātmavadhyamavāpnuyāt evaṃcā
sarvasarvatracaramajātiparaṃparam caramajātiparaṃśūdrajātiparamityarthaḥ anyeṣāṃpāta
kahetutvāt taduktaṃbhairavataṃtre kṣīreṇavrāhmaṇaistarpādvatenanṛpavaṃśajaḥ mākṣikaivaiśya
vaṃśaiścāsavaiḥśūdrajātibhiḥhomādiśaktaudeveśikuryāttadviguṇaṃjapam yadipūjā
dyaśaktaḥsyāddravyābhāvenasuṃdarikevalaṃjapamātreṇapuraścaryāvidhīyate divyothayadi
vāvīrobhuvisyātsādhakottamaḥsvecchacāraparobhūtvāekāṃtesarvadājapet divyādibhāvastu
bhāvacūḍāmaṇāvanusaṃdheyaḥmatsyamāṃsādyananeśaktaḥkuryātpuraskriyām ekarātrauśmaśāne
vāśavevāproḍhabālayoḥmayoktaṃbhairavekalpevidhānaṃvaravarṇini hastamātranikhātevā
muṃḍevāvijanevane virāṇāṃkathitaṃdevimādhanaṃtubhuviduṣkaraṃ kumārīpūjanādevapuraśca-
ryāvidhiḥsmṛtaḥtathācoktaṃgaṃdharvataṃtrekumārikādvivarṣācatrimūrtinīcatuvarṣātubhavetkālīsaptavarṣātucaṃ

pṛ0 85ba) ḍikā aṣṭavarṣāśāṃbhavītudurgātunavabhiḥsmṛtvādaśavarṣāsubhadretināmabhiḥpari
kīrttitā oṃmaṃtrākṣaramayīṃlakṣmīṃmātṛṇāṃrūpadhāriṇīm navadurgātmikāṃsākṣā
tkanyāmāvāhayāmyaham nānājātibhavātkanyārūpayauvanasaṃyutāḥ anyatuprauḍhabā
lāvāpūjanīyāyathāvidhiḥ dravyaiḥpriyakaraiḥbhakṣyabhojyādibhiḥśubhaiḥpūjayetparabhāve
nanānārūpamanoharāḥ bhaginīkanyakāvāpidauhitrīvākuṭuṃbinīmātṛvarjyaṃsadā
pūjyānānājātisamudbhavāḥ athavānyaprakāreṇapuraścaraṇamiṣyate sūryodayaṃsamā
rabhyayāvatsūryodayaṃbhavet tāvajjaptemaheśānipuraścaryāvidhīyate kṛṣṇāṣṭamīsa-
mārabhyayāvatkṛṣṇāṣṭamībhavet sahasrasaṃkhyataptenapuraścaraṇamiṣyate śuklāṃcatu
rdaśauprāpyanavamyaṃtaṃmahotsave aṣṭamīnavamīrātraupūjāṃkuryādviśeṣataḥ daśamyāṃ
pāraṇaṃkuryānmatsyamāsāṃdibhiḥpriye ṣaṭsahasraṃjapennityaṃbhaktibhāvaparāyaṇaḥ
caturdaśīṃsamārabhyayāvadanyācaturdaśī tāvajjaptemaheśānipuraścaraṇamiṣyate
kevalaṃjapamātreṇamaṃtrāḥsiddhābhavaṃtihi vināhomādidāneneviśeṣātpīṭhapūjane
yonipīṭhaṃmahāpīṭhaṃkāmarūpaṃtathāparam tayorekataraṃpūjyaṃrudradehavāparaḥ athavānya
prakāreṇapuraścaraṇamiṣyate śaratkālecaturthyādinavamyaṃtaṃviśeṣataḥbhaktitaḥpūjayitvā

pṛ0 86a) catāvadrātrausahasrakam japedekākīvijanekevalaṃtimirālaye aṣṭamyādinavamyaṃta
mupavāsaparobhavet aṣṭamyāṃsiddhavelāyāmaṣṭottaralatāyutam vipramaṃtrīcavidhiva
ntāḥsamabhyarcyayatnataḥpūrvoktakanyāmāsādyajapapūjādikaṃcaret kevalaṃkāmadevosau
japādaṣṭauttarācchatātaṣṭamyāṃcacaturdaśyāṃnavamyāṃcaviśeṣataḥ rātriyogenadeveśi
gatvācapitṛkānane digaṃbaromuktakeśobhūtvācasurasuṃdari prajayedayutaṃmaṃtrīdeva
tāvatatparaḥ maṃtrasiddhirbhavettasyadevaputrastubhūtale athakaprajapedvidyāṃśūnyāgāreca-
tuṣpathe rājadvāreśmaśānevāsabhavetsādhakottamaḥ bhaumāvāsyāṃlikhitvācayojaye-
tsādhakottamaḥ maṃtrasiddhirbhavettasyacaṃḍikāṃtatrapūjanāt kujevāśanivārevānaramuṃḍaṃ
samāhṛtam paṃcagavyenamilitaṃcaṃdanādyairviśeṣataḥ nikṣipyabhūmauhastārdhamānato
nirjanevane ekākīprajapenmaṃtrīṃsabhavetkalpapādapaḥ ekarātraujapenmaṃtramekākī
nirjanevaṃne sabhavetsādhakaśreṣṭomahāsiddhīśvarobhavetcitāyāṃcajapanmaṃtraṃmatrasiddhi
nasaṃśayaḥsabhavetsādhakaśreṣṭodevīputronasaṃśayaḥ itibhairavānaṃdasaṃhitāyām sanatku
mārasaṃhitāyāṃ athavānyaprakāreṇapuraścaraṇamiṣyate caṃdrasūryagrahecaivagrāsāvadhivimu-
ktitaḥyāvatsaṃkhyamanuṃjaptvātāvadvomādikaṃcaret śrāddhadānānurodhenayadijāpyaṃtyajennaraḥ

pṛ0 86ba) sabhaveddevatādrohīpitṛnsaptanayatyadhaḥ itisanatkumārasaṃhitā vacanenaprametapi
tṛkasyāpigrahaṇejapasyāvaśyaketvesmṛtyuktabahuvacanavyākepāpatteḥtathāhisa
rvasvenāpikartavyaṃśrāddhaṃvairāhudarśaneākurvāṇastutacchrāddhaṃpaṃkegaurivasīdati
tathāca viruddhadharmasamavāyebhūyamāsyātsadharmakatvamitijaiminisūtrāt evaṃ ya
yapyadaṃtakaḥpūṣāyaiṣṭamantimudāruṇam agnīṃdreśvarasāmānyāttuṃḍalotrevidhīyate
itichaṃdogapariśiṣṭīyāt smṛtebalavatvenasanatkumārīyasyanirviṣayāpattiriti
cenmaivamāravdhapaṃcamahāpuraścaraṇamadhyepūrvānupatitasūryaṃgrahaṇaviṣayatvenaivopa
patte evaṃcaniṃdyārthavādegrahaṇaśrāddhasyaavaśyakatvepratinidhidvārātaditiathabhū-
tabhairaveyaduktaṃsārasarvasvesarvataṃtreṣugopitam vīrasiddhyervidhānaṃtudevadevenaśaṃbhunā
yasyavijñānamātreṇamaṃdabhāgyopisiddhyati ahorātreṇakālenahelayāsādhakottamaḥ 
maṃtraṃnītvāguroḥpārśvegurubhaktipurassaraḥ maṃtraśrottrāsyahṛnnetraprāṇānvijñāyayatnataḥ
yatnāścakaulakaṃjñātvānkuryānmaṃtrapuraskriyām puraścaraṇasaṃpannovīrasiddhiṃsamācaret
putradāradhanasnehalobhamohavivarjitaḥ maṃtraṃvāsādhayiṣyāmidehaṃvāpātayāmyahaṃ
pratijñāṃmīdṛśīṃkṛtvābalidravyaṃsamāharet yasyamaṃtreyaduktatadgṛhyāśeṣavidhānataḥstrī

pṛ0 87a) varjyaṃpatitaṃvarjyaṃkuṣṭarogādiniṃditam nadurbhikṣamṛtaṃvṛddhaṃnaparyuṣitamevavāstrīvarjyaṃ
patitaṃkuṣṭarogādininditam nadurbhikṣamṛtaṃvṛddhaṃnaparyuṣitamecā strījanaṃcedṛśerū
pavarjitaṃparivarjayet saṃsthāpyakuśaśayyayāmuttānaṃdivyarūpiṇam kṛtanityatriyo
dikṣuvidikṣupicakīlayet yaṃtraṃlikhitvāvīrasyalalāṭebhyarcyadevatām balidāne
nasaṃtoṣyaśavasyahṛdisaṃsthitaḥ balimāhamuṃḍamālāyām kevalaṃbalidānenatuṣṭābha
vatisuṃdarī kathitaṃpūrvamasmabhyaṃprakāśaṃkuruśaṃkara śrīśaṃkaruvāca atyaṃtaguhyaṃdeveśi
vidhānaṃbalipūjitam kathayāmivarārohesusthirābhavasāṃpratam dadhikṣīraṃguḍaṃcā
nnepāyasaṃśarkarānvitam pāyasaṃkṣaudramātraṃvānārikelaṃsamodakam śaśakaṃmeṣakhaṃ
ḍaṃcasārdrakaṃsahaśarkaram raṃbhāphalaṃlaḍukaṃcarjitānnaṃtupīṭhakam śālamātsyaṃca
pāṭhīnaṃśakulaṃcavarsatathā madguruṃphaliṣaṃdadyānmāṃsaṃmeṣasyasaṃtatam pakṣimāṃsaṃ
varāroheḍiṃbaṃnānāsamudbhavam kṛṣṇabhāgaṃmeṣamāsaṃgohikāhariṇīṃtathā jalajematsya
māṃsecagaṃdhakemāṃsamevaca nānāvyaṃjanadugdhānivaṃjanānimadhūnica īṣaddagdhaṃghṛtenāktaṃ
niśāyāṃdivasepivā baliṃdadyādviśeṣeṇakṛṣṇapakṣeśubhedinechāgīdaṃtebhavedvāgmīmatsyai
rdattaiḥkavirdhruvam mahiṣedhanavṛddhiḥsyātsarvasiddhiranuttamā lalāṭahastahṛdayaśirovakṣastumadhyataḥ

pṛ0 87ba) chāgīdaṃtebhavedvāgmīmatsyairdattaiḥkavirdhruvam mahiṣedhanavṛddhiḥsyātsarvasiddhiranu
ttamā lalāṭahastahṛdayaśirovakṣastumadhyataḥsvadahedrudhiredaṃtevaradehivāparaḥ
svarādānenadeveśimahāyogīśvarobhavet rātraupraharayāmārdhepūjārthaṃbalimāha
ret paṃcopacāradravyāṇisasurāṇiprayatnataḥ guḍārdrakarasenaivasurātravrāhmaṇasyaca
gauḍīneyākṣattriyeṇamādhvīvaiśyenatatratu kadalīphalasaṃmiśraśāṇatvaksarasaiḥsurāḥ
śūdreṇātrapradātavyādeyāvainaivasaṃspṛśet surātutrinidhādevidhādevīsphāṭikīḍā
kinītathā kāṣṇikīcātravaidānedhanavṛddhiranuttamā ḍākinīdānamaṃtreṇasarvavaśyo
bhaveddhruvam kārṣṇikīsurayādeviyorcayetparameśvarīm guṭikāṃjanastaṃbhādimāra
ṇoccāṭanādibhiḥ mahāsiddhīśvarobhūtvāvasatkalpāyutaṃdivi arghedattaimaheśāni
mahāsiddhiranuttamā raktacaṃdanavilvādijayākuṃmavajjalaiḥ arghaṃdadyānmaheśānisarva
kāmārthasiddhaye jayākumārī suśītalajalaiḥvāpikastūrīkuṃkumānvitaiḥ mūla
maṃtreṇadeveśiākṛṣyanirmayaḥśuciḥ arghaṃdatvāviśeṣeṇacarkravātenapūjitaṃ kumārī
pūjanaṃśaktonārīsvapnepinasmaret tāprapātrekapālīvāśmaśānekāṣṭanirmite śa
nibhaumadinevāpiśarāvemṛtsumudbhave svarṇeropyethalehivācakramarcyevidhānataḥ yu

pṛ0 88a) ṣpāṇyapitathādadyāduktakṛṣṇasitānica śvetaṃraktaṃjapāpuṣpaṃkaravīraṃtathāpriye ḍagaraṃmalli
kājātīmālatīyūthikāta dusthūrāśākabakulaśvetakṛṣṇāparājitāḥbakapuṣpaṃbila
pattraṃcaṇyakaṃnāgakesaram ragikājhivikākāṃcīraktaṃyatparikīrtitam arkapuṣpaṃ
